[4245]={"'Lúkhag flew off not too long ago -- and where is Aighrig? This doesn't bode well.'\
\
Rékkur patiently listens to your account of what happened before reading through the report you found.\
\
'Why does Aighrig require such secrecy? Though I suppose we can only wait for her....\
\
'The Orcs had a hand in Gáfin's death, and now the Angmarim might have too. Gáfin, my old friend, what did you get yourself into?'","Upon defeating Uflúk, you found a report among his belongings.\
\
Discussing this report with Aighrig may reveal something.","Talk to Aighrig","Deliver the report to Rékkur","'This report details the health of bats under Angmarim care. They are raising and training bats for the Orcs -- perhaps this is what Gáfin discovered....'\
\
A troubled expression falls upon Aighrig's face.\
\
'The one who wrote this report is someone named... Latharn. ${PLAYER}, I recognize that name -- it belongs to an Angmarim who is an accomplished beast-tamer. But that is all I know.\
\
'I believe I know where the Angmarim are raising their bats. May I ask you to bring this report to Rékkur? I am sorry, but I must investigate alone.'","Rékkur awaits your return at Annâk-khurfu, to the east of Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Aighrig has asked you to bring the report to him.","With few clues as to what Gáfin discovered before he died, hunting down the Orc commander Uflúk for information may be the next best option.","Use war horn and defeat Uflúk","A report lies crumpled among Uflúk's belongings","The Orc camp Zarkul-sulûn is located west of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
Aighrig believes that Uflúk can be lured out if you find a war horn to use in the camp.","'I was just feeding Lúkhag. She has been very brave lately. But yes, I would be happy to aid you in your hunt.\
\
'I do not think a commander such as Uflúk will be caught off-guard wandering around. There must be a war horn in the Orc camp that we can use to trick him into emerging.'","Show Aighrig the report","Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side","Rékkur has suggested bringing Aighrig with you to the Orc camp.\
\
Aighrig stands before the stairs to Annâk-khurfu.","Digging Deeper","'Maybe we'll learn something if we set our sights higher.\
\
'It's clear that Gáfin was killed by Orcs. According to the scouts, the Orc Uflúk commands the camp Zarkul-sulûn, to the west. If anyone has the information Gáfin was trying to bring back, it would be Uflúk.\
\
'But I wouldn't ask for you to venture forth alone. This could be another chance for Aighrig to prove herself to us, if she is willing!'"},
[4246]={"Has recogido leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Céolflad is in the refugees' cave in northern Byre Tor.\
\
You should bring the firewood to Céolflad.","'This'll do nice, ${PLAYER}. We'll keep Ránmald warm until she's out of danger.\
\
'Now go help the other refugees! If they ran into the Balewood, they'll need it....'","Bring the firewood to Céolflad","Recoge leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Céolflad, a healer, has vowed to ensure that Ránmald can deliver her child amongst friends and helpers. She has asked that plenty of firewood be collected to get the women ready for digging into their new temporary home.","'Don't ye worry no more, ${PLAYER}. We were petty before, but there's a child coming, and we're women of Byre Tor. I've delivered plenty of babies; Ránmald is in good hands.\
\
'Well, since we'll be settlin' in for a while until mother and child are fit to walk far, I'll be needing some firewood to get us started.\
\
'See if the other ladies need anything for our stay, and then ye must go and continue yer heroism in the rest of Wildermore, so we can get home again.'","Firewood can be found around clusters of trees in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should collect firewood so that the women can comfortably settle into their new temporary home.","Digging In"},
[4247]={"Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna","'A history of Adagím? The pestilence? Well you have come to the right place. Yes, I remember reading something about that quite recently.\
\
'I am quite busy here in the Kalmakhíla, however. There is so much to do. We need to bring fresh plants for our flower beds. As you can see, they are totally barren. It will never do.\
\
'Wait. I had a brilliant idea. You gather the plants and repot them here, and I will look for information on, what was it again? The Pale Blight. In Adagím. Yes, yes, I think I have just the thing. The blue plants, out the north gate. They grow on the hillsides just outside the city. Bring back six - no eight - of them. That should spruce this wing up nicely.'","Digging Up Knowledge","Plant the harvested flowers within the Kalmakhíla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Planted harvested flowers within the Kalmakhíla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, friend. I really did not want to do any gardening this week. I was quite dreading that.\
\
'You were asking about the Pale Blight, yes? I have some information from some tomes I gathered whilst you were attending to the garden. The Kintai are our best source of knowledge for the plight of Adagím. They are reclusive, but our Pohâni have travelled throughout Adagím and Shagâna to document their history and beliefs.\
\
'Several accounts in this \\qHistory of Adagím\\q mention the Ordâkhai. These Kintai mention Sívigush, some sort of monster or legendary beast, but others blame the coming Ordâkhai who managed somehow to dry the rivers and dam up naturally flowing waters near Adagím. This resulted in Adagím becoming much more marsh and swamp-like, as waters from nearby lakes and ponds overstrode their bounds. Without the rivers to sweep them through, they festered, creating bogs where previously the land had been green and rich with forests.\
\
'The Ordâkhai likely had a hand in creating the conditions for this Pale Blight. I know not how to improve the situation in Adagím, but the forces of Ordâkh ensconced in Emax Dûl may have more answers.'","Created raised beds for the flowers within the Kalmakhíla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","The Pohâni Têredal has knowledge of the Pale Blight, but needs your help completing some of his tasks whilst he conducts research for you.","Create raised beds for the flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Retrieve the flowers from outside Zajâna that the Pohâni Têredal mentioned.","Watered the planted flowers in the flower bed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Create raised beds for the flowers within the Kalmakhíla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Retrieved flowers from outside Zajâna (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Water the planted flowers in the flower bed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla and report on your success.","Gather water from the bucket near the planted flowers","Water the planted flowers in the flower bed within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Return to the Pohâni Têredal in the Kalmakhíla","'Those are perfect. Put them in the central bed, just over there. You'll want to create a little rounded mound of dirt for each of them, then place them in the centre and give them a sprinkle of water.\
\
'I will continue with this research in the meantime.'","Retrieve flowers from outside Zajâna (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather water from the bucket near the planted flowers in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","Plant the harvested flowers in the holes you've dug within the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna."},
[4248]={"'¡Cuanto más tiempo te quedes aquí, más cavan los orcos! ¡Muévete!'","Los orcos están cavando en Hielo Caído, al noroeste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Raskwith te pidió que detuvieras a los orcos que están intentando cavar a través de la avalancha en Hielo Caído.","Habla con Raskwith en Mekhem-bizru","Derrota a los orcos en Hielo Caído (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los orcos son más astutos de lo que podrías pensar. Viajar desde Eregion hasta aquí en el Valle a través de los túneles de Khazad-dûm puede llevar días, incluso cuando sabes a dónde vas. Pasar por la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo es mucho más rápido, especialmente cuando llevas cargas grandes y pesadas.\
\
'Mazog ha enviado una compañía de orcos a Hielo Caído, al noroeste de aquí. Están intentando cavar a través de la ira del Caradhras.\
\
'No se les puede permitir un segundo camino a través de la montaña. Dirígete allí y detén sus esfuerzos.'","Cavando al Oeste","Orcos derrotados en Hielo Caído (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raskwith se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al sureste de Hielo Caído.\
\
Raskwith estará encantado de saber que los esfuerzos de los orcos han sido interrumpidos.","'Mazog tendrá que recurrir a las profundidades para sus viajes ahora. Aunque siempre las ha tenido, es más fácil para nosotros detenerlo cuando solo tiene una ruta.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}, por tu ayuda.'","Los orcos de Moria están intentando cavar a través de la avalancha que bloquea la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo y acceder a Eregion."},
[4249]={"Los extraños montículos de tierra se encuentran al norte del campamento de Mincham, en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes excavar en las extrañas pilas de tierra.","Cava en los montículos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Tesoro descubierto! (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La excavación fue una tarea peligrosa en tierra agitada y corrompida, pero has descubierto algunos objetos de valor. Tus esfuerzos te han traído riqueza.","Excava en los montículos","Has encontrado algunas extrañas reliquias en tu exploración de los Campos de Fornost","Completado","Excavando en busca de reliquias","Como Colbert el Loco indicó, has encontrado unos extraños montículos de tierra durante tu exploración de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes excavar y buscar si hay algo que valga la pena encontrar enterrado en este extraño terreno."},
[4250]={"Encuentra el túmulo de Taradan","'Antes de mi viaje a las Quebradas de los Túmulos, hice algunas lecturas para aprender sobre la zona. Aprendí sobre los túmulos de tres hombres de Cardolan: Taradan, Orron y Ringdor. Seguramente me gustaría haber encontrado alguna evidencia para conservar de mi viaje a esos lugares.\
\
'Intenta excavar en la entrada de esos túmulos. Creo que se encuentran en la zona noreste de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
'Aquí, toma esta pequeña piqueta. La punta ha sido embotada, así que tu excavación no debería causar ningún daño a los fragmentos de saber que descubras.'","Encuentra el túmulo de Orron","Lleva los fragmentos de saber a Tobold Cortahoja","Excavando en la tierra","Los estudios que Tobold Cortahoja realizó en la biblioteca de Bree le dieron a entender algunos de los secretos que guardan las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Su preocupación crece con cada nuevo descubrimiento dentro de los túmulos.","'Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¿Tienes los fragmentos de saber de las Quebradas de los Túmulos que te pedí?'","'¿Has descubierto algo ya? Toma la pequeña piqueta que te di y excava en la entrada de los túmulos del norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
'¡Quizá descubrir cómo estas tierras se infestaron de tumularios pueda ayudar a Bree en el futuro!'","Los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor se encuentran en el norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Tobold Cortahoja te ha dicho que excaves en la entrada de los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor. Para ayudarte en la excavación, te ha dado una pequeña piqueta. Esta herramienta te ayudará a evitar dañar los fragmentos de saber que puedas descubrir.","Tobold Cortahoja te espera entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Tu excavación en los túmulos de Taradan, Orron y Ringdor ha descubierto tres fragmentos de saber, escritos en trozos de pergamino. Deberías llevar estos fragmentos a Tobold Cortahoja.","Recoge fragmentos de saber (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Encuentra el túmulo de Ringdor","'¡Me alegra que hayas regresado! ¡Estaba preocupado de haberte enviado a la muerte! Ahora, déjame ver los fragmentos de saber que has traído.\
\
'Estos pergaminos son inquietantes. Parecen haber sido escritos por hombres de Cardolan. Hablan de un reino que cayó en ruinas y de los que quedaron, que sucumbieron a una gran peste. Pero eso es todo.\
\
'Esto no explica por qué criaturas tan horribles llegaron a las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Me temo que estos fragmentos solo han generado más preguntas y pocas respuestas.'","Fragmentos de saber recogidos (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[4251]={"Ningêna has asked you to go to Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade in Ambarûl, and defeat some of the soldiers there.","Derrota a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Ningêna","Derrotaste a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You defeated their soldiers and look none the worse for wear. Well done ${PLAYER}!'","'It would be good of you to visit the Ordâkhai camp and remind them that we are not weak. Defeat some of the Ordâkhai soldiers at Khetsok and return to me.'","'If Girhâzi sent you to help us, who am I to argue? Welcome to Sûru. Here we camp not only to maintain control of the crossing, but we are also building a permanent outpost. From here we can keep watch upon both the crossing and the roads. The road going south-east is blocked by a landslide currently, but that will not always be so. People are working to clear it.\
\
'The Ordâkhai test our defences almost daily. They have their bivouac across the river, and though we hold the bridge itself, they watch upon the road from the other side, so we still cannot truly use it. We will need to clear them out in time, but for now, we are content to hold this ground with minimal losses and make progress on our fortress. Or we were, anyway, before hearing your news that they were frustrated enough to try destroying the floating bridge.\
\
'It would seem that the time of action is upon us. My best Dumûri are resting after a skirmish that lasted long into the night. You appear to be a talented warrior. If you think yourself capable it would be good of you to visit the Ordâkhai camp across the bridge and remind them that we are not weak.'","The Ordâkhai maintain an encampment on the south side of the Wrackwade, from which they launch attacks at the Dumûri of Sûru.","Diminishing the Enemy","You have defeated Ordâkhai soldiers at Khetsok, the Ordâkhai camp on the south side of the Wrackwade. You should return to Ningêna at Sûru."},
[4252]={"Defeated elhudan at the Slade of Shadows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Among the fell spirits I noticed amid the trees of the Slade of Shadows, I saw many of the wisps the Dunlendings call elhudan. These spirits are perhaps the least of the Dark Lord's minions, but in large numbers, they may prove dangerous still.\
\
'As you investigate the Slade of Shadows, take some time to banish the elhudan... they must lead no one else to their doom.'","Defeat elhudan at the Slade of Shadows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Elhudan may be found within the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position.\
\
Andreg has instructed you to defeat elhudan at the Slade of Shadows.","Dimming the Lights","The Slade of Shadows appears to be a focal point for the evil that is growing within the Gravenwood."},
[4254]={"Dagrun can be found in the Master's manor.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","Talk to Orgrand","'Well met! I am Hoskuld of Durin's Folk, here by King Thorin III's orders to make sure Erebor's interests are known to the Lake-town Elders.\
\
'I will be truthful with you, ${PLAYER}. We have heard some rumblings of dissent and talk of Lake-town seceding from the Kingdom of Dale! That is absolutely not something we dwarves want, as both Dale and Lake-town are important in the greater trade network! I will make sure these Men understand that secession cannot happen if they want to keep receiving goods from the Lonely Mountain!'","Now that the Lake-town Smugglers are no longer a threat, it is time to consider the empty position of Master. Join Dagrun as she prepares for an important dinner.","'Mae govannen, friend. I am Maeriel, ambassador of the Woodland realm, sent to make sure the King's interests are represented in the election of the new Master. All the peoples of this region, whether they be Elf, dwarf, or Man, are connected. We must make sure the Elders of Lake-town remember this. We will talk more tonight.'","'Who are you, and why are you interrupting my work? Oh, yes, you're Dagrun's guest for the dinner. Hmph. I don't know what all the fuss is about, you seem awfully common to me. Yes, yes, I will see you tonight. Go away now, I'm very busy.'","'Oh, hello there. Dear, we have a guest.'","'I can hardly believe this is real, ${PLAYER}. So many killed right in front of our eyes. And then, I was named Master! I believe it will take some time to digest everything that just happened, but time is something I can no longer afford to lose. I must rise to this challenge and lead the people of Lake-town. I will not let my home be plunged into chaos in the wake of all this.\
\
'I don't think this is over, either. The murderer could not have acted alone. Someone is trying to cause strife in the Kingdom of Dale. Please, keep your eyes open, and be careful.'","Frekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld can be found in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Frekur, Orgrand, Rikolf, Maeriel, and Hoskuld.","Complete: The Deadly Dinner","'I didn't think you would get anything else out of Skótmun, but it was worth a try. We know more than enough to lock him away for a long time. Now I have something else to speak to you about, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The Elders will choose the next Master tonight. Everyone considered for the position is invited to a feast. I have just received my invitation, and it says here that I can bring one guest. I would like that guest to be you.\
\
'Oh, I know about you, ${PLAYER}. World-traveller, war hero, known to the Kings of Rohan and Gondor, known to the Elves of Mirkwood, Rivendell, Lórien, and the Dwarves of Erebor! Friend of Wizards! All of that aside, you have aided us in bringing the most notorious villain in Lake-town to justice! Yes, you will be a very impressive guest, indeed.\
\
'Before the event, I suggest you go around town and meet the others who are being considered as the next Master. I believe they are Frekur, Orgrand, and Rikolf. Oh, there will be an ambassador from the Elves and one from the dwarves present as well. Once you are done, meet me at the Manor. Wear something fitting for the occasion!'","'What have we here? I don't believe we've been introduced, friend. I am Orgrand, a humble servant of the people. Ah, you're Dagrun's guest for tonight, aren't you? My, you must have some wonderful tales to tell! Oh, but save them for tonight. I'm afraid I am already late for my appearance at the brand new orphanage, dedicated to those lost when the Easterlings attacked. Good to meet you, the pleasure was mine!'","Talk to Frekur","Habla con Maeriel","Talk to Dagrun","'Ready to go inside?'","Talk to Rikolf","Talk to Hoskuld","Dinner at the Manor","Dagrun is waiting for you near the Master's manor.\
\
You should talk to Dagrun.","'There you are - and right on time. I must thank you again for accepting my offer. The folk we dine with tonight think highly of themselves and highly of their stations. Such airs are not to my taste, but it will not do to offend. No, we must smile and nod. Are those your best garments? Then let us get on with this.'"},
[4255]={"'Este agujero es agradable y acogedor, ¡o lo será después de que ayude a mi hermana a temrinar de decorarlo! No creías que ya había terminado, ¿no? Madre mía.'\
\
Le preguntas a Esmeralda si ha participado en competiciones de baile últimamente.\
\
'No, la verdad es que no. En casa dejaron de celebrarse tan a menudo porque ganaba yo siempre, ¿sabes? Pensé en ir disfrazada, pero todas las capas que me probaba se me enredaban en los pies y no era lo mismo.\
\
'Pero ahora que lo mencionas, me pregunto si hay algunos concursos de baile aquí en la Comarca Allende. Aquí no me conocerían...'\
\
La voz de Esmeralda se apaga, sumida en sus pensamientos.","¡Dinodas está siendo molestado por hobbits entrometidos de la Comarca Allende!","Dinodas en apuros","Prisca tiene una pregunta para ti. Está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, esperando que empiece la fiesta de inauguración.","'Angélica, ¿que pasa?'","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (2/3)","Habla con Dinodas Boffin en la calle Aguamiel","'¡Con tantos hermanos, es extraño que tenga un día para mí, ${PLAYER}! ¡Me agrada mucho que estés aquí para compartirlo conmigo!'","Dinodas está siendo molestado por hobbits entrometidos de la Comarca Allende.","Habla con Prisca Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","¡De repente, Angélica grita alarmada!","'¡Creo que me equivoqué con la dirección de la nueva casa de Angélica, ${PLAYER}! Hubiera jurado por lo más sagrado que mi madre me dijo que la dirección era el nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel, ¡pero resulta que mi hermana en realidad compró el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel! ¡Esto es un desastre!\
'¿Que por qué? ¡Porque le dije al Elfo pintor que conocí que pintara ESTA casa, y no ESA! ¡Angélica va a abrir nuestro regalo de inauguración para su casa y verá el error al instante! Cuando desenvuelva el regalo y vea una cuadro de la casa del vecino... ¡se quedará horrorizada! No he preparado el MEJOR regalo de inauguración de todos los tiempos... ¡sino el PEOR!\
\
'Tienes que ayudarme a retrasar la apertura de regalos, ${PLAYER}. Ve directo a casa de Angélica y dispersa a mis hermanos a los cuatro vientos. No debería ser difícil, ¡pasa más a menudo de lo que crees! Solo dile a Griffo que dan comida gratis en algún sitio, a Esmeralda que hay un concurso de baile muy reñido y hazle saber a Caléndula que hay trasgos o algo peligroso acechando en el horizonte. No sirve de nada intentar que Camelia se vaya... siempre sigue las reglas. Aun así, ¡con tres hermanos dispersos bastarán para retrasar la fiesta hasta que sepamos qué hacer! ¡Rápido, rápido! ¡No hay tiempo que perder!'","Asegúrate que los hobbits","Habla con Angélica Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Angélica te ha pedido que salgas y averigües si sus hermanos planean volver a su fiesta.","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (1/3)","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (3/3)","Dinodas podría haber cometido un error, y necesita tu ayuda para arreglarlo.","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (0/3)","'¡${PLAYER}! ¡Ayuda!'","'Mmm... Me pregunto...'","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Siempre había oído que los hobbits de Allende eran peculiares y huraños, pero esta gente parece tener un hambre de cotilleos... ¡especialmente cuando ven que alguien está en apuros y no quiere saber nada de ellos!\
\
'¡Tengo buenas noticias, sin embargo! He visto a Berilac y a Fosco de camino hacia aquí, y les he dicho que la fiesta se ha retrasado unas horas y que se busquen un sitio donde que esperar. ¡Eso nos dará a los dos tiempo suficiente para resolver esta difícil situación!'","Hobbits entrometidos reprendidos (2/3)","Habla con Esmeralda Boffin dentro del nº 8 de Honeymead Lane","¡De repente, Angélica está consternada! Está dentro de su nueva casa, el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, pero algo le ha disgustado.","Habla con Griffo Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","'¡Madre, lo han vuelto a hacer! Se han marchado todos y se supone que este era mi gran día, y ahora van a estropearlo... ¡como siempre hacen!\
\
¡${PLAYER}! ¿Puedes salir y ver si van a volver? Se supone que iba ser una fiesta para mí, y ahora mis hermanos acaban de marcharse sin un adiós ni un buen deseo?'\
\
Angélica da una patada al suelo.\
\
'¡Siempre están haciendo esto, ${PLAYER}. Es peor que pastorear gatos... porque eso es una delicia, ¡y esto NO!'","'Sí, alguien debería hacer algo...'","Los hobbits entrometidos se marchan... de momento.","Los hobbits entrometidos se marchan indignados... pero volverán","'¿Crees que Angélica servirá algo de comida pronto? ¡No sería una fiesta sin aperitivos!'\
\
Le dices a Griffo que no sabes con seguridad cómo está el tema de la comida por aquí, pero los mercados de la Comarca Allende están bien abastecidos por las granjas de la Cuaderna del Oeste del Norte.\
\
'Sí... probablemente allí pueda encontrar más variedad...' murmura Griffo para sí.","'¿Puedes ir fuera y ver si van a volver?'","Dinodas está agradecido de que hayas conseguido que los hobbits entrometidos le dejen en paz.","'Mmm... déjame pensar...'","'¿Ha llegado ya el resto de mis chicos, ${PLAYER}? Fosco y Berilac deberían estar ya aquí. Espero que no se distraigan con las vistas del camino... ¡o que Berilac no haya encontrado un lugar cómodo donde echar una siesta!\
\
'¿Crees que podrías...'","Dile a los hobbits entrometidos que no molesten a Dinodas (1/3)","Habla con Caléndula Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel","Abres la boca para sugerir que Caléndula deje la fiesta para ir en busca de aventuras, pero antes de que puedas decir nada, te interrupe.\
'Creo que podría haber trasgos por aquí,' dice, y asientes con la cabeza.\
\
'Alguien debería hacer algo...' dice, con la mirada ya fija en la puerta.","Griffo, Esmeralda y Caléndula han entrado en el nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel.\
\
Dinodas, desesperado por la proecupación, te ha encargadao que disperses a sus hermanos para retrasar la apertura del regalo de inaguración de la casa de Angélica.","Sal fuera y comprueba si los hermanos de Angélica planean volver","Tienes que ayudarme a retrasar la apertura de los regalos, ${PLAYER}. Ve directo a casa de Angélica y dispersa a mis hermanos a los cuatro vientos. No debería ser difícil, ¡pasa más a menudo de lo que crees! Solo dile a Griffo que dan comida gratis en algún sitio, a Esmeralda que hay un concurso de baile muy reñido y hazle saber a Caléndula que hay trasgos o algo peligroso acechando en el horizonte. ¡Seguro que funciona! Entonces tendremos tiempo suficiente para pensar en cómo solucionar este error. ¡Rápido, rápido! ¡No hay tiempo que perder!'"},
[4257]={"Travelled to the Folde Farm","Talk to Witgil","The Folde Farm can be found just north of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Arcil has asked you to travel to the Folde Farm and warn them of the potential of Orc-attacks.","Talk to Arcil","'${PLAYER}, I must confess that I am glad you agree with me. I know that Éothain resents me because I am not his cousin Éomer, and he has every right to; however, I do not wish to lose the support of my people. They respect you, and your loyalty will encourage them.\
\
'For now, we must alert the Folde Farm about the danger that these Orcs present. Please, go there now and warn them.'","Arcil and Éothain could not reach an agreement as to which Orc-tribe posed the greatest threat and left the decision in your hands.","'Thank you for warning the Folde Farm. The food produced there is very important to Aldburg and needs to be safe-guarded.\
\
'While I was content to stand guard here, I think it is time that we learn exactly what we are faced with. We need to find out truly how dangerous this threat is.'","Travel to the Folde Farm","Witgil is somewhere at the Folde Farm.\
\
Now that you have arrived at the Folde Farm, you should seek out and speak with Witgil.","'I had heard of a recent Orc-attack nearby, but I thought that it might have been an isolated incident and not something to concern myself with too much. This is very troubling news.\
\
'I will alert everyone here; however, Athelbald is out collecting boar-meat. I hope that he makes it back safely.'","Dire Threat","Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg to the south of Folde Farm.\
\
You have alerted the people at the Folde Farm about the Orc-threat and should now return to Arcil."},
[4258]={"'${PLAYER}, I must confess that I am glad you agree with me. Arcil is threatened by me because he sits as regent for my cousin, Éomer, and is but a shadow of the Reeve that he is.\
\
'For now, we must alert the Folde Farm about the danger that these Orcs present. Please, go there now and warn them.'","Travelled to the Folde Farm","Talk to Witgil","Arcil and Éothain could not reach an agreement as to which Orc-tribe posed the greatest threat and left the decision in your hands.","'Thank you for warning the Folde Farm. The food produced there is very important to Aldburg and needs to be safe-guarded.\
\
'While I was content to stand guard here, I think it is time that we learn exactly what we are faced with. We need to find out truly how dangerous this threat is.'","Travel to the Folde Farm","Witgil is somewhere at the Folde Farm.\
\
Now that you have arrived at the Folde Farm, you should seek out and speak with Witgil.","The Folde Farm can be found just north of Aldburg.\
\
Éothain has asked you to travel to the Folde Farm and warn them of the potential of Orc-attacks.","'I had heard of a recent Orc-attack nearby, but I thought that it might have been an isolated incident and not something to concern myself with too much. This is very troubling news.\
\
'I will alert everyone here; however, Athelbald is out collecting boar-meat. I hope that he makes it back safely.'","Dire Threat","Éothain is near the entrance of Aldburg to the south of Folde Farm.\
\
You have alerted the people at the Folde Farm about the Orc-threat and should now return to Éothain.","Talk to Éothain"},
[4259]={"'Word has recently arrived from Garrun that our scouts have discovered that the caverns beneath the Isendale are much more extensive than previously thought. They run west beneath Dol Baran and north to Nan Curunír. Hopefully, Saruman will deal with the beasts, but in the event they prove too overwhelming, our people must be warned.\
\
'Bring word to Ardwyn at Forthbrond, ${PLAYER}. He will know what to do.'","Word has arrived from Garrun that Rohirrim scouts have discovered that the caverns beneath the Isendale are much more extensive than previously thought.","Dire Warnings","Ardwyn is at Forthbrond, far to the north of Innoth's camp.\
\
Innoth instructed you to bring news of the Orc-caverns to Ardwyn.","'These words are among the most terrifying you could bring to me, ${PLAYER}. We must warn Grimbold at the Ford of Isen and send word to Théodred at once!'","Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond","'Speak with Ardwyn at once, ${PLAYER}!'"},
[4261]={"Defeated the leader of the enemies within Direnfirel","Defeat the leader of the enemies within Direnfirel","'I was right. Saws and axes do not hurt small ones. Curious.'","Quickbeam has asked you to destroy the leader of the enemy force.","Talk to Quickbeam","You gather your things and prepare to travel to Direnfirel.","Direnfirel: Guide of the Wooded River-bank","You should return to Quickbeam and inform him of your success.\
\
Quickbeam can be found at Derndingle.","'Saruman has destroyed much of Fangorn. Even now, the remnants of his forces still operate a mill, chopping and cutting more of my friends. I dare not approach, for it would quickly destroy me. But you are not made of wood and saws should not hurt you.\
\
'Speak to me again and I will show you how to reach Direnfirel.'","Along the banks of the Swiftwater is the small lumber-milling settlement of Direnfirel, near Middlemead. Since the evacuation of Edoras not many were left to defend the settlement and it has fallen to the enemy."},
[4263]={"Derrota orcos en Cirith Nûr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Andreg se encuentra en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, al sur de Cirith Nûr.\
\
El campamento orco estaba repleto de poderosos orcos, y en el centro del campamento había una cueva excavada en el acantilado. Debes regresar con Andreg con tu informe.","Trabajo sucio: Matanza de orcos","¿Una cueva excavada en la cara del acantilado, dices? Todo tiene sentido ahora, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'¡Debe ser hacia donde se dirige Helechal!'","Orcos derrotados en Cirith Nûr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encontrarás orcos acampados en Cirith Nûr, en el lado oeste del Camino Verde, al norte del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que intentaras desbaratar a los orcos en su campamento en Cirith Nûr.","Habla con Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","'Encontrarás el campamento orco en Cirith Nûr, al oeste del Camino Verde, hacia el norte. Dirígete allí y derrota a los orcos en un intento por quebrar su voluntad.'","'Los exploradores que eliminaste solo fueron los primeros de muchos enemigos que han entrado en las Tierras de Bree desde las Quebradas del Norte. Esperaba que el mensaje que entregaste fuera lo bastante claro para obligar a algunos orcos a retroceder hacia el norte, pero se han organizado bien y han construido un fuerte en el lado occidental del Camino Verde. Necesitamos expulsarlos de esa zona lo antes posible.\
\
'Deberás viajar al norte otra vez, me temo, esta vez cruzando el Camino Verde y buscando el campamento orco llamado Cirith Nûr. Ataca el corazón de las fuerzas orcas allí, y quizá logremos quebrar su voluntad.'","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte."},
[4264]={"Alarmas de Fil Gashan desactivadas (${VALUE}/8)","Habla con Vagun en Anazârmekhem","Desactivando alarmas","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","Desactiva las alarmas de Fil Gashan (${VALUE}/8)","'Desactivar esas alarmas ayudará a reducir la respuesta de los otros orcos dentro de Fil Gashan y, con suerte, frustrará cualquier posibilidad que tengan de establecer algún tipo de ruta de mensajes para su ejército de guerra.\
\
'Ve a Fil Gashan e intenta destruir esas alarmas. Puedes encontrarlo al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.'","'¡Era hora de que recibiéramos ayuda! Los orcos se están reuniendo y pronto estarán listos para salir de este lugar. Entramos a Fil Gashan solo una vez y nos escondimos en el fondo, cubiertos con armaduras que podrían pasar por hechas por los orcos. Los escuchamos hablar y vimos las campanas gigantes que usan como alarmas.\
\
'Ponen centinelas cerca de las campanas... tienen un buen sentido del olfato, esos orcos, también ven bastante bien. Sin embargo, las alarmas tienen una falla: puedes quitar los pasadores de las piezas centrales y hacerlas caer al suelo sin hacer ruido.\
\
'Así que esa es la tarea que te asigno. Entra a Fil Gashan, ubicado al suroeste de Anazârmekhem, e intenta desactivar las alarmas allí. Ten cuidado, puede que no siempre tengas éxito, pero el intento debe hacerse.'","Fil Gashan se encuentra al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Vagun te indicó que intentaras desactivar las enormes campanas de alarma que los orcos han colocado en todo Fil Gashan. Mencionó que las centinelas son buenos para detectar a cualquiera que no sea de su especie.","Vagun se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
Intentaste desactivar varias de las alarmas. Aunque no siempre tuviste éxito, como Vagun había advertido, el intento es más importante que el éxito.","'Excelente. Sin esas alarmas, estoy seguro de que tuviste un tiempo más fácil dentro de Fil Gashan que nosotros.\
\
'Buen trabajo.'"},
[4265]={"Free frost-tusks from hitching posts in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hah! That's what those Orcs get for trying to break a frost-tusk!\
\
'No matter how well-trained they might seem, a frost-tusk never truly answers to anyone but itself! Now... it is true that there are some awfully wicked frost-tusks, but I knew these weren't that sort. It's in their eyes, after all!\
\
'Very good, my friend.'","Rádek can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have freed several frost-tusks from their hitching posts at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should return to Rádek.","Freed frost-tusks from hitching posts in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Disagreeable Beasts","Frost-tusks can be found hitched to posts in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
Rádek has asked you to free frost-tusks from their hitching posts in an attempt to sow discord at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","'Zhúdo sent you, did he? I assure you... I have my task well in hand.\
\
'You have fought beside the Commander before, haven't you? Glóin's tasks are wise in the way of war, and I mean him no disrespect, but he does not think like a Zhélruka.\
\
'I have learned much of the forces at the encampments here before the old gates. I have marked every weakness in their defences, noted every loose stone on the steps of Gundabad, but such things are obvious to those who wish to see them. No, to think like a Zhélruka would mean to see the Orcs' misplaced trust in their own beasts!\
\
'The frost-tusks these Orcs keep are proud, mighty beasts... not mere pets! They have been trained well enough, but they would sooner wander off without those posts tying them down. And that is the way of the Zhélruka!\
\
'Free these frost-tusks from their would-be masters and we shall see if they truly wish to serve Gorgar!'","Gorgar the Ruthless keeps many curious beasts in his thrall. Among them, the frost-tusks possess size and might beyond that of any mere Orc, but they are reluctant to be stabled.","Talk to Rádek"},
[4266]={"Found pieces of burned notes","Disappearing Goods","Return to Bâzadur","Investigated the supplies in Ashâgir (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Found signs of crates that were removed","Bâzadur has asked you to look for additional clues around the hideout in Ashâgir.","Return to Bâzadur with the information you have gathered from your investigation in Ashâgir.","Return to Bâzadur and inform him of what you found while searching the supplies.","Search for a hideout near Ningûdu","Bâzadur suggests you investigate a hideout they know of down near Ningûdu, as there may be more clues to the whereabouts of the supplies there.","Look for clues at the nearby shelters","Look for clues at the nearby rubble","Recover the stolen supplies at the hideout in Ningûdu, near Ashâgir.","Look for clues near the supply cart","Found scraps of cloth used to cover the supplies","'Ah, hello there. I see that you have found your way up to Ashâgir, ${CLASS}. I am Bâzadur, the leader of this small group.\
\
'This is fortunate timing for your arrival. If you are willing, there is a problem here that needs an outsider's help.\
\
'We have but few resources left here so we must make everything last. Unfortunately, some of our supplies have gone missing, and no one will say a word.\
\
'Would you investigate this matter for me in secret until we know more? I suggest you start by checking the supplies themselves for any clues as to who the thief might be. You can find the supplies nearby in the camp.'","Return to Bâzadur in Ashâgir","Return the recovered supplies to Bâzadur in the hideout in the Ashâgir camp.","Investigate the corpse found at the hideout in Ningûdu, near Ashâgir, for the missing supplies.","Found the hideout near Ningûdu","Recupera las provisiones robadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Investigate the supplies in Ashâgir (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Provisiones robadas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have returned. Did you find any new information about the missing supplies?'\
\
You tell Bâzadur about your discoveries around the camp.\
\
'Is that so? It seems our thief may have made away with our supplies, and it could have been anyone here. The burned notes lead me to believe they intend to sell our supplies for their own gain.\
\
'With the lift broken it would not be an easy task to take the supplies far from here. I know of a hideaway, down near Ningûdu at the bottom of these cliffs, near the water to the north-east. The area is overrun with foul kergrim, though this spot I speak of would be a perfect place to hide.\
\
'I ask that you go and investigate the hideout and see if you can learn anything more. If we cannot recover these supplies we may need to abandon this place.'","Bâzadur has asked for your help investigating the stolen supplies in Ashâgir. He has suggested inspecting the supplies themselves first to see if you can find out anything.","'Ah! You return in one piece. Have you found anything?'\
\
You give Bâzadur the supplies and describe the body of the thief you found. \
\
Bâzadur's expression turns to a frown.\
\
'The man you describe, it matches the description of Surdukas. It must have been him then who took our supplies. He wished to flee this place and this must have been his attempt to do so. He might have succeeded if the kergrim had not gotten to him first.\
\
'I will tell the others. Even though he stole from us, I am sorry for his fate. He was a friend. I thank you for all you have done for us this day.'","'Did you find out anything while investigating the supplies?'\
\
You tell Bâzadur what you found.\
\
'I see. Not much to learn from that, as expected. They could not have vanished!\
\
'Might I trouble you to check around for any other clues you might find in the camp? There must be something.'","Investigate the corpse","Returned the recovered supplies to Bâzadur","Identified the thief","Bâzadur needs your help discovering the cause of the supplies going missing from their camp in Ashâgir, and wants you to investigate."},
[4267]={"Recoge la tetera en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","'¿Qué es esto, ${PLAYER}?\
\
Le entregas la petición a Bingo y la lee rápidamente, pero en lugar de la cara abatida que esperabas, el hobbit sonríe ampliamente.\
\
'¡Bueno, mira esto! Myrtle Cenagales ha conseguido que hobbits de todo el vecindario firmen una petición para que me encierren en las CeldasAgujeros. ¡Qué cumplido tan maravilloso! ¡Mis vecinos se preocupan tanto por mí que están dispuestos a llegar a tal extremo para evitar que me vaya!\
\
'Tengo que hacer algo bonito por Myrtle, ${PLAYER}. ¿Puedes ir a la estatua de Marcho y Blanco en el centro del pueblo y recoger algunas de las flores que crecen allí para dárselas a Myrtle? Dile que recibí su mensaje alto y claro, ¡y que volveré tan pronto como pueda!\
\
'Tengo unos vecinos adorables. ¡Ahora me siento mal por haberles pedido prestadas sus cosas durante tanto tiempo sin devolvérselas!'","'Tuvimos una primavera muy lluviosa el año pasado, y me dediqué bastante a la jardinería. Planté un montón de flores en unos cuantos cubos, ¡pero cuando necesité otro ya estaban todos en uso!\
\
'Myrtle Cenagales fue tan amable de prestarme un cubo, y nunca se lo devolví. Si pudieras encargarte de devolvérselo te lo agradecería, ¡y estoy seguro de que ella también!'","'¡Escribiré OTRA petición! Esta tratará sobre... sobre otra cosa, ¡una cosa SERIA! ¡Ya verás!'","Merrimac acepta alegramente la tetera","El alcalde Pieblanco está fuera del Agujero Municipal, al sur del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Myrtle Cenagales no aprueba la aventura de Bingo, y ha presentado una petición para que lo encierren en las CeldasAgujeros. Te ha pedido que vayas a ver si el alcalde ya se ha pronunciado al respecto.","La desaprobación de Myrtle Cenagales","Myrtle resopla con orgullo, segura de que su petición tendrá éxito","Recoge el cubo en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","Merrimac Belinfante vive en el mismo barrio que Bingo en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestada una tetera a Merrimac Belinfante y quiere que se la devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","'No voy a tomar una decisión sobre esta petición. Si Myrtle Cenagales quiere impedir que Bingo Boffin deje la Comarca, ¡que lo encierre ella misma! Toma esta petición y entrégasela al señor Boffin, ¡porque yo no quiero tener nada que ver con esto!'","'¿Qué ha dicho Myrtle? ¡Espero que no echara mucho de menos su cubo!'","'Espero que me perdones por el desorden, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}. No he tenido muchas visitas últimamente, y me temo que está todo un poco desorganizado. Voy a preparar mis cosas, ¡y de paso limpiaré un poco!'\
\
Bingo frunce el ceño.\
\
'¿Sabes qué? Se me había olvidado hasta ahora, ¡pero he pedido prestados varios objetos a mis vecinos a lo largo de los años y nunca se los he devuelto! Debería devolver estos objetos antes de irme. Después de todo, ¡nunca se sabe lo que puede pasar en un viaje así!\
\
'Le pedí prestada ese ovillo de cordel a Poppy Ciñatiesa, que vive justo enfrente. ¿Te importaría devolvérselo, además de estos otros objetos prestados a mis otros vecinos?'","'Hace algún tiempo, le pedí prestada una tetera a uno de mis vecinos, Merrimac Belinfante, y te agradecería que se la devolvieras. ¡Debe estar por aquí, en algún lugar!'","Myrtle Cenagales está al este del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Has devuelto el cubo que Bingo le había pedido prestado a su vecina Myrtle, y ahora ella desea hablar contigo.","'¿Sí? ¿Cómo puedo ayudarte? Espero que sea algo rápido, porque llego tarde a cenar...'\
\
Le preguntas educadamente al alcalde si ha tomado una decisión sobre la petición presentada por Myrtle Cenagales, y él suspira.\
\
'¡Si hubiera sabido el tipo de quejas con las que tendría que lidiar como alcalde, nunca habría aceptado el cargo! ¡Haz esto! ¡No hagas aquello! ¡Evita que esta persona se vaya! ¡Haz que esta persona se vaya! ¡Es un ruido constante, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Supongo que las cenas compensan todo esto, ¡pero solo lo justo! No voy a tomar una decisión sobre esta petición. Si Myrtle Cenagales quiere impedir que Bingo Boffin deje la Comarca, ¡que lo encierre ella misma! Toma esta petición y entrégasela al señor Boffin, ¡porque yo no quiero tener nada que ver con esto!'","'Qué vecinos tan adorables tengo. ¡Ahora me siento mal por haberles pedido prestadas sus cosas durante tanto tiempo sin devolvérselas!\
\
'¿Qué ha dicho Myrtle?'","Myrtle Cenagales está fuera de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Le has entregado las flores a Myrtle como Bingo te lo había pedido, y no sabe cómo reaccionar.","Las flores brotan a menudo cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco, en el centro de Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que recojas algunas de las flores que crecen cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco y se las des a Myrtle Cenagales para darle las gracias por ser tan buena vecina.","'¡No me quedaré de brazos cruzados! He presentado una petición para que Bingo sea encerrado en las CeldasAgujeros y así evitar que emprenda esta estúpida aventura, ¡y muchos notables hobbits ya la han firmado! ¡Ve a hablar con el alcalde y averigua si ya se ha pronunciado al respecto!'","Habla con Myrtle Cenagales","Muestra la petición de Myrtle a Bingo en el interior de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande","Habla con Bingo en el interior de su agujero hobbit, en Cavada Grande","'Te doy las gracias de nuevo, ${PLAYER}. Me conmueve saber que Myrtle se preocupa tanto por mí, ¡y la echaré de menos! Pero ahora, si me disculpas, tengo que terminar de preparar mis cosas. ¡Pero el viaje ya está cerca!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Partir no es fácil' (Nivel recomendado: 12)</rgb>","'Bingo se quedó con mi cubo tanto tiempo que nunca pensé que lo vería de nuevo. Y ahora te envía a ti para que me lo devuelvas, ¿y sin ninguna explicación?'\
\
Abre la boca para responder, pero te hace callar con un gesto brusco.\
\
'No hay necesidad de explicaciones, ${PLAYER}. Sé por qué Bingo ha decidido devolver todo lo que había pedido prestado. ¡Se va la Comarca! ¡Sí, Esmeralda Madriguerales me ha revelado su pequeño secreto!\
\
'¡No voy a quedarme de brazos cruzados! He presentado una petición para que Bingo sea encerrado en las CeldasAgujeros y así evitar que emprenda esta estúpida aventura, ¡y muchos notables hobbits ya la han firmado! ¡Ve a hablar con el alcalde y averigua si ya se ha pronunciado al respecto!'","Recoge flores cerca de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco, en Cavada Grande","Myrtle acepta el cubo con una mirada de desaprobación","''Solo necesito preparar mis cosas para el viaje y poner algunas cosas en orden antes de partir. ¿Me ayudarás con estos últimos preparativos? Me entristece dejar atrás la Perca Dorada y su buena cerveza, pero esa es la vida de un aventurero, ¿no?\
\
'¡Volvamos a mi agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande!'","Poppy acepta el ovillo de cordel con una sonrisa confusa","'Tomé prestado ese ovillo de cordel de Poppy Ciñatiesa, que vive justo enfrente. ¿Te importaría devolvérselo, y también algunos de estos otros objetos prestados a mis otros vecinos?'","El alcalde te entrega la petición de Myrtle, que tiene un buen número de firmas","Myrtle Cenagales vive en lo alto de una pequeña colina al este del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestado un cubo a Myrtle, y quiere que se lo devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","Bingo está confiado en que está preparado para su viaje, pero ahora necesita preparar sus cosas para el viaje.","Habla con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco fuera del Agujero Municipal, en Cavada Grande","Habla con Myrtle Cenagales fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","Recoge el ovillo de cordel en el interior del agujero hobbit de Bingo","El alcalde Will Pieblanco te ha dado la petición de Myrtle para que se la entregues a Bingo para que sepa lo que le espera (¡y que Myrtle podría intentar encerrarlo ella misma!)","'Tengo que hacer algo bonito por Myrtle, ${PLAYER}. ¿Puedes ir a la estatua de Marcho y Blanco en el centro del pueblo y recoger algunas de las flores que crecen allí para dárselas a Myrtle? Dile que recibí su mensaje alto y claro, ¡y que volveré tan pronto como pueda!'","Poppy Ciñatiesa vive justo enfrente del agujero hobbit de Bingo en Cavada Grande.\
\
Bingo le pidió prestado un ovillo de cordel a Poppy Ciñatiesa y quiere que se lo devuelvas antes de emprender su viaje.","Bingo está en el interior de su agujero hobbit en el pueblo de Cavada Grande, al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Bingo tiene que preparar la mochila para su viaje, y te ha pedido que le ayudes con los últimos preparativos.","'Ya me siento preparado para el viaje, ${PLAYER}. ¡Estoy listo para cualquier cosa!\
\
'Solo necesito preparar mis cosas y poner un poco de orden antes de partir. ¿Me ayudarías con estos últimos preparativos? Me entristece dejar atrás la Perca Dorada y su excelente cerveza, pero esa es la vida de un aventurero, ¿no?\
\
'¡Volvamos a mi agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande!'","'¿Qué son estas flores, ${PLAYER}? ¿Se ha pronunciado el alcalde sobre mi peticion de poner a Bingo Boffin en las CeldasAgujeros?'\
\
Le explicas a Bingo que querías entregar estas flores a Myrtle como muestra de aprecio por sus amables palabras.\
\
'¿Amables... palabras...? Quiero decir, sí, por supuesto, solo deseo lo mejor a todos mis vecinos, pero aún así...'\
\
Myrtle se pone colorada como un tomate.\
\
'¡Escribiré OTRA petición! Esta tratará sobre... sobre otra cosa, ¡una cosa SERIA! ¡Ya verás!'","Myrtle acepta las flores con una mezcla de confusión y vergüenza","Bingo está en el interior de su casa en Cavada Grande, justo al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has hecho lo que Bingo te pidió y le has dado flores a Myrtle Cenagales para agradecerle sus buenos deseos.","Dejas a Myrtle con sus pensamientos... y sus firmas"},
[4268]={"Gathered bundles of swords from barrels in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bundles of swords and armour pieces can be found in Tingobel in north-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
Thenidiel has asked you to seek out any remaining weapons and armour pieces in Tingobel in hopes that her people can aid in the defence of Lancrath.","'Thank you for doing this, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'It pleases me that the Orcs can no longer benefit from the labours of our people, and doubly so that we might now be prepared to defend Lancrath should the Orcs seek to press further into the vale. War has come to Gondor and all must be ready to fight. A weak arm or lack of skill can no longer be an excuse.\
\
'We must begin training at once!'","Displaced from her home, Thenidiel of Tingobel hopes to ensure that the Rashat-hai cannot sack any other settlements in Blackroot Vale.","Deliver the swords and armour pieces to Thenidiel","Gather armour pieces from barrels in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather bundles of swords from barrels in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gathered armour pieces from barrels in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT -- will not be seen","Thenidiel can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have recovered as many weapons and armour pieces as you were able to carry, and should now deliver them to Thenidiel.","Disarm and Rearm","'Have you been to Tingobel, traveller?\
\
'The Orcs did not burn our town... they merely took it for their own. The weapons and armour our miners and smiths worked so hard to create were mostly left behind, and I shall not have them used by the enemies of Gondor.\
\
'Perhaps the time will come when the Orcs venture further south to Lancrath, but if you aid us in recovering our weapons and armour, we shall be prepared.'"},
[4269]={"You have not recovered enough swords from the Dunlendings.","Stolen swords can be found in the hands of the nearby Dunlendings.\
\
You have come across a wrecked cart that has been partially looted by the nearby Dunlendings. You should defeat them and recover the swords.","Hidden under the cover of trees, Dunlendings have ambushed a cart on the road to the Stonedeans and stolen numerous arms.","You have recovered many stolen swords from the nearby Dunlendings.","You have recovered many swords from the Dunlendings, depriving the enemies of Rohan the chance to exploit stolen arms against the Rohirrim in battle.","Collect stolen swords","Collect stolen swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected stolen swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","While investigating a wrecked cart on the road to the Stonedeans, you have discovered a barrel emptied of swords. You surmise that the nearby Dunlendings have armed themselves with the stolen weapons. In the interests of Middlemead and Kingstead, you should defeat the Dunlendings and reclaim the stolen arms.","Completado","Dunlendings invading from the west have ransacked a passing cart and stolen numerous blades from Béored's shipment. You should reclaim them.","Disarming the Enemy"},
[4270]={"Habla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","Defeated Orc-smiths (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Disarming the Foe","'The Orcs may not be the most powerful of foes, but they are numerous, determined, and some among their number are dangerously clever in the ways of siege-craft -- particularly when they are crafting designs supplied by the Enemy himself.\
\
'You have stolen away many of the parts they had hoped to use in the construction of cunning engines of war, but some remain, and even without them their smiths will strive to build more primitive -- but still quite lethal -- weapons.\
\
'I would like to see most of those Orcs defeated, for without them, their soldiers have no real hope of infiltrating the defences of our forest.'","Fanuidhol lies to the north-west of Talan Fanuidhol.\
\
Bahanneth wants you to enter Fanuidhol and kill several of the smiths there, as well as to destroy some of the stores of weapons they have forged. The weapons can be found stored towards the back of the camp, further to the north-west.","'Excellent work, my friend! As long as we can continue to disrupt their preparations, the Orcs shall find their efforts to assault Lórien fruitless and most costly indeed.'","Destroy weapon-stores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Orcs will have some trouble replacing those stores quickly, ${PLAYER}. Well done!'","Bahanneth is concerned about the siege-parts you stole from the Orcs. Even without them, they will be able to construct primitive weapons to conduct a siege.","Defeat Orc-smiths (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Fanuidhol.\
\
You should return to Bahanneth with news of your victory.","Destroyed weapon-stores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Orcs will have no hope of completing their siege-engines if their smiths have been put to the sword.'"},
[4271]={"'Well done. Without weapons, they will be unable to defend themselves from the assault.'","Destroyed Uruk weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Uruk weapons can be found in Kala-gijak.\
\
You should destroy Uruk weapons.","Faeron can be found outside Kala-gijak.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Destroy Uruk weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Uruks have barrels of weapons lying around in the lower barracks. Destroy them, so when they finally realize they are under attack, they will not be able to arm themselves.'","Faeron has suggested that while storming Kala-gijak, you should destroy any Uruk weapons you find. This will prevent them from mounting a defence.","Talk to Faeron","Disarming the Uruks"},
[4272]={"'Estas armas están mal hechas, y ninguna muestra el cuidado necesario para forjar una espada verdaderamente fina. No me sorprende la falta de artesanía, pues a los Angmarim les importa poco eso, y estas hojas son tan efectivas como necesitan para matar a los inocentes que eran su presa.\
\
'Has hecho bien en traerme estas armas. Las destruiré, y al hacerlo espero que juntos hayamos salvado algunas vidas. Tienes mi agradecimiento por esta tarea.'","'¿Todavía no has recuperado suficientes cofres de armas de la cueva de los trolls en Taur Gonwaith?'","'Taur Gonwaith fue hermoso alguna vez, pero ahora es un lugar oscuro y ominoso.'","Derrota a los defensores montañeses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Desarmando el valle","Recolecta cofres de armas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Taur Gonwaith fue una vez un valle sombrío al sureste de Lin Giliath, pero los trolls lo han despojado bajo las órdenes de sus amos Angmarim. Si puedes regresar con varios cofres de armas de los Angmarim, los destruiré.'","Los misteriosos Angmarim están fuera de la cueva de los trolls en la parte sur de Taur Gonwaith, al sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Baranwen te pidió que recolectaras cofres de armas de los Angmarim y se los llevaras para destruir esas viles armas.","Baranwen está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Baranwen espera tu regreso con las armas de los orcos, que destruirá.","Hombres del norte de Angmar han vagado hasta Taur Gonwaith.","'Cuantas menos armas puedan empuñar los Angmarim, más seguros estarán los Pueblos Libres.'","'Se ha visto a hombres del norte llevando cofres cargados de armas a una cueva, en el sur. Mientras los demás se concentran en las maldades de los trolls, me preocupa la mera presencia de hombres de Angmar, sin mencionar sus armas.\
\
'Cada empuñadura que quitemos de las manos de un Angmarim será una hoja menos que pueda alzarse contra los Pueblos Libres. Busca cofres de armas en la cueva de los trolls y tráemelos. Yo destruiré esas viles espadas.\
\
'Si incluso una de las hojas que incautemos hubiera matado a un inocente, consideraré que el trabajo de hoy valió la pena.'","Cofres de armas recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Montañés derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los cofres de armas de los Angmarim a Baranwen"},
[4274]={"'Since I have closed my realm to trade and travel, there has been unrest and murmuring among the raft-elves who dwell along the river. Although my judgment was measured and with good reason, I deem I may not have considered all that I should.\
\
'Will you travel to Loeglond and speak to Lorndúr? Tell him that I will weigh re-opening trade with Lake-town, should the route be made completely safe.'","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Discord in the Woodland Realm","Talk to Lorndúr","Due to recent events, King Thranduil Swiftstream has decided to close the Woodland Realm to outsiders. This has caused some friction among his people, especially the Raft-elves. Thranduil would like you to report to Loeglond to see what can be done to ease these tensions.","Loeglond can be found between Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\
\
You should travel to Loeglond.","Travel to Loeglond","Leave Felegoth","You explain to the despondent Elf that King Thranduil has agreed to re-open trade if it can be made perfectly safe. He looks relieved.\
\
'What excellent tidings you bring, ${CLASS}!  If we can re-open trade, my kin can finally return to the waters. Your aid would help us overcome the many difficulties we now face.'","'Hold, ${PLAYER}. Hear me before you go farther.  Without open trade between Lake-town and Dale, the raft-elves are idle and purposeless. \
\
'But that is not all. There is talk among the river reeds of the ending of the age. Some wonder if King Thranduil and the other High Elves will leave us to sail west. Some argue they should. Fear not - we are Elves, all of us, though our kindred never looked upon the farther shore. There will be no treason or treachery, though other ills may come of it.\
\
'Put the raft-elves back to work and there will be little time for such talk, and much good will shall be restored.’","Galion calls you over as you pass","Thranduil has asked you to head to Loeglond.\
\
You should leave Felegoth.","Talk to Galion","Galion wishes to speak with you inside Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Galion.","Many raft-elves sit idly by, morose at their lack of work"},
[4275]={"'Well, my little fellows! You shall have your deeds completed!'","'Now, my little fellows, where be you a-going to, puffing like a bellows? What's the matter here then? Tell me what's your trouble!\
\
'You need to play the instances? Naught worse that that, eh? That can soon be mended.'","By completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discover the Halls of Night","Grants completion of deed: Discover the Halls of Night","Descubre los Salones de la Noche","Habla con Javatar para completar Descubre los Salones de la Noche"},
[4279]={"'Incluso el olor del agua parece bastar para causar enfermedad. Tengo algunas ideas sobre esta agua, pero solo hay una forma de comprobarlas.'","Agua recolectada (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Recolecta agua de las pozas occidentales de Imlad Balchorth (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Esta agua parece nublar los sentidos, pero poco más. Los Montaraces han dicho que el agua es veneno mortal. ¿Quizás se refieren a las pozas del oeste?\
\
'Si sus palabras son ciertas, recolectar agua de las pozas del oeste será sumamente peligroso. Debes tener cuidado de que ni una sola gota toque tu piel. Esa sustancia es veneno mortal y detendrá tu corazón en el acto.\
\
'Regresa a Imlad Balchorth y recolecta agua de las pozas venenosas y turbulentas del oeste. Puede que nos dé las respuestas que busco.'","'Recolecta agua de los sectores de aguas turbulentas que se encuentran en las zonas occidentales de Imlad Balchorth. Ten cuidado, ¡el agua es muy peligrosa!'","Las pozas de Imlad Balchorth están al oeste de Myrkworth.\
\
Las aguas en las zonas occidentales de Imlad Balchorth están impregnadas de veneno mortal, y Thorod desea determinar la causa.","Lleva el frasco a Thorod","'¿Dónde están los frascos?'","Las pozas de Imlad Balchorth son fosas nocivas de agua corrompida. Nadie sabe si la corrupción proviene de la industria del Enemigo o de una fuente más siniestra.","Thorod está en Myrkworth, al este de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
us frascos están llenos del agua mortal de las pozas turbulentas de Imlad Balchorth.","Descubriendo la Fuente"},
[4291]={"By completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discovery: Roots of Fangorn","'Well, my little fellows! You shall have your deeds completed!'","'Now, my little fellows, where be you a-going to, puffing like a bellows? What's the matter here then? Tell me what's your trouble!\
\
'You need to play the instances? Naught worse that that, eh? That can soon be mended.'","Grants completion of deed: Discovery: Roots of Fangorn","Descubrimiento: Raíces de Fangorn","Talk to Javatar to complete Discovery: Roots of Fangorn"},
[4302]={"'¡Ah, que tenga un buen día! Es bueno ver a los Montebruno derrotados y la paz regresar a Archet una vez más. Ahora podemos ocuparnos de problemas menos graves.\
\
'De hecho, podrías ayudar con uno de esos problemas, si te interesa. Parece que hay una enfermedad propagándose entre los jabalíes locales. ¡Y debe ser una aflicción terrible, porque las bestias están más hostiles de lo normal!\
\
'Debemos acabar con esta enfermedad, y la única manera es eliminar a los infectados. ¿Lo harías?'","'Ah, te has encargado de esas pobres criaturas enfermas. Todo jabalí que haya contraído esa plaga deberá ser destruido, pero los pocos que has eliminado ayudarán a frenar la propagación.\
\
'¡Gracias!'","El condestable Cardoso se encuentra cerca de las ruinas de la Posada del Tejón Loco en Archet.\
\
Querrá saber de tu éxito.","'¿Buscas a los jabalíes enfermos? Deberían estar merodeando al sur y al este de la puerta.\
\
'Puede parecer duro matarlos sin preocuparse por su carne, pero la única forma de detener la enfermedad es eliminar a los infectados. Es una tarea triste, pero necesaria.'","Enfermedad entre los jabalíes","Cerdoespín enfermos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jabalíes enfermos merodean por las tierras al sur y al este de la puerta de Archet.\
\
El condestable Cardoso cree que la mejor forma de acabar con la enfermedad que afecta a los jabalíes locales es eliminar a los ya infectados.","El condestable Cardoso está preocupado por la enfermedad que se está propagando entre los jabalíes tras la destrucción sufrida en Archet. Los jabalíes deben ser eliminados antes de que infecten a otros animales y acaben con la ya escasa comida en Archet.","Derrota a los Cerdoespín enfermos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4303]={"Administer salve to diseased wild hill-goats (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Diseased Prey","Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra.","'You have our gratitude, and that of the beasts'. Nature works best when we all work together harmoniously. You are a fine example of that.'","Return to Elder Ilaya in Khûtra","Khûtra Elder Ilaya has asked for your help in healing some of the afflicted wild goats surrounding Khûtra. The goats can be found in the hills north of Khûtra.","'Now that we have a salve for these animals, our important work can begin in earnest.\
\
'It is important that we heal any nearby diseased prey animals. Healing the wild goats in the hills north of Khûtra will ensure that if any predator should eat them, this cycle of death is ended.\
\
'Will you help us?'","Khûtra Elder Ilaya has asked for your help in healing some of the afflicted animals surrounding Khûtra.","Administered salve to diseased wild hill-goats (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[4304]={"'Ha! So much for those honourless devils! Well done, ${PLAYER}!'","Bagmund is appalled by the presence of the Oathbreakers at Atburg. Despite their noble heritage as Men of Gondor, he despises them for the betrayal they performed in ages past and for the dishonourable deeds they commit on behalf of the brigands.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you take this quest, you will begin Bagmund's Dishonoured Dead line and will be unable to accept Wynstan's Call of Honour line.</rgb>","Eowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp.\
\
Bagmund asked you to report your successes to the scout Eowils.","'Is it not revolting? The Dead have no honour...cursed they were for betraying their lord, yet still they have no honour and fight for none. Instead they barter with brigands and thieves.\
\
'How I wish we could banish them from this place so I would not have to endure their accursed presence. But wait! Perhaps we can! Perhaps you would be willing to do so?\
\
'Drive them out, every one...that is all I ask. Let Stangard deal with these rebel spirits! When you have done this deed, speak with young Eowils, who watches Atburg for us...he will relay your news.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you take this quest, you will begin Bagmund's Dishonoured Dead line and will be unable to accept Wynstan's Call of Honour line.</rgb>","Defeated shades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore","Dishonoured Dead","Shades can be found at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Bagmund has asked you to banish the shades from Atburg and the Rushgore.","Defeat shades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4306]={"Cyneswith lies to the east, behind the large Springview Estate.\
\
You have removed many of the Orcs from the homes and farmsteads to the west. This act should restore some hope in Cyneswith.","Defeat White Hand scavengers at the Norcrofts farms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat White Hand defilers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dislodged","The farmsteads lie at the western edge of the Norcrofts.\
\
Cyneswith has asked you to defeat many of the scavengers and defilers that have invaded and dislodged the farmers from their homes.","The homes and farms of the people of Norcrofts have fallen to the savage pillagers and defilers of the White Hand force. With neither Reeve Athelward or King Théoden willing to send men to oppose them, there is little hope of reclaiming the homes without outside intervention.","'The Norcrofts are home to the most beautiful and fertile farmland in all of Rohan, and they should belong to its people, not to filthy Orcs. Yet as their vile horde ravaged across these lands, they simply claimed whatever defenceless property fell within their wake.\
\
'Reeve Athelward has abandoned these farms, Théoden King sits blindly upon his throne; my last hope falls to you. If we are ever to take these lands back, we must defeat the Orcs dwelling within our homes.'","'The farms and homes we once loved have been utterly destroyed by the Orcs. Even if we are able to reclaim them, it would take years of work to restore their condition... but we must have resolve.\
\
'Thank you, friend. Even when Théoden King has closed his eyes and ears to our suffering, you have stood by us and helped fight for what is rightfully ours.'","Return to Cyneswith","Defeated White Hand defilers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated White Hand scavengers at the Norcrofts farms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4307]={"Múta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
You have learned what you could from the tortured Angmarim. You should report back to Múta.","'Mercy, I beg you!'\
\
You ask the Angmarim what has happened and why the Dourhands have come to Caivád Sâr.\
\
'Whatever he has come for, it is not the war. Brathar will not send any of his own into the field, and he allows the blood of Angmar to be spilled on his behalf. I would not fight... but see what it cost me?\
\
'I have seen how he treats Bandrauth, if one so lowly as me were to refuse again, Brathar would surely have me slain.\
\
'Begone before I am seen with you!'","After the Dourhands and their mysterious lord arrived at Caivád Sâr, some servants of the Iron Crown were subjected to new agonies in Tûr Ágal, while others were banished from Elderslade.","Question tortured Angmarim at Caivád Sâr (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Speak or begone, it matters not!'\
\
You ask the Angmarim what has happened and why the Dourhands have come to Caivád Sâr.\
\
'Brathar... I would cut my own throat before bowing to that dwarf-mongrel.\
\
'If the traitor-lord wants the Iron Crown for his own, then he has found the weak-willed followers he deserves! I serve only the true master... the Witch-king of Angmar!\
\
'Leave me to my fate! I do not want your pity!'","Talk to Múta","Disloyal to the Crown","'Don't... look so... smug, worm. What... do you want?'\
\
You ask the Angmarim what has happened and why the Dourhands have come to Caivád Sâr. The Angmarim sputters and a weak smirk curls at the corner of his mouth.\
\
'It was... foreseen. The Iron Crown would be broken and Angmar would be undone.\
\
'The dwarf-lord... Brathar... he cares not for this war. He has... set his sights far higher... and none will stand in his path.\
\
'It was all... inevitable.'","Tortured Angmarim can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr.\
\
Múta has asked you to question the Angmarim that have been tortured by the Dourhands and their kin.","Questioned tortured Angmarim at Caivád Sâr (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'When I first crept into this tower, I could not believe my eyes.\
\
'By some wicked means, the Dourhands have turned the Angmarim against their own brothers and sisters. Many of these unfortunate Angmarim were banished—sent into the field of battle to die at the hands of the Gabil'akkâ. A few remain in the tower, but their fates are no better, I'm afraid. From what I can tell, they have been tortured and left for dead.\
\
'What sort of lord would wish this upon his own followers? We must know who is leading these Dourhands and to what end!\
\
'If any of those Angmarim still cling to life, find out what you can from them.'","'So the leader of these dwarves is named Brathar and he seeks to wield the servants of the Iron Crown as his own?\
\
'Now I only have more questions, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'I must admit, I find it difficult to muster sympathy for those who served the Dark Lord's servants, but these Angmarim seem just as puzzled as us. Even so, Brathar's seeming disinterest in the war may prove of use to the Gabil'akkâ!'","'No... no more! I'll do anything you wish!'\
\
The Angmarim flinches at your approach. As he discovers that you are not one of his tormentors, a sudden relief washes across his face.\
\
'What... do you want?'\
\
You ask the Angmarim what has happened and why the Dourhands have come to Caivád Sâr.\
\
'I do not know. The Dourhands were servants of Angmar for a time, but they failed us at Gabilazan. A few remained among us after the vessel's destruction, but they were not to be trusted.\
\
'Only one... Brathar, was truly loyal to Angmar, but... now I do not know whom he serves. Was it all some trick?\
\
'It cannot be....'"},
[4308]={"The structures at the former Corsair camp contain plenty of useful materials.","Bruidis has asked you to collect wood and cloth from wood piles and banners in Makham Mijann.\
\
Makham Mijann lies north of Tadrent.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. We shall put these to good use.'","You have collected a suitable amount of wood and cloth.\
\
You should give these materials to Bruidis in Tadrent.","Collected wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect wood from wood piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dismantling Makham Mijann","'There is an abandoned Corsair camp to the north of Tadrent -- Makham Mijann, it was called. We tried to dismantle the camp to reuse materials, but efforts have halted for the time being.\
\
'If you venture there, could you collect as many pieces of wood and cloth as you can? There ought to be wood piles and untouched Corsair banners that we left behind.'","Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent","Collected cloth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect cloth from banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4311]={"Legolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Legolas.","There seems to be a large group of Black Númenóreans gathered around the spear","Confront the wounded devoted","Return to the spot where Aiglos lies","'A scout has returned claiming others have caught sight of Aiglos and are gathering around it. None have attempted to scale the rock and retrieve the spear. Instead, it seems they are worshipping it.\
\
'You must depart with Legolas. These Men of Mordor know not the Elvish ways.\
\
'I wish you both luck in recovering Aiglos. May you have swift and safe travels.'","More devoted have arrived and should be defeated","Aiglos can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should travel back to Aiglos to assess the situation.","'Sauron is still alive you fool! Ha! That is, the Dark Lord shall return. The Order of The Eye shall see to it!'\
\
The devoted member of the Order tries to move and winces.\
\
'Do you not know the greatness of Sauron? Thy day comes when those who seek to topple all the Dark Lord has accomplished shall beg for forgiveness.'","Hithgol asks for you and Legolas to assess if Aiglos is at all retrievable in its current location.","You see a wounded devoted of the Order of the Eye and should confront him","Disorder of The Eye","A wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos.\
\
You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.","'${PLAYER}, what have you learned from these Men around the spire?\
\
'They worship Sauron? But he is dead!'\
\
You explain that the men call themselves The Order of The Eye, and that they seem to believe they possess the power to restore the Dark Lord.\
\
'Certainly they are delusional with hopes of grandeur and power. They hold onto what is certainly lost.\
\
'What is left for them then, here in Mordor, and why do they worship the spear of Aiglos?'","Those devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos.\
\
You should defeat them if you stand any chance of retrieving the spear.","Those devoted to the Order of the Eye can be found around Aiglos.\
\
You should defeat them to stand any chance of retrieving the spear.","Defeated devoted (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Confront a devoted","Defeat the Order of the Eye devoted (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Legolas."},
[4312]={"Habla con Birdie Espinajo","Birdie Espinajo se encuentra fuera del Laberinto de Setos.\
\
Debes hablar con Birdie Espinajo y contarle tu éxito al probar las cervezas siniestras del laberinto.","Desorientación","Prueba cervezas siniestras antes de que se acabe el tiempo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has probado una cerveza siniestra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! ¡No creí que pudieras completar esa tarea! La mayoría se rinde después de los primeros tragos, mareados y desorientados. ¡Admiro tu perseverancia!'","Jarras de cerveza siniestra han sido dejadas en el Laberinto de Setos para confundir los sentidos de quienes lo recorren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'Tengo un desafío especialmente difícil para ti. Hay una cerveza fuerte y siniestra en el Laberinto de Setos, y un solo trago te dejará sin sentidos. Te despertarás muy lejos de donde comenzaste, sin recuerdo alguno de cómo llegaste allí. Todas tus hazañas por el camino habrán sido olvidadas.\
\
'Si logras recorrer el laberinto mientras bebes esas cervezas siniestras en el trayecto, quedaré tremendamente impresionada.'","'¡Cuidado con las cervezas siniestras! Nunca sabes dónde podrías terminar.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Las cervezas siniestras pueden encontrarse por todo el Laberinto de Setos, esperando a ser bebidas.\
\
Debes probarlas....... ¡pero ten cuidado! Te desorientarán durante tu recorrido."},
[4313]={"Los trolls de las nieves están entre los terribles enemigos que han tomado refugio en la antigua ciudad enana de Sarnúr.","Snár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Orodost, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes regresar con Snár con noticias de tu éxito contra los trolls de las nieves.","Habla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin","Trolls de las nieves destripadores derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a trolls de las nieves destripadores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}, tras la derrota de los Duramano en la Mansión de Thorin, los Duramano fueron expulsados a las ruinas de Orodost. Desde allí avanzaron hacia lo profundo de la antigua ciudad enana, que los Elfos ahora llaman Sarnúr.\
\
'Estamos enviando guerreros para expulsar a los Duramano, pero más profundo en las ruinas hay una amenaza más siniestra. Bajo la antesala principal hay un risco helado que se ha convertido en el hogar de los trolls de las nieves. Por favor reúne un grupo de aventureros y buscad a esas criaturas.\
\
'Viaja a Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, más allá de las ruinas de Orodost, que se encuentran a lo largo de las montañas occidentales de Ered Luin.'","'Gracias por viajar a Sarnúr y derrotar a los trolls de las nieves. La noticia de tu valentía se difundirá entre los barbiluengos de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
'Si planeas regresar a las ruinas, por favor ven a verme. Puede que tenga más tareas para ti.'","Acaba con los Trolls de las Nieves","'¡La idea de que esos viles trolls profanen un asentamiento enano es insoportable!'","Los trolls de las nieves pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Snár te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls de las nieves que habitan las antiguas ruinas enanas."},
[4315]={"Los murciélagos han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia el Bosque de los Trolls, espías del Enemigo que buscan el valle oculto de Imladris.","Derrota murciélagos en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Murciélagos derrotados en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hay murciélagos en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías acabar con el espionaje de los murciélagos del Enemigo en la región.","Dispersando la Nube"},
[4316]={"'It is as I expected, but not as I had hoped, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'My edict was not firm enough to withstand the passage of the Zhélruka... and my people will not heed it. Nori has proven that much to be true. I may hold the rest of them back for days, weeks, or even years, but it will not last. There must be another way....'\
\
King Thorin produces a small missive and glares at it.\
\
'Nori left a missive behind when he made for Thikil-gundu with his expedition. I would ask that you deliver it to Dori.\
\
'I think now it is time that he learns what his brother has done!'","Talk to King Thorin III","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Nori","As you approach the throne of King Thorin III, you notice a number of restless dwarves gathered before it...","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You encountered a messenger of Erebor who urged you to speak to the King under the Mountain at once.","'After Vethúg was defeated and Karazgar travelled into the North, I issued an edict forbidding any expeditions to the lost halls of Thikil-gundu.\
\
'It seemed that my people had come to understand my wisdom, or so I thought. \
\
'It was then I was betrayed by one of my father's oldest and closest friends. Nori, hero of Erebor and Keeper of the Coffers, had gathered an expedition in secret and set out in the night.\
\
'In anger, I thought to leave him to his fate, but that is not the way of a King under the Mountain.'","'Hail, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I am pleased that you have returned to Erebor, but I wish it were under better circumstances. It seems only more troubles have come to Erebor since the defeat of the great cold-drake, Vethúg Wintermind.\
\
'There is much to be said of such things, and I would hear your counsel. Where shall I begin?'","Disquiet in the Halls","King Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Nori, the Keeper of the Coffers.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have arrived at Erebor and found a number of dwarves pacing restlessly before the King under the Mountain. You should speak to King Thorin III at once.","Listened to the grievances of restless dwarves (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Karazgar","'Hail, ${PLAYER}. I was sent to deliver a message to you by the King under the Mountain!\
\
'King Thorin requests an audience in the Hall under the Mountain. There are troubling matters afoot in Erebor, and he seeks your counsel and skill to aid him in settling them.'","Dori can be found in the Hall under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to deliver the missive Nori left behind before he departed Erebor to Dori in the Hall under the Mountain.","Listen to King Thorin III speak of Vethúg Wintermind","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have heard the grievances of the dwarves of Erebor, and you should now return to King Thorin III.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have learned of the matters troubling King Thorin III and should now heed the will of the King under the Mountain.","Restless dwarves can be found before the throne of the King under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III Stonehelm has grown weary of rising tensions among the Dwarves of Erebor, and has asked you to listen to the grievances of his people that he might better understand them.","King Thorin III has asked you to listen to him speak on matters concerning Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind.","'What is this?'\
\
Dori begins to read the missive and his face sinks.\
\
'This is some trick, ${PLAYER}. It must be!\
\
'Nori would not have done this!'","'The great cold-drake, Vethúg Wintermind, has long been known to my people.\
\
'When the Longbeards still dwelled among the Grey Mountains in the Dwarf-kingdom of Grárik, my people discovered a great delving beneath the slopes of the Wrathhorn. They restored it and built upon it, naming it Thikil-gundu, or the Steel Keep in the Common Tongue.\
\
'It is true that the first mines and outposts in the Grey Mountains were delved by the Zhélruka, but the halls of the Steel Keep were shaped by the craft of the Longbeards. I will not speak of rightful claims or of the old conflict between our peoples -- they matter no longer. It was a great cold-drake that stole Thikil-gundu from us! Vethúg Wintermind!\
\
'Vethúg devoured Dáin I, and slew his son, Frór. Grárik was ended, and if not for the flight of Thrór and Grór, the Longbeards would not have survived.\
\
'Mere weeks after the War had ended, Karazgar drew Vethúg Wintermind to Erebor, and though my people suffered great losses, the cold-drake was defeated... but not slain.\
\
'Whether he seeks to tend his wounds or die atop our hoards of old, I am certain he has returned to the halls of Thikil-gundu.'","'Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior... not since the days of Azog has a name been so reviled by my people! \
\
'His cunning drew our foe of old, a great cold-drake, to Erebor. Dwarves, Elves, and Men battled against Vethúg Wintermind, but it seems our defeat of the great cold-drake only served to further his designs for the North.\
\
'You see, after Vethúg fled the battle, Karazgar followed him into the Ered Mithrin. By Durin's beard, nothing good can come of that!\
\
'Karazgar has left us in peace, but he will return. I am certain of it!'","'And now you understand, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'It is true that Vethúg Wintermind was defeated, but that does not mean that Thikil-gundu has been left unguarded. Karazgar has pursued Vethúg into the Grey Mountains, and there are Orcs of Gundabad lurking in the foothills. If the Zhélruka hope to reclaim the Steel Keep, they will have to contend with the dangers of the Grey Mountains... and I am inclined to let them.\
\
'However, their passage into the Ered Mithrin has not gone unnoticed by my people. Even now, they gather before my throne in anger and restlessness.\
\
'Listen well to their grievances, ${PLAYER}, and then we will see if I cannot put their minds at ease.'","Deliver Nori's missive to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain","In the weeks following the defeat of Vethúg Wintermind, tensions have risen between the Dwarves of Erebor and the King under the Mountain as the Zhélruka of the East now make for the Steel Keep, Thikil-gundu.","Listen to the grievances of restless dwarves (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[4317]={"Lady Terenis grows troubled by increasingly dark dreams of her brother and her estranged sister.","Talk to Baranor in Arnach","'${PLAYER}, you have done much for me and my people, but I cannot keep you here any longer.\
\
'Sleep has not come easily to me of late, but even when I find rest, my dreams have grown as dark as the skies. I have seen my brother fall to madness, the deaths of my sons, and great beasts of terror marching upon Minas Tirith. What sickness of the mind takes hold that would conjure such foul thoughts? I know not if any of these shall come to pass, but I must work to prevent them if I might. Lord Angbor has his own path to forge into the East, but I would ask something else of you. \
\
'You may be the last to heed my words... so I beg you to travel to Arnach and speak to a warrior called Baranor. It may delay you, and it may even change your course, but I cannot let those that I love fall to such horrors.'","'If the Lady has sent you, I shall not deny your aid. Too many troubles have come to Lossarnach of late... and I fear I cannot resolve them all.\
\
'Curious, though, that Lady Terenis sent you. Has she told you much of her sister, Lady Vanyalos? I suspect not. The two of them have not spoken for years... all over Lord Forlong, no less.\
\
'Know this, I will not involve myself in the Sisters' feud, but I shall tell Lady Vanyalos of your intent to aid us.'","Disquieting Dreams","Baranor can be found in Arnach, which can be reached by travelling east across the Erui at the Crossings or by use of the bridge near the beacon Minlos.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to travel east to Arnach and aid the guards there in keeping the people of Lossarnach from harm."},
[4319]={"'No solo pudimos asegurar los suministros necesarios, lo que es más importante es que podemos tener un método para liberar a nuestra gente poseída. Gracias.'","<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Usa la habilidad 'Libera la mente' en los sirvientes poseídos para avanzar en la misión.</rgb>","Habla con Sorkamâl la Tolerante","Busca y derrota a los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada.","Derrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces para escapar.","Provisiones reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces","Sorkamâl la Tolerante ha descubierto una forma de liberar sus mentes y sacarlos. Usa su pergamino para liberar sus mentes y recoger los suministros necesarios para el esfuerzo de guerra de Mizâdi.\
\
Habla con Sorkamâl para que te dé el pergamino.","Derrota a los refuerzos de los Orcos antiguos cerca de la entrada","Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas y sus secuaces eliminados","Reúne provisiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Busca a los sirvientes poseídos. Libéralos del control y reúne suministros adicionales por toda el área para el esfuerzo de guerra.","Los civiles dentro de los Aposentos de los Sirvientes de Emax Dûl están bajo el control de los Thardúth. Sorkamâl la Tolerante ha descubierto una forma de liberar sus mentes y sacarlos. Usa su pergamino para liberar sus mentes y recoger los suministros necesarios para el esfuerzo de guerra de Mizâdi.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Libera la mente</rgb> en los sirvientes poseídos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A medida que los Orcos antiguos caen, Daithúch el Bebedor de Heridas emerge","Control perturbado","Sirvientes poseídos liberados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4321]={"Disrupting the Muster","'From the reports that we have received from our scouts, the forces at Ânug-stazg appear to be gathering for an assault on Mithechad. With the sentries of Ânug-stazg crippled, the time is right to strike against the camp itself, disrupting their plans.\
\
'My hope is that by defeating Fotak, the Orc that leads the troops, and by slaying many of his warriors, we will forestall any plans to attack our camp. You must go at once to Ânug-stazg and defeat Fotak and his minions.\
\
'Ânug-stazg lies due east of here, beneath a grove of twisted trees.'","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Defeat Orcs at Ânug-stazg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Perindúr is at Mithechad, west of Ânug-stazg.\
\
You should tell Perindúr of your victory over the Enemy forces at Ânug-stazg.","'With the defeat of Fotak and the rout of his minions, Mithechad should be secure for the time being. \
\
'The safety of the expedition into the Ashenslades owes much to your efforts.'","Ânug-stazg is host to a muster of the Orcs in the Ashenslades. From here, they plan to lay waste to the Malledhrim encampment at Mithechad.","Defeat Fotak","Defeated Fotak","Fotak and his minions may be found at Ânug-stazg, due east of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to defeat the Orc Fotak and his warriors.","Defeated Orcs at Ânug-stazg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You must go at once to Ânug-stazg, east of here, and defeat Fotak and his minions.'"},
[4322]={"'Atop the spires of Sâd Doldúr, one of Gorothúl's most trusted apprentices, Lidognir, prepares to perform a dark sorcery to empower the blight that grips the Ashenslades in the hopes that it will spread westward towards Lothlórien. If he succeeds, the blight will creep among the mellyrn and melbrethil, turning lush forests into ashen husks.\
\
'Travel at once to Sâd Doldúr, ${PLAYER}, and disrupt Lidognir's foul sorcery before it is too late. Lidognir can be found at the pinnacle of Sâd Doldúr, south and down the mountain from Barad Angol.'","Faerchiril is at Barad Angol, north and up the hill from Sâd Doldúr.\
\
You should speak with Faerchiril and let her know that Lidognir has been stopped and that his men have been defeated.","Defeated sorcerers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'With the defeat of Lidognir, the Golden Host has stopped a grave threat to our home. If this sorcerer had not been stopped, the trees throughout Mirkwood and Lothlórien would have suffered as the trees do within the Ashenslades. \
\
'Your bravery brings us hope, and this is truly a victory for the Malledhrim and of the Free Peoples.'","Talk to Faerchiril at Barad Angol","Disrupting the Ritual","Among the ruins of Sâd Doldúr, a foul sorceror is performing a ritual to further spread the blight past the reaches of the Ashenslades.","Defeat Lidognir","Defeated Lidognir","'Defeat Lidognir and his fellow sorcerers, ${PLAYER}. They can be found in Sâd Doldúr.'","The ruins of Sâd Doldúr lie south and down the mountain pass from Barad Angol.\
\
Faerchiril has asked you to travel to Sâd Doldúr, climb to the upper reaches of the ruins, and defeat Lidognir and his men.","Defeat sorcerers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4326]={"Faniel is concerned that the crebain are disrupting the workers of Parth Rest.","Disruption of Crebain","Faniel has asked you to defeat crebain around Parth Rest.","Crebain defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done what you can to quell the encroaching crebain. You should report your success to Faniel.\
\
Faniel can be found in Parth Rest.","'The workers are being pestered by crebain. Defeat the crebain and ravens around Parth Rest.\
\
'Should things continue as they are, we will never complete our task here.'","Defeat crebain or ravens around Parth Rest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you for your help ${PLAYER}.\
\
'We must not grow complacent in our efforts to ensure this camp remains unhindered in its work.\
\
'The fewer of those things out there, the better!'","Talk to Faniel in Parth Rest"},
[4327]={"Los enanos creen que pueden engañar a los Ghâsh-hai para que se alíen con las fuerzas de Mordor convenciéndolos de que Sauron es consciente de su traición.","'Mientras esperamos información, aún podemos sembrar discordia y confusión entre las filas de los orcos. Si llegaron desde Mordor como emisarios tempranos a Khazad-dûm, quizá podamos asustarlos para que vuelvan a servir.\
\
'He preparado varias piedras, cada una marcada con el símbolo del Gran Ojo. Colócalas sobre los altares que se encuentran cerca del Cruce de las Cenizas; cuando vean el símbolo del Ojo ardiendo sobre sus altares, deberían replantearse su lealtad.\
\
'Los altares se encuentran en las estructuras similares a puentes que rodean el Cruce de las Cenizas.'","'Las marcas han sido colocadas, y ya percibo que las lealtades comienzan a tambalearse.\
\
'Aunque este es un gran paso hacia la victoria, aún nos queda mucho por hacer.'","'Todos los altares deben llevar las marcas para que crean que el Señor Oscuro ha posado su Ojo sobre ellos.'","Coloca piedras sobre los altares (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has colocado una piedra sobre un altar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Gúthi en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Puedes encontrar los altares Ghâsh-hai en las estructuras similares a puentes que rodean el Cruce de las Cenizas.\
\
Gúthi cree que los Ghâsh-hai pueden ser convencidos para unirse a las fuerzas de Mordor. Quiere que coloques varias piedras marcadas con el Gran Ojo en los altares cercanos al Cruce de las Cenizas.","Gúthi se encuentra en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte suroeste de las Profundidades Llameantes.","Disensión en las filas"},
[4328]={"Trasgos armados con lanzas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hay rumores sobre trasgos en la Comarca y sobre las mortales lanzas que algunos pueden usar para herirte a distancia. ¡Si pudieras asegurarte de que no hay trasgos en los Campos Verdes, mis ovejas y yo nos sentiríamos mucho más seguros, lo sé!'","Vence a los trasgos armados con lanzas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ponto Corneta de Tejonera está preocupado por la aparición de trasgos en la Comarca y quiere proteger sus derechos de pastoreo en los Campos Verdes.","Peligros distantes","'¿Es seguro? ¿Estás ${PLAYERNAME:seguro[m]|segura[f]}? ¿No hay nada de qué preocuparse? ¡Oh, qué alivio! ¡Gracias, gracias!'","Se pueden encontrar trasgos armados con lanzas en el norte de los Campos Verdes.\
\
Ponto Corneta teme que pueda ser atacado a distancia por trasgos con lanzas, si los rumores resultan ser ciertos, y te ha pedido que elimines esa amenaza.","'¡Mis ovejas pastarán más tranquilas ahora que te has encargado de esos trasgos!'","Ponto Corneta está en Tejonera, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Los rumores sobre trasgos en los Campos Verdes tenían a Ponto Corneta preocupado por su seguridad y la de sus ovejas. Te había pedido que te aseguraras de que no hubiera trasgos armados con lanzas en los campos. Encontraste muchos, pero lograste despacharlos sin demasiados problemas. Deberías decirle a Ponto que debería ser seguro para él regresar a los Campos Verdes, aunque puede que se requiera tacto para evitar entrar en pánico a los habitantes de la Comarca.","'¿Has oído los rumores? Unos amigos míos dicen que Pansy Tunelero, allá en Scary, vio un trasgo en los Campos Verdes, ¡y que seguro hay más de ellos entrando en la Comarca!\
\
¡Esto es terrible! El pasto en los Campos Verdes es mejor que en cualquier otro lugar, y llevo mis ovejas allí todos los días. ¿Qué haré si los trasgos me sorprenden? Escuché que algunos trasgos son especialmente hábiles con lanzas. ¡Podría acabar como un colador antes de verlos! Me tranquilizaría mucho si pudieras asegurarte de que no hay trasgos lanzadores de lanzas en el norte de los Campos Verdes, ${PLAYER}.\
\
¡Me sentiría mucho mejor si supiera que no hay trasgos en absoluto!'","'¡Lo único peor que un trasgo es un trasgo que puede herirte a distancia!'"},
[4329]={"Habla con Leithólf","Forochel se encuentra al norte de Evendim pasado Cirith Rhiw, al norte de Tyrn Fornech. Deberías comenzar tu búsqueda en el pueblo de Kauppa-kohta.","Relaciones distantes","'¿Ya has comenzado tu viaje a Forochel, ${PLAYER}? Está al norte de Tyrn Fornech. Busca el pueblo al que llaman Kauppa-kohta.'","'¿Mi primo Glóin? No he recibido noticias suyas en muchos, muchos meses. Es bueno saber que está bien, aunque con los problemas que tengo aquí, no sé cuándo podría viajar para visitarlo.'","'¿Has oído hablar de la tierra de Forochel? Se encuentra al norte y muy al oeste de aquí, y es un lugar inhóspito, lleno de hielos que crujen y de pueblos extraños. Aunque nunca he estado allí, uno de mis primos, Leithólf, llevó recientemente a un grupo de mi gente a Forochel para probar fortuna comerciando con los Lossoth.\
\
'Si alguna vez viajas a esas tierras, te pediría que busques a Leithólf y te asegures de que está a salvo. No he sabido de él en muchos meses, aunque así es él: puede venir y marcharse durante largas temporadas sin enviar siquiera una palabra a sus parientes.\
\
'Dijo que llevaría su caravana a Kauppa-kohta. Un nombre extraño para una ciudad, ¿no te parece? Dijo que estaba al norte de la tierra de Evendim, pasando por Cirith Rhiw, la Puerta del Norte.'","Glóin busca noticias de uno de sus primos lejanos que se encuentra comerciando en la tierra de Forochel."},
[4330]={"El joven Barhador dejó claro que preferiría comer pescado en lugar de verduras y te preguntó si podías pescar algo para que todos disfrutarais en la comida.","Pesca peces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Peces pescados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Este parece el lugar de pesca recomendado por Barhador","Vuelve con Barhador con los peces","Vuelve con Barhador a su campamento en el Ángulo del Mitheithel con los tres peces frescos que has pescado.","Pesca tres peces en el lugar de pesca recomendado por Barhador en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Encuentra el lugar de pesca que describió Barhador","'¡Oh, mira eso! ¡Son maravillosos! Muchas gracias. Son mucho mejores que las zanahorias.'","'¡Qué asco! ¡No quiero zanahorias! ¡Si voy a crecer y ser fuerte necesito algo más que verduras! Mi madre dice que las verduras te hacen grande y fuerte, pero no estoy tan seguro.\
\
'¿Te gusta el pescado? Hay un lugar de pesca muy bueno justo al otro lado del camino hacia el sur. ¿Lo conoces? ¿Sabes pescar? Atrapa un pez para cada uno, ¿quieres? Ivoreth no me quita el ojo de encima. ¿Por favor? Te estaría muy agradecido.'","Pesca tres peces en el arroyo justo al sur de donde Barhador ha acampado en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Aversión por las verduras"},
[4331]={"Evidence of trespassers can likely be found at the water's edge in the northern part of the road in Thinglad, near where the sentinel Noriel is guarding the road.\
\
You should search for evidence of trespassers while Noriel stands guard.","Noriel guards the forest edge along the border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should bring the horseshoe to Noriel.","Noriel has asked you to search the woods nearby for signs of trespassers.\
\
You should search the forest floor for anything out of the ordinary.","Search nearby for a sign of trespassers","Disturbances in Thinglad","Bring the horseshoe to Noriel","'Look around for signs and see what there is to see. I would like to know who walks our lands without our leave.'","Found an empty fisherman's net abandoned at the river's edge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I am glad you were passing through this part of the wood, ${PLAYER}. While the mellyrn fade here, Thinglad is still part of Lothlórien.\
\
'I have heard and seen strange signs of trespassing of late. Will you investigate near here and see what there is to see? Make note of what you find; we can try to solve the riddle of who -- or what -- is invading the land so close to Caras Galadhon.'","Tell Noriel of the nets you found","You find a shoe thrown from a horse","'How strange it is that Thinglad should suddenly be disturbed after so many years of quiet. Only Elves and beasts roam these parts.'","Noriel, sentinel of Thinglad, stands on the road near the edge of Lothlórien.\
\
You should tell Noriel of the nets you found.","'There have never been fishing-nets along this stretch of the Anduin as far as I can remember. What do we make of this? Who is trespassing on our land?\
\
'If you have any skill in tracking, you should search the woods for signs of these invaders.'","Search the river's edge near Noriel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'A horseshoe! This must belong to one of the horses of Stangard, a Rohirrim settlement south of here. What great need drove these men to hunt and fish in Thinglad? They fear these woods, and anything to do with the Elves.'","Noriel is a sentinel of Thinglad, the southernmost reach of Lothlórien. She believes that trespassers have appeared on their lands of late and wishes for you to investigate."},
[4333]={"Las tumbas perturbadas se pueden encontrar en las profundidades del ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Restos perturbados","Tumbas abiertas atendidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ocúpate de las tumbas abiertas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4334]={"Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion","'Parece que la Mano Blanca nos ataca por todos lados aquí en Eregion, ${PLAYER}. La nota que me trajiste menciona claramente a 'Pembar'. Pembar está cerca de nuestro puesto de ruta en Echad Eregion. Si los semiorcos están trabajando en esa zona, entonces nuestros paisanos necesitan saberlo.\
\
'Para encontrar Echad Eregion, dirígete al sur desde Gwingris. Mira hacia el sureste mientras sigues el camino... Echad Eregion se encuentra entre unas pequeñas ruinas.\
\
'Entrega este mensaje a Lengliel. Ella sabrá qué hacer.'","Noticias inquietantes","'Echad Eregion se encuentra al sureste de Gwingris. Sigue el camino que sale de Gwingris y lo encontrarás enseguida.'","Lengliel se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Calelloth te ha pedido que le entregues una carta a Lengliel sobre los semiorcos y las sierpes.","'Un placer conocerte y ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} a Echad Eregion. ¿Qué noticias traes de Gwingris?\
\
¿Semiorcos robando huevos de sierpe? Sí, algo sé de eso. Hablemos más sobre el tema...'","Calelloth cree que las noticias sobre los asuntos de los semiorcos con las sierpes de Eregion deben difundirse por todos los campamentos élficos."},
[4335]={"'Jajax, can it be you? And what are you doing with this ${RACE}? Have you lost your edge, brother?'\
\
Jajax and Daxamat laugh and the two men share a brief embrace. Jajax explains your unconventional friendship to Daxamat before asking why he's tending the stables in Hata Kebir.\
\
'As you can see, I am no longer so favoured amongst the Heirs, but I think the horses have grown to appreciate me. Still... why have you come here?'","Search for Jajax's brother","Jajax's brother can be found somewhere in Hata Kebir.\
\
Jajax has begged your aid in finding his brother who he believes is among the forces at Hata Kebir.","Jajax is desperate to find his brother in Hata Kebir and hopes to free him from the misguided rule of the Heirs of Castamir.","'There is another matter I have been hesitant to share, ${PLAYER}. I believe my brother is here among these men, and be it selfishness or sentiment, I want to help him be free from these men before he meets with some grim fate.\
\
'We were separated when our fleet split, you see, for he has long been a favoured deckhand of the Scourge. I did not seek to deny him the honour of serving on such a ship, but now... I wish him to be as far away from the Scourge and his brothers as he can.\
\
'Let us search for him, and then leave this place.'","Divided by War"},
[4337]={"¿Tienen buen sabor los avanc?","'Como sabes, existe el riesgo de que no tengamos suficiente comida para que dure todo el invierno. Hay una población saludable de avancs en el Aguaestancada. Estoy seguro de que, bien cocinados, podrían saber bien. ¿Qué tal son tus habilidades de ${PLAYERNAME:carnicero[m]|carnicera[f]}?'","Derrota avancs cerca de Colmillar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Culhuc siente curiosidad por saber si los avanc serían una buena fuente de alimento.","'¡Bien! Esto me da mucho con lo que experimentar.'","Avancs cerca de Colmillar derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hay una zona de anidación de avanc en el Aguaestancada, al oeste de Lhan Garan, llamada Colmillar.\
\
Mata avancs cerca de Colmillar.","Culhuc está atendiendo el horno comunitario en Lhan Garan.\
\
Habla con Culhuc.","Habla con Culhuc"},
[4338]={"Recoge hierba lobera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Muchas gracias! Me has salvado la semana. Mira, tengo una amiga que viene muy lejos de visita. Hasta ahora solo nos hemos intercambiando cargas. Esta es la primera vez que voy a verla en persona y quiero causar una buena impresión.'","Hazme un sabor","Henepa Nudotorcido se encuentra atendiendo el bar en El Recodo del Codo en el pueblo de Campotieso.\
\
Vuelve con Henepa Nudotorcido.","Recogida hierba lobera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Perdona, ¿podría pedirte que recogieras algo de hierba lobera para mí? No queda en ninguna de las tiendas de por aquí, y tengo que cocinar algunos platos muy especiales. ¿Que por qué no puedo ir yo misma? ¡Pues por los lobos! No se me da mal repartir leña, pero luchar contra lobos no es para mí. Si encuentras un poco, te la pagaré encantada.'","La hierba lobera puede encontrarse en el borde del bosque al norte de Campotieso.\
\
Recoge hierba lobera.","Habla con Henepa Nudotorcido","Henepa Nudotorcido necesita ayuda con un dilema culinario."},
[4339]={"Talk to Shikavi","Shikavi is concerned that her child is romanticizing the life of a Corsair and may travel down a path she cannot follow.","Defeat Kina's guards","'Kina has convinced himself that he will one day rule the Corsairs and even this city. I cannot reach him. I am accused of not being supportive and pushing him away... but I know for a fact these Corsairs do not care for Kina. They use him as a slave with promises of space on one of their boats and a share of spoils.\
\
'I have seen how they treat Kina. Would you please help me get through to him?'","Talk to Kina in the Gut","Shikavi has asked you to try and reach Kina and help him see the realities of pirate life.","Do Right By the Child","You handled Kina's supposed friends, but they ran away in the process. You should tell Shikavi.","Kina has run away disinterested in what you have to say leaving you to deal with his friends.","'Oh my, Kina. How could you?\
\
'I hope you are all right. I did not think it would be so dangerous to speak to my child.\
\
'This is far more serious than I could have ever imagined.'"},
[4340]={"Confront Hûmaraz","Talk to Shikavi","'This has to end here. I fear for my child's life. If he continues down this path, there is only death in his future. And an early one!\
\
'Could you please help convince the captain of Kina's crew to let him go? That is the only way.\
\
'They may even respect this approach more. If Kina will listen to anyone, it's his captain.\
\
'The Captain makes the deepest part of the Gut his home, in the south-east end of the Lower Ward.'","Shikavi is convinced that Kina is in far deeper than she could ever fear.","Do Right By the Family","You have slain Hûmaraz, but Kina ran away again, his feelings hurt by what once was his idol. You should check in with Shikavi.\
\
Shikavi can be found outside of the Black Anchor Tavern.","Shikavi has asked you to appeal to the authority of the captain of the crew of which Kina pretends to be a member.\
\
Captain Hûmaraz can be found on the south-east end of Lower Ward.","'You wish to take Kina from this crew? Kina is no more than a cabin boy, but a good one.\
\
'He listens and obeys, fetches me drinks, and brings me worthy tithings. He is my personal errand-boy and I have no intention of giving him up.\
\
'For this insubordination, I will have your head!'","'Good, you are here! Don't worry! Kina is safe with me. He is crying in his room.\
\
'I don't know what you did or how you did it. But Kina has quit the crew and returned to me. I hope that his stories of fancy with the Corsairs have ended.\
\
'Nonetheless, you have brought him home and I thank you.'"},
[4341]={"'¿Candaith? El nombre no me resulta familiar. Sé esto. Hemos cazado a la sombra de la Cima de los Vientos y hemos visto indicios de un campamento. Es posible que el hombre que buscas acampe allí.\
\
'El campamento puede encontrarse en la base occidental de la Cima de los Vientos.'","¿Conoces a... Candaith?","Candaith se encuentra en su campamento, en el lado occidental de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Los cazadores no conocen el nombre de Candaith, pero han visto indicios de un campamento en la base occidental de la Cima de los Vientos.","Cazadores en el Paso de Moscagua podrían conocer al montaraz Candaith... sin duda vale la pena intentar ver si conocen al montaraz que vigilaba las Tierras Solitarias.","'¿Cazadores procedentes de Bree conocían mi paradero? Tendré que ser cauteloso y redoblar mis esfuerzos por ocultar mis provisiones en el futuro.\
\
'Ahora bien, ¿qué te trae al pie de la Cima de los Vientos? Seguro que no sabías que había un montaraz solitario a la sombra de la Cima de los Vientos que necesitara tu ayuda.'","'Busca el campamento en la base occidental de la Cima de los Vientos. Tal vez la persona que buscas esté allí.'","Habla con Candaith en su campamento"},
[4342]={"Enemy flags can be found outside of the homes in Byre Tor.\
\
You should destroy enemy flags and search the homes for survivors of the White Hand assault.","Investigate the fourth home","Investigate the fifth home","Investigate the third home","The flag is destroyed; you should now search within for survivors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","This home has been thoroughly ravaged by Orcs","This home has been wrecked by Orcs, and no survivors remain within","Investigate the first home","Enemy flags can be found outside of the homes in Byre Tor.\
\
You should destroy Enemy flags and search the homes for survivors of the White Hand assault.","Completado","This home is empty and cold","This home is empty","Destroy enemy flags outside of homes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcs have planted their flags before the doors of Byre Tor homes as a trophy of their thorough efforts at pillaging, but perhaps some people have survived....","This home has been destroyed","Investigate the second home","Tear down enemy flags and investigate homes","You have investigated many homes in Byre Tor, but they are all empty.\
\
It would appear that there are no survivors.","Does Anyone Yet Live","You have torn down the Enemy flags planted at the doors of the destroyed homes in Byre Tor.","Orcs have planted their flags before the doors of Byre Tor homes as a trophy of their thorough efforts at pillaging."},
[4343]={"Defeated swert-hounds throughout the East Wall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cúfaron is at Hestil's camp on Parth Galen.\
\
You have defeated many swert-hounds and should now return to Cúfaron as he asked.","'Greetings to you, ${CLASS}. My name is Cúfaron, and I am a hunter of great skill. Ask anyone! I will not regale you with tales of my many accomplishments, but if you are not careful I fear my companions might!\
\
'Isteron was always very impressed with my stories of the lands to the distant east. Great beasts and dangerous birds can be found there, and I have hunted them all! Rodwen might speak of my prowess in the south-lands. Do you know those mighty four-legged monstrosities, the great mûmakil?'\
\
Cúfaron quickly shakes his head as you ask if he hunted one of those.\
\
'Nay, not as such...but I saw one. In the distance, but still, you have not seen one, have you?'\
\
The hunter regains his composure.\
\
'There are a lot of vile dogs around the East Wall, and I do not think they are creatures of nature. The Rohirrim call them swert-hounds, and they seem to me to be quite evil. You should hunt them, as I plan to do. I think they could cause trouble for us if they get too near to our camp.'","Dogs of Evil","Defeat swert-hounds throughout the East Wall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Swert-hounds can be found throughout the East Wall.\
\
Cúfaron has asked you to hunt some of the swert-hounds that haunt the East Wall.","'You have returned to compare notes with the master hunter? Sounds good to me, ${PLAYER}! I strode about the East Wall and defeated... how many swert-hounds did you defeat?'\
\
Cúfaron listens as you answer, then nods.\
\
'Six? I see, I see. Well, I defeated seven. It is true that you almost bested me. I know it is not a competition, but it is still nice to know the score.\
\
'These creatures are not natural, that much seems certain. Their evil is evident. They were drawn here by something, but I know not what. We should not stay here. The sooner my friends and I can be gone from this place, the better! But I will, of course, continue to hunt the deadliest of creatures for as long as we remain in the East Wall, and you should strive to match me in this, if you can.'","Cúfaron regaled you with tales of his exploits, but he said he has never seen Swert-hounds like the ones that prowl the East Wall.","'You should hunt the swert-hounds that haunt the East Wall, and I shall as well. Let us meet back here, and we can compare tallies?'","Talk to Cúfaron"},
[4344]={"'You may have noticed a number of Wargs roaming about this diseased forest. The Orcs unleashed a large pack of them shortly after our arrival -- presumably to keep our forces at bay while they strengthened their defences.\
\
'Should you wish to hunt them, you will find that the Wargs are fitted with war-collars that make fine trophies; otherwise, we risk having them find us here and bring the Orcs down upon us with their accursed howls.'","Collect war-collars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Orcs of Taur Morvith have unleashed packs of Wargs to harry intruders who would dare approach through the forests to the north.","Dogs of War","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","Collected war-collars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch in Taur Morvith.\
\
You should return the war-collars to Iavassúl.","'It appears that you have dealt with the Wargs admirably! The Orcs will no doubt miss their loathsome companions, but for the time being, this will allow the Malledhrim a free hand as we try to dislodge the Orcs from their outposts in Taur Morvith.'","Wargs can be found roaming throughout Taur Morvith.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to hunt down the Wargs roaming Taur Morvith and collect their war-collars as trophies.","'The hounds of Sauron must be routed, ${PLAYER}. Our forces are slowed by their harassment.'","Bring the collars to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch"},
[4349]={"Complete Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach","'Good, now that you have attained their respect, you will be able to watch over the library district and quell any problems that arise there.\
\
'Each of the districts has its own tokens their people consider valuable. Gather them up and earn their respect and then you will be able to serve them as well.'","Speak to Beriaudur to learn more about the city guard","Beriaudur is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Beriaudur will be pleased to hear you are now acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library.","'Dol Amroth is not a small city. We have stretched and sprawled over the years to cover many an acre, and that's without considering the docks and port. It is a large area for us to patrol and cover. Each section of the city has its own personality and people who call it home. Each has its own needs and dangers.\
\
'Our guards are not all allowed to patrol and keep watch over every section of the city. You must learn that section to earn the right and privilege of serving it.\
\
'You shall start where all young recruits do, with the library. Do a series of tasks for Tolrían and you shall receive some recompense. Return when you have it.'","Complete Hashadîr - Captains of the Crew","Dol Amroth - Joining the City Guard","Beriaudur has much to tell you about the city guard of Dol Amroth.","Speak to Beriaudur","Use the Library Tokens to earn Acquaintance with the Library","Complete Hashadîr - Slavers of Men","The guard has long been responsible for watching over Dol Amroth and ensuring the safety of its townsfolk.","You must be acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library to be allowed to guard over it as part of the Dol Amroth town watch.","To prove yourself able to watch over the library, you must first accomplish a series of tasks.\
\
Tolrían will be able to inform you of the necessary tasks.","Complete Hashadîr - A Place to Lie at Night","'Welcome to Dol Amroth, ${PLAYER}. I have seen you about the city as of late, and you appear to have done much to aid Belfalas and our peoples here. But the threat against us looms ever present, and one must be vigilant in their watch for the shadows.\
\
'If you are interested, we could find a place for you within the city guard. You would need to prove yourself, many times over. Should you rise to the mark though, Dol Amroth would consider you one of her own.\
\
'Speak to me again if you wish to know more.'"},
[4353]={"Defeated bands of corsairs","Defeat Jabbur","Jabbur has been defeated. The armoury is secured.","Retake the armoury.","Dol Amroth - The Armoury","Defeat bands of corsairs (${VALUE}/5)","You are retaking the armoury of Dol Amroth!"},
[4354]={"Defeated bands of corsairs","You are retaking the bank of Dol Amroth!","Defeat Khabec","Defeat bands of corsairs (${VALUE}/8)","Dol Amroth - The Bank","Retake the bank.","Khabec has been defeated. The bank is secured."},
[4355]={"Defeated bands of corsairs","You are retaking the docks of Dol Amroth!","Darîjan has been defeated. The docks are secure.","Dol Amroth - The Docks","Defeat bands of corsairs (${VALUE}/9)","Retake the docks.","Defeat Darîjan"},
[4356]={"Defeated bands of corsairs","Defeat Mîkhin","Mîkhin has been defeated. The Great Hall is secure.","Retake the Great Hall.","You are retaking the Great Hall of Dol Amroth!","Defeat bands of corsairs (${VALUE}/8)","Dol Amroth - The Great Hall"},
[4359]={"Kesekhos has been defeated. The Swan-knight Barracks are secure.","Defeat bands of Corsairs (${VALUE}/8)","Retake the barracks of the Swan-knights.","Defeat Kesekhos","Dol Amroth - The Swan-knights","Defeated bands of Corsairs","You are retaking the barracks of the Swan-knights of Dol Amroth!"},
[4360]={"Retake the warehouse.","Defeated bands of corsairs","Defeat Dabardon","You are retaking the warehouse of Dol Amroth!","Dol Amroth - The Warehouse","Defeat bands of corsairs (${VALUE}/5)","Dabardon has been defeated. The warehouse is secure."},
[4361]={"'Join us on a patrol of the area surrounding the city. This will be a full march, all of the city guard participating in an exercise and show of force. We shall meet outside the gate, ride to Amon Lontir and then loop our way back.\
\
'Along the way we will stop to practice certain maneouvres and do a mock assault on Amon Lontir. We shall be gone for several hours and return to the city around nightfall.\
\
'Speak to me when you are ready to depart.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Once accepted, this quest cannot be cancelled. You must complete the training exercise to finish the quest.</rgb>","'Are you ready to get on with the training exercises?'","The city watch of Dol Amroth is performing a training exercise in which they wish you to participate.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Once accepted, this quest cannot be cancelled. You must complete the training exercise to finish the quest.</rgb>","The city guard has asked you to join it on a patrol of the immediate area.","Returning from the exercise, you discover the city has been taken!","Dol Amroth - Training Exercise","Speak to Beriaudur and start the training exercise"},
[4364]={"Se busca: Pieles dañadas de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Pieles dañadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles dañadas.","Recoge pieles dañadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pieles dañadas de la región de Gondor Occidental.","Tarea de Dol Amroth: Pieles dañadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles dañadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega las pieles dañadas en una caja de recolección"},
[4365]={"Entrega los montones de polvo reluciente a una caja de recolección","Tarea de Dol Amroth: Montones de polvo reluciente","Recoge montones de polvo reluciente (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir montones de polvo reluciente.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger montones de polvo reluciente. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Montones de polvo reluciente de la región de Gondor Occidental.","Se busca: Montones de polvo reluciente de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógelos para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Montones de polvo reluciente recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4366]={"Tarea de Dol Amroth: Vainas de espada picadas","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada picadas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger vainas de espada picadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Entrega las vainas de espada picadas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de la región de Gondor Occidental.","Recoge vainas de espada picadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vainas de espada picadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4367]={"Se busca: Hachas destrozadas de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Se busca: Hachas destrozadas de la región de Gondor Occidental.","Entrega las hachas destrozadas en una caja de recolección","Hachas destrozadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge hachas destrozadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas destrozadas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger hachas destrozadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de Dol Amroth: Hachas destrozadas"},
[4368]={"Entrega las pieles rasgadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles rasgadas.","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Gondor Occidental.","Recoge pieles rasgadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles rasgadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Dol Amroth: Pieles rasgadas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Pieles rasgadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4369]={"Se busca: Suciedad tóxica de la región de Gondor Occidental. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Gondor Occidental.","Tarea de Dol Amroth: Suciedad tóxica","Entrega la suciedad tóxica en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad tóxica.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger suciedad tóxica. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Suciedad tóxica recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoge suciedad tóxica (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Suciedad tóxica de la región de Gondor Occidental."},
[4372]={"'Can you believe this fool brother of mine, ${PLAYER}? Stubborn as a stump, and about half as bright I would wager! We are trying to get this mess sorted out and keep our hides intact, and all he can go on about is this confounded sawmill!\
\
'I prefer my trees not be stomping around before I try to chop them, but he just will not hear a word anyone has been saying....\
\
'You need to help us talk some sense into him, ${PLAYER}, before something terrible happens!'","'My brother Dolmund headed west some hours ago. He said he was going to head up-river towards the falls at the head of the Gorge, looking to cut away any debris that might foul the sawmill's wheel once we get it up and running.\
\
'The trouble is, I have not heard from him since...it seems that even my own fool of a brother cannot be trusted on his own!'","'Have you found Dolmund yet?'","You should speak with Dolmund at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.","Dolmund Has Vanished","'My brother is no better than the rest of those fools.'","You freed Dolmund!","You should find Armund's brother Dolmund and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund said that Dolmund headed west to clear debris from upriver to keep it from fouling the sawmill's wheel.","Rescue Dolmund","Dolmund, Armund's brother, headed west from the sawmill to examine the falls and cut away any debris that might foul the sawmill's wheel, but he has not come back.","Talk to Dolmund"},
[4373]={"<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que Faeldor sea derrotado</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta norte han sido derrotados</rgb>","Resiste el cuarto asalto","Después de destruir la parte inferior de la ciudad, el Enemigo ha lanzado un nuevo asalto sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el primer asalto y permitir a Celebrimbor que prepare las últimas defensas de la Casa de los Mírdain.","Resiste el último asalto","Faeldor se encuentra en la puerta norte de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Has resistido el tercer asalto contra Caras Gelebren, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo os superan ampliamente en número. Debes hablar con Faeldor.","'Es como temíamos: el Enemigo camina entre sus siervos. Me han dicho que todavía se disfraza con la apariencia de Annatar, pero el mal que alberga lucha por no mostrarse en su rostro.\
\
'Sauron ha cesado su ataque por el momento, pero no pasará mucho antes de que sus fuerzas estén de nuevo sobre nosotros.\
\
'Mantén la línea de defensa contra las fuerzas del Enemigo y evita que lleguen a las puertas interiores de Caras Gelebren. Retírate si debes hacerlo, ya que no podemos permitirnos perder más de nuestros guerreros. Mientras tanto, prepararé nuestra última defensa en el interior de los muros.\
\
'Si la hora llegara en que el mismo Enemigo entrase en la ciudad, ¡resistiremos en el mismo umbral de la Casa de los Mírdain!'","El campeón del Enemigo ha sido derrotado, pero la batalla no ha terminado.\
\
Ve a hablar con Celebrimbor.","El segundo asalto ha sido rechazado, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo continúan su avance sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el tercer asalto.","Has rechazado el asalto final contra Caras Gelebren, pero el enemigo ha enviado a uno de sus campeones para asegurarse de sellar el destino de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes derrotar al campeón del Enemigo.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el primer asalto</rgb>","La perdición de Caras Gelebren","<rgb=#00FF00>¡Un cuerno resuena mientras el enemigo renueva el asalto contra Caras Gelebren!</rgb>","El Enemigo ha cruzado la puerta sur de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el cuarto asalto y ayudar a Celebrimbor en la defensa de la Casa de los Mírdain.","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que Celebrimbor sea derrotado</rgb>","Resiste el tercer asalto","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el último asalto</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta sur sean derrotados</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el segundo asalto</rgb>","El Enemigo ha tomado las puertas de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el último asalto y ayudar a Celebrimbor a defender la Casa de los Mírdain.","Habla con Celebrimbor","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el tercer asalto</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Celebrimbor ha caído!</rgb>","Derrota al campeón del Enemigo","'Hemos resistido firmes ante el Enemigo, pero este respiro no durará.\
\
'Las fuerzas de Sauron han rodeado Caras Gelebren, y aunque lo han intentado, los ejércitos de Gil-galad y Elrond todavía no han sido capaces de atravesar sus filas y venir en nuestra ayuda.\
\
'Lloro por todos aquellos que hemos perdido, y rezo porque sus sacrificios no fueran en vano.'","<rgb=#FF0000>¡Faeldor ha caído!</rgb>","Resiste el segundo asalto","Resiste el primer asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta sur han sido derrotados</rgb>","'Los hemos contenido en las puertas hasta ahora, pero no creo que aguantemos mucho más. El Enemigo sabe que no tenemos escapatoria... ¡y juega con nosotros!\
\
'Aún así, con un enemigo acorralado no se debe jugar. Será como ha dicho el señor Celebrimbor. ¡Resistiremos juntos ante la Casa de los Mírdain y expulsaremos al Enemigo de Eregion!\
\
'Debes decirle al señor Celebrimbor que no podremos mantener las puertas mucho más. ¡No te preocupes por mí! ¡Te seguiré lo antes que pueda, y resistiremos juntos antes del final!\
\
'¡Ve!'","El primer asalto ha sido rechazado, pero las fuerzas del Enemigo continúan su avance sobre Caras Gelebren.\
\
Debes resistir el segundo asalto.","Caras Gelebren, el bastión plateado, fue una vez la capital de Tham Mírdain y la joya de Eregion. Por desgracia, la ruina cayó sobre ella cuando Sauron, buscando hacerse con los Anillos de Poder, reunió sus vastos ejércitos y destruyó toda Eregion.","Las fuerzas del Enemigo han invadido la ciudad, y aunque hayas triunfado contra uno de los campeones del Enemigo, Caras Gelebren está perdida.\
\
Debes aguantar junto a Celebrimbor contra el Enemigo.","Defiende Caras Gelebren del Enemigo","<rgb=#00FF00>¡El campeón del Enemigo ha sido derrotado!</rgb>","Celebrimbor está liderando la defensa de Caras Gelebren contra los ejércitos del Enemigo.\
\
Debes hablar con Celebrimbor.","Celebrimbor se encuentra en la Casa de los Mírdain en la parte más oriental de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Faeldor te ha pedido que le digas a Celebrimbor que las fuerzas del Enemigo pronto penetrarán a través de las puertas interiores de Caras Gelebren. Debes hablar con Celebrimbor.","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitas que los guerreros Mírdain de la puerta norte sean derrotados</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has defendido Caras Gelebren contra el cuarto asalto</rgb>","'¡Debes irte! ¡Huye por caminos secretos, guía a los demás hacia el norte y no mires atrás!'","Habla con Faeldor","'¡Ay de Caras Gelebren! ¡Ay de los Mírdain! ¡Qué desgracia haber llegado a esto!\
\
'No dudo de las palabras de Faeldor: las puertas no aguantarán. Debemos defender la Casa de las fuerzas del Enemigo. ¡Sauron no debe encontrar lo que busca!\
\
'Tan pronto como los otros guerreros se hayan replegado, resistiremos...'"},
[4375]={"After informing Hênok of what you discovered you have been asked to return to Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.","Informed Bôgalekh of your victory in Ghâs Hejai","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz and inform them of your triumph over the Hakâri.","'Your findings are troubling indeed, ${CLASS}. It appears the cultists are planning something nefarious.\
\
'It is clear that the Hakâri are preparing to enact a ritual and these notes you gathered have mention of a Khadimâl, who is to perform it.\
\
'Go now and infiltrate the gathering and defeat this Khadimâl. We must disrupt this ritual before it can reach its completion, for the consequences of its completion could be dire.\
\
'I will make haste to Jadambor and inform Bôgalekh of this threat. Return to her once you have stopped the ritual.'","Defeat Khadimâl and stop the Hakâri ritual","Khadimâl must be stopped before they complete their ritual within Ghâs Hejai in Dil-irmíz.","Doomed Invocation","Hênok has asked you to defeat Khadimâl and stop the ritual in Ghâs Hejai.","Defeated Khadimâl and stopped the Hakâri ritual","Discovered the ritual location in Ghâs Hejai","Return to Bôgalekh in Jadambor","Discover the ritual location in Ghâs Hejai","'Ah, ${CLASS}, it gladdens my heart to see you return unharmed. Hênok told me of what you discovered in Ghâs Hejai.\
\
'I am relieved to hear that you have been able to stop this Khadimâl, and prevent their ritual from taking place.\
\
'Your courage and resolve have spared us from the clutches of this threat for now. Accept this as a token of our gratitude for all you have done to help us this day.'"},
[4377]={"'A veces pienso que nunca debí haber dejado las montañas y la casa de mis ancestros, pero busqué una vida de aventuras. Después de demasiados años buscándola, me perdí y luego me reencontré aquí entre los Eglain.\
\
He estado aquí mucho tiempo y me considero uno de ellos, pero hay vestigios de mi propia herencia que nunca se van, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, y esos vestigios se agitan en tiempos como estos.\
\
He escuchado rumores de enanos que trabajan con Orcos para saquear las tumbas bajo las ruinas de Thandobel, al sur. Quiero saber qué clase de enano toleraría a los Orcos, y mucho menos se dignaría a trabajar junto a ellos. Ve a Thandobel y tráeme una de sus banderas.'","Enanos hoscos","En Annunlos yace una ruina, abandonada desde hace mucho por los Eglain. Despojada y con sólo las profundidades sin explorar, los Eglain dejaron lo que había bajo la ruina, como es su costumbre. Sin embargo, la ruina ahora vuelve a rebosar de vida, pues enanos, presumiblemente aliados con Orcos, registran las profundidades en busca de tesoros.","Entrega la bandera a Refr Mercurio","Bandera de los enanos recogida","Recoge una bandera de los enanos","Las ruinas de Thandobel se encuentran al sur de Refr Mercurio, en Annunlos.\
\
Refr Mercurio expresó su deseo de saber qué clase de enanos se dignarían a trabajar junto a los Orcos y te ha pedido que vayas a las ruinas de Thandobel y captures una de sus banderas.","'Conozco este blasón. Mi padre me habló de una revuelta y una batalla hace mucho tiempo contra un ejército de Elfos en Ered Luin. Skorgrím, un líder de los Duramano, a quien pertenece este blasón, dirigió el asalto y llevó a los Duramano casi a la destrucción.\
\
Fue enterrado bajo las montañas por las rápidas acciones del líder de los Elfos, que se sacrificó para impedir la victoria de Skorgrím.\
\
Duramano aliados con Orcos... noticias sombrías, y no hay duda de lo que debe venir a continuación.'","'Ningún enano que se respete soportaría la vista de un Orco, y mucho menos ayudaría a esas criaturas inmundas. O los enanos de Ost Cyrn están bajo el dominio de un sombrío hechicero, o deben ser destruidos.\
\
Necesito tu ayuda para determinar cuál es el caso. Tráeme una de las banderas que ondean alrededor de su fortaleza.'"},
[4378]={"Teodoro Tojo está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Spalvi te ha dado la Piedra de Roth para que se la des a Teodoro Tojo, ya que él no debe ya lealtad a los Duramano y no quiere conservar su tesoro.","Dale la Piedra de Roth a Haley Pradodulce en Gwingris","La Cordillera de Acebeda está al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Spalvi te ha pedido que viajes con él hasta la Cordillera de Acebeda , desde donde tendréis una buena vista de las tierras de alrededor y deberíais ser capaz de ver a cualquier Duramano que se aproxime a vuestra posición.","Habla con Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda, al sureste de Gwingris","Explora el camino que va hacia el norte de Eregion al Bosque de los Trolls, y mantente alerta de cualquier cosa sospechosa","Spalvi está esperando para hablar contigo antes de viajar al Paso del Cuerno Rojo en busca de entradas de cuevas que pudieran acercaros a Bingo.","Dale la Piedra de Roth a Teodoro Tojo en Gwingris","Spalvi te ha pedido que te quedes cerca de él y <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> a la distancia desde la Cordillera de Acebeda para ver si detectas a alguno de los Duramano que os persiguen.","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en el noroeste de Eregion.\
\
Has encontrado un hacha clavada en un árbol no muy lejos de Gwingris, y deberías llevársela a Spalvi.","'¡${PLAYER}! ¿Has encontrado algo fuera de lo común?'\
\
Le muestras a Spalvi el hacha que sacaste del árbol, y su rostro se vuelve pálido.\
\
'Sí, es lo que temía. Es un hacha Duramano, y algo más: un mensajes. Mientras viajábamos, sospechaba que nos estaban rastreando, y ahora veo que tenía razón. Un grupo de los de mi gente nos persigue, ¡y esta amenazadora hacha fue dejada ahí para intimidarnos!\
\
'¡Bien, pues no funcionará! Debemos seguir buscando a Bingo. Pero también debemos permanecer alerta, ya que podríamos ser atacados en cualquier momento. Viajemos hacia el sureste, a la Cordillera de Acebeda. ¡Desde sus alturas, tendremos una buena vista de los alrededores y deberíamos ver a cualquier Duramano que intente atacarnos!'","'Oh cielos, ${PLAYER}. ¿Dónde has encontrado esto? ¡Estoy asombrada por tal muestra de artesanía enana, y por el empleo de materiales tan sublimes!'\
\
Le dices a Haley que es un regalo de Spalvi, y que puede quedárselo, ya que Teodoro no quería tener nada que ver con ello, pensando que era falso.\
\
'¿Que él qué? Ah, ya veo.'\
\
Haley se guarda la Piedra de Roth y sonríe.\
\
'Te doy las gracias por el regalo, ${PLAYER}, y por la oportunidad de enseñar a Teodoro otra valiosa lección... ¡sobre cosas valiosas!'","Lleva el hacha amenazadora a Spalvi en Gwingris, en Eregion","'¿Ya has lanzado esa elaborada burla a una zanja? ¡Nada así de impresionante podría ser auténtico!'","'¿No has visto a nadie? ¡No sé si eso me hace sentir mejor o peor, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Bueno, no es nada entonces. Continuaremos con el plan: ¡subir al Paso del Cuerno Rojo y buscar entradas a cuevas que nos acerquen más a Bingo!'","Miras a lo lejos pero no ves ninguna señal de Duramanos persiguiéndote","Spalvi está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.","Spalvi se ha ido poniendo cada vez más nervioso por algo, lo que no parece algo normal en él. ¿Qué le preocupa?","''Ya no debo lealtad a los Duramano, y no necesito este tesoro. ¿Por qué no se lo das a Teodoro Tojo? Ha estado buscando tesoros desde que llegó, ¡y al fin podría poseer uno!'","Haley Pradodulce está en las ruinas de Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Convencido de que era falso y sin valor, Teodoro no quiso quedarse con la Piedra de Roth. Quizás Haley Pradodulce opine de forma diferente.","'Debemos seguir buscando a Bingo. Pero también debemos permanecer alerta, ya que podríamos ser atacados en cualquier momento. Viajemos hacia el sureste, a la Cordillera de Acebeda. ¡Desde sus alturas, tendremos una buena vista de los alrededores y deberíamos ver a cualquier Duramano que intente atacarnos!'","Habla con Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda y asciende las montañas para buscar a Bingo","Sacas el hacha del árbol, y reflexionas sobre su significado","Spalvi está nervioso por algo, y quería que echaras un vistazo al camino que tomasteis desde el Bosque de los Trolls a Eregion en busca de algo sospechoso. El camino deja Gwingris al sureste antes de girar al norte y continuar hacia el Bosque de los Trolls.","''¿Recuerdas el sendero que usamos para entrar en Eregion desde el Bosque de los Trolls? ¿Crees que podrías volver por él y ver si Willem está por allí, o si encuentras algo sospechoso? Deja Gwingris al sureste y el camino girará al norte. ¡No vayas demasiado lejos! Apreciaría que eches un vistazo a ese sendero, eso es todo.'","'¿Recuerdas el sendero que usamos para entrar en Eregion desde el Bosque de los Trolls? ¿Crees que podrías volver por él y ver si Willem está por allí, o si encuentras algo sospechoso? Deja Gwingris al sureste y el camino girará al norte. ¡No vayas demasiado lejos! Apreciaría que eches un vistazo a ese sendero, eso es todo.'","Quédate cerca de Spalvi en la Cordillera de Acebeda","'¿Puedo pedirte algo, ${PLAYER}? ¿Has visto a Willem Bigotes por algún lado? Creo que no confía mucho en mí, pero pienso que tenerlo cerca sería útil, y me sentía mejor si sus dientes y garras estuvieran a mano... solo por si acaso.\
\
Spalvi mira alrededor, nervioso.\
\
'¿Recuerdas el sendero que usamos para entrar en Eregion desde el Bosque de los Trolls? ¿Crees que podrías volver por él y ver si Willem está por allí, o si encuentras algo sospechoso? Deja Gwingris al sureste y el camino girará al norte. ¡No vayas demasiado lejos! Apreciaría que eches un vistazo a ese sendero, eso es todo.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> al horizonte desde la cima de la Cordillera de Acebeda","Spalvi te entrega la Piedra de Roth con una sonrisa torcida","Retira el hacha del árbol","'No veo a ninguno de los de mi gente aproximándose. Quizá tú debas <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> también, ${PLAYER}. Los grupos de asalto Duramano no son conocidos por su sigilo, ¡pero no quiero que nos sorprendan!'","'Te agradezco este regalo, ${PLAYER}, y por la oportunidad de enseñar a Teodoro otra valiosa lección... ¡sobre cosas valiosas!'","'Bien, debo decirte que me siento como si me hubieran quitado un gran peso de encima. No, no hablo de la Piedra de Roth. Eso era solo oro y rubí, y su peso era puramente material. ¡No es siempre el caso con artefactos de manufactura enana, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'El peso del que hablo era el peso de mi nombre. Ahora sé algo que no sabía antes: ya no soy un Duramano. Ese nombre, y esa vida, han quedado atrás.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Un cambio de nombre' (Nivel recomendado: 50)</rgb>","'No veo a ninguno de los de mi gente aproximándose. Quizá tú debas <rgb=#FF0000>mirar</rgb> también, ${PLAYER}. Los grupos de asalto Duramano no son conocidos por su sigilo, ¡pero no quiero que nos sorprendan!\
'¡Una vez te hayas asegurado de que no nos siguen, habla conmigo y podremos viajar al Paso del Cuerno Rojo para buscar entradas a cuevas que puedan llevarnos a estar más cerca de encontrar a Bingo!'","Habla con Spalvi en Gwingris, en Eregion","'¿Mmm? ¿Qué es esto? ¿Me das este colgante brillante?'\
\
Teodoro lo observa con ojos entrecerrados y lo examina.\
\
'Esto es una prueba, ¿verdad? ¡Haley está intentando engañarme! Me ha estado hablando una y otra vez sobre lo que define el significado de 'tesoro' y lo que no, ¡y esta debe ser otra lección!\
\
'¡Es una falsificación muy buena, te lo concedo, pero Teodoro Gorse se ha vuelto un buscador de tesoros muy astuto y no caerá ante este audaz engaño! ¡Llévate tu elaborada burla de mi vista, ${PLAYER}! Te aconsejaría que la lanzaras a una zanja... ¡así de convencido estoy de que este bello y brillante colgante es una convincente falsificación!'","Caras duras","Ves un hacha clavada en un árbol, junto al camino","'Gracias por tu ayuda ahí arriba, ${PLAYER}, ¡y a ti también, Willem! Thóvarg y el resto no sabían a quién se enfrentaban, ¡y cuando se dieron cuenta ya era demasiado tarde! ¡Es tan estúpido como típico!\
\
'¿Puedes creer que pensaban que yo había robado la Piedra de Roth cuando escapé con Bingo, ${PLAYER}? ¿Qué necesidad tengo yo de la Estrella de Skorgrím?'\
\
Spalvi esboza una sonrisa burlona y abre su mochila. De dentro, saca cuidadosamente un collar dorado con una gran piedra roja en el centro.\
\
'Ya no debo lealtad a los Duramano, y no necesito este tesoro. ¿Por qué no se lo das a Teodoro Tojo? Ha estado buscando tesoros desde que llegó, ¡y al fin podría poseer uno!'","Un hacha está clavada en un árbol junto al camino que lleva desde Eregion al Bosque de los Trolls."},
[4379]={"La entrada a Sarnúr está al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de Noglond, en las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Tórth te ha pedido que entres en la fortaleza de los Duramano en Sarnúr y acabes con las criaturas que habitan allí, reclamando los blasones duramano como prueba de tu valor.","'¿Has vuelto sin los blasones? ¡Los Duramano deben pagar por sus actos! Regresa cuando hayas reunido los blasones duramano.'","Los descendientes de Skorgrím Duramano han sido desde siempre una espina para el linaje de Durin, los Barbiluengos. Aunque ahora son parias, continúan siendo una amenaza para los Pueblos Libres de Ered Luin.","'¿Has regresado con los blasones duramano? Bien está. El precio de sangre impuesto por las fechorías de los Duramano es alto, y estos blasones no son más que una ínfima parte del pago que deben a los Enanos de la Mansión de Thorin.'","Blasones Duramano — Introducción","Recolecta blasones duramano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Blasón Duramano recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los blasones duramano a Tórth","'A tu servicio, ${CLASS}. Los Duramano han sido expulsados de la Mansión de Thorin, pero nuestra ira por sus actos aún no ha sido saciada. Muchos de los Barbiluengos sufrieron enormemente bajo Gormr, y su traición debe ser pagada con venganza.\
\
'Se rumorea que los Duramano han encontrado restos de su antiguo hogar, perdido cuando el mundo se quebró, en las ruinas de Orodost — los Elfos llaman ahora a ese lugar Sarnúr. Viaja al sur de la Mansión de Thorin hasta esta ciudad y mata a los Duramano que encuentres allí.\
\
'Los enanos menores y los sirvientes deberían portar el blasón de la familia Duramano; tráeme esos blasones para que podamos pagar sangre con sangre.'"},
[4380]={"Dourhands in a Bind","Captured Dourhands can be found at Sadauk-kala in western Máttugard.\
\
You should free the captured Dourhands.","Recupera las provisiones robadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Stolen supplies can be found at Sadauk-kala in Máttugard.\
\
You should recover the stolen supplies.","Talk to one of the freed Dourhands","Freed captured Dourhands (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to one of the freed Dourhands.","The group of Dourhands looks weary. One musters enough effort to speak up for the rest.\
\
'Thank you, ${CLASS}. We are indebted to your kindness. I hate to ask more of you but, well, we are traders, and all of our goods to trade were stolen by those hobgoblins that captured us! Would you be able to retrieve our supplies, good ${CLASS}? It is all we have.'","Free the captured Dourhands","Free the captured Dourhands (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The freed Dourhands can be found near Steepset in Máttugard.\
\
You should bring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands.","You find a few of greedy Dourhands who have been captured by the hobgoblin forces here in Sadauk-kala. It is only a matter of time before the hobgoblins obtain useful information from the Dourhands, and they would certainly use what they learn against those who seek to reclaim the Mountain-hold. You decide to rescue the Dourhands.","Provisiones robadas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the supplies to one of the freed Dourhands","You return the supplies to the Dourhands. They look relieved to have their trade-goods returned.\
\
'We have very little to offer to repay such an act of kindness. I am sorry. All we can offer is our word that our barter prices will be fair! We thank you again, brave ${CLASS}.'","A small group of greedy Dourhands has been captured by the hobgoblin forces in Máttugard."},
[4381]={"Busca una cubeta vacía","Debes decirle a Erina que has apagado muchos de los incendios en la granja Hove.\
\
Erina está en la granja Sculoc, al norte de Cardolan.","Incendios apagados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ahora que tienes un cubo de agua, puedes apagar las llamas que devoran la granja de la familia Hove.\
\
La granja se encuentra en el norte de Cardolan.","Vuelve a Erina","'¿Lo has conseguido? ¡Oh, gracias, gracias! ¡Espero que podamos volver pronto a casa!'","¡Esta cubeta es perfecto para la tarea!","Apagar las llamas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Erina te ha pedido que apagues los incendios en la granja de la familia Hove. Debes buscar una cubeta en la granja Scurloc con el que llenar de agua para apagar las llamas.\
\
La granja Scurloc se encuentra en el norte de Cardolan.","Llena la cubeta en la granja de los Hove","Has encontrado una cubeta vacía, pero ahora tienes que llenarla de agua.\
\
Deberías encontrar el estanque en la granja de la familia Hove, al norte de Cardolan.","El agua se derrama por los lados de la cubeta","Apagando el incendio de la granja","'¿Quién eres? ¿Has venido a ayudarnos? ¡Por favor, di que sí!\
\
'Unos malditos trasgos han asaltado nuestra granja! Quiero irme a casa, pero siguen ahí y puedo ver el humo desde aquí. Por favor, por favor, ¿puedes apagar los incendios? ¡Si no lo haces, todo se quemará! ¡Tienes que ayudarnos!\
\
'Tenemos un precioso estanque donde puedes llenar la cubeta y usarla para apagar los incendios.'","¡La granja de la familia Hove está en llamas tras un ataque de feroces trasgos!"},
[4382]={"Defeat Mordor Spear-fishers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Sigeric","This scout was forcibly drowned by the Orcs - a cruel end...","Find the second Rohirrim scout","Down By The Docks","'The morning my croft was attacked was a very strange one indeed.\
\
'We had heard the troubles surrounding Garsfeld, but for our own part, we faced very little danger from our enemies in the Sutcrofts. They seemed to have little interest in attacking us... though I do not know why.\
\
'Also, while it was not completely unheard of, three of our best riders, and also three of my closest friends, left the croft that morning to go fishing at what they thought to be a lucky fishing hole south-east of Snowbourn.\
\
'While they were gone, the attack fell, and all were slain, save for me. Even as I stood bound to that pole, they did not return. I know not where they are now, and if you would find them for me, I would be very grateful.\
\
'I would begin your search at the fishing docks to the south-east... if they are not there, I know not where else they could be...'","Find the third Rohirrim scout","Sigeric, the man you rescued from the sacked farmstead, has asked that you look for three Men that left the morning of the attack to go fishing. They have not returned and Sigeric fears the worst.","Sigeric, the survivor of Garsfeld, can be found in northern Snowbourn.","Defeated Mordor Spear-fishers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sigeric wants you to look for three men dispatched to deal with the Orc situation outside the fishing village to the south-east.\
\
He also wants you to slay the Orcs that have sacked the town.","This scout was clearly slain by the nearby Orcs","'I - I should have expected this, ${PLAYER}... but it does not dull my pain.\
\
'Those men were great warriors, and it is a shame that such ill fortune found them when they could have aided us so greatly at the croft.\
\
'I need some time to consider these losses, friend. Thank you for aiding me, but please leave me to my thoughts for now.'","Find the first Rohirrim scout"},
[4383]={"Defeat Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Orcs hide yet in the vales of the Emyn-nu-Fuin. I would ask you to defeat any Orcs that you come across while you are in my domain.'","You have defeated many Orcs in Eryn Lasgalen and have assisted the Elves in their efforts to restore the forest.","Orcs who escaped the Battle Under the Trees now hide in the vicinity of the Emyn-nu-Fuin.","Defeated Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated many Orc-kind in Eryn Lasgalen.","Completado","Down From the Emyn-nu-Fuin","Orcs can be found scattered throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
King Thranduil has bade you defeat any Orc-kind you come across."},
[4384]={"Murig can be found at the watch-tower in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should bang on the door to see if Murig will be foolish enough to come down from his eyrie.","Murig has been driven off once again","'You have done better than I could have hoped to do myself, ${PLAYER}; the watch-tower is ours again! I wish that you could join our clan for good.\
\
'Trum Dreng would be so much safer if you were here.'","Bang on the door to the watch-tower to summon Murig","Down From the Tower","Elain can be found on the hill that leads to the watch-tower, defending against approaching Dragon-clansmen in the plains.\
\
You should return to Elain and tell her that the watch-tower has been reclaimed for the Stag-clan.","'Try banging on the door and see if Murig comes down. He might think it is his own kin making the commotion.'","'The leader of this band has taken up residence within the watch-tower. With them peering out over all the lands from such a high point, we cannot hope to secure Trum Dreng once more without a full army. Alas that my peoples have grown so few and weak.\
\
'But there is still hope, ${PLAYER}. If we can cut our way through to the tower, we can surely call Murig down from high. He will surely think that a commotion at the door will be his own folk making the noise. He will come down, I think, and we can defeat him on the ground.'","Return to Elain on the path to the watch-tower","Murig has settled at the watch-tower of Trum Dreng. If this waypoint is to be secured, he must be called down and defeated so that the Stag-clan can reclaim it."},
[4385]={"Return to Cíllan at the refugee camp","Cíllan hopes to make a payment on the manor to secure a place to live for her people with the savings you recovered from Langhold.","'This is not half of the price that I quoted to you. What is the meaning of this?'\
\
You explain Cíllan's plea that this will be a down payment, and that the rest be paid over time as the people of Langhold work. After all... they have nothing. They must build it all again.\
\
'Fine. But I expect payment every month. I will give Cíllan a year to make up the difference. But it is really a kindness on my part. Too kind. I begin to think that people take advantage.\
\
'Here, take the keys before I change my mind!'","Bring Cíllan's first payment to Frithbéorth","'Please take this money to Frithbéorth, ${PLAYER}, and see if he will accept it as a payment to secure his family manor. Please, see if he will let us stay and pay the rest over time. The people of Langhold are honest, and true to their word.\
\
'The guards are still on the look-out for you, so do be careful in Harwick. I will speak with the Reeve, for Harding was a friend of my husband's. I will not rest until he has released his grudge against you!\
\
'You have helped us so much, and I endeavour now to help you.'","Down Payment","'Oh, ${PLAYER}... I cannot express my thanks enough. Rats we can handle ourselves, and money we can earn in plenty, once we are settled. I will continue to seek an audience with Harding to clear his bad opinion of you.\
\
'It is unjust that such a noble ${RACE} could receive such hostile treatment from the Reeve of the Wold, after all you did for us.\
\
'No matter how Harding may behave, you have my thanks. I will never forget your deeds.'","'Here are the keys. You bought it as-is, so I don't want to hear anything about what condition you find it in.'","Frithbéorth reluctantly hands over the keys to his family's large manor.","Cíllan awaits you at the refugees' camp outside of Harwick.\
\
You should hasten to Cíllan to hand her the keys and tell her of the deal with Frithbéorth... and it would be wise to mention the rats as well.","Speak to Frithbéorth to enter the manor","Frithbéorth is in Harwick, waiting patiently for a delivery of three-hundred gold to secure the purchase of his family's large manor.\
\
You should bring Cíllan's down payment to Frithbéorth and see if he will accept it."},
[4386]={"Se pueden encontrar orcos a lo largo de todo el camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, al noroeste de Talan Haldir.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de orcos que han salido del interior de las montañas.","'Los orcos han salido desde el interior de las montañas hacia Nanduhirion, el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, al noroeste. Debes matar a estos enemigos dondequiera que los veas si quieres ser amigo de los Elfos de Lórien.'","Derrota orcos en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcos derrotados en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hadroneth está preocupado por la gran cantidad de orcos que han salido de las puertas de Moria hacia el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, y quiere que reduzcas su número.","Desde las montañas","'Nunca había visto a los orcos así, ${PLAYER}; salen a raudales de las puertas de Moria como no lo habían hecho en años, y establecen campamentos y puestos a lo largo de todo el camino entre aquí y allí.\
\
'Si deseas ser amigo de Lórien, debes ayudarnos a disuadir a los orcos de este empeño. Busca a estos enemigos al noroeste y derrotálos dondequiera que los encuentres en Nanduhirion.\
\
'Cuantos más orcos mates, más segura será la ruta entre Lothlórien y Moria. Su audacia me preocupa mucho.'","Hadroneth se encuentra en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel.\
\
El elfo Hadroneth está esperando que le informes de tu éxito en la eliminación de los orcos que han salido de las Puertas de Moria hacia Nanduhirion.","'Lo has hecho bien, ${PLAYER}. No olvidaremos tu ayuda, aunque siempre haya más por hacer.'"},
[4387]={"Lleva el broche a Ringhul en el Páramo Alto","'¿El pequeño elfo Ringhul te envía conmigo? Es amigo mío, así que no te pisotearé, creo yo.\
\
'¿Un gigante en las tierras del sur? No lo creo. Si siguiera allí, lo sabrías. ¡Quizá ese gigante dejó caer un peñasco y tuvo que bajar de la montaña a buscarlo!\
\
'Es extraño... muchos gigantes hacen cosas extrañas últimamente.'","¿Bajado de las Montañas?","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","Arifael vive en las laderas de Amon Nendir, al sur del Páramo Alto, en el borde oriental del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
A Elrohir le preocupan las huellas de gigante que viste en Tâl Bruinen y quiere que preguntes a Arifael si ha oído hablar de gigantes que vaguen tan al sur.","Has descubierto una serie de huellas de gigante en Tâl Bruinen y un broche perteneciente a Ringhul, montaraz del Páramo Alto.","Habla con Arifael","'Te doy la bienvenida. ¿Encontraste este broche en la huella de un gigante? Ciertamente lo perdí en Tâl Bruinen, pero no vi ninguna huella de gigante allí. Los gigantes no suelen viajar tan al sur; Tâl Bruinen ha estado libre de ellos tanto como puedo recordar.\
\
'Si hay un gigante merodeando por esas tierras, me gustaría saber qué buscaba.\
\
'Habla con Arifael —un tipo de gigante mejor, por así decirlo— en su hogar en las laderas de Amon Nendir. La colina está al sur del Páramo Alto. Quizá él sepa algo de los movimientos de este gigante.'","'Si crees que has terminado aquí, podrías viajar al Páramo Alto. Estoy seguro de que Ringhul agradecería la devolución de su broche. Además, puede que sepa algo del gigante que pasó por Tâl Bruinen no hace mucho; se dice que hay un lugar habitado por gigantes no muy lejos de su puesto.\
\
'Si tomas el sendero hacia el norte de vuelta al camino principal y luego sigues hacia el este, llegarás al Vado del Bruinen. Cruza el Vado y viaja hacia el sur, siguiendo el sendero que sube hacia las colinas. En lo alto de la meseta del Páramo Alto encontrarás el puesto de Ringhul.'","Ringhul está en su puesto en el Páramo Alto, al norte y al este de Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Candelleth te dijo que el broche que encontraste pertenece a un antiguo explorador suyo llamado Ringhul, que ahora está destinado en el Páramo Alto, y sugirió que se lo lleves y le preguntes acerca del gigante."},
[4388]={"Habla con Andreg en el Fuerte del Camino Verde","Colina abajo","'Con tu ayuda y la ayuda de esos Montaraces... ¿los Montaraces, viniste a mí por ellos, verdad? Bueno, debería darles las gracias, pero ahora que tengo mis notas y concentración, quiero ponerme a investigar estas ruinas.\
\
'¿Estarías ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a bajar la colina hacia el oeste, hasta el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, para decirle a ese tal Andreg que le agradezco su ayuda?\
\
'Quizá quieras mencionar también a los orcos que merodean por el norte.'","'¿Oddvarr? No puedo decir que recuerde el nombre ni al enano. Si dices que era olvidadizo, entonces quizá quiso enviarte con Saeradan.\
\
'Esta otra noticia es inquietante. Debemos investigar, me temo.'","Oddvarr finalmente recordó que pidió ayuda antes de tu llegada.","Andreg está en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde, al oeste de Hengstacer.\
\
Oddvarr te pidió que le dijeras al Montaraz Andreg que agradece la ayuda de los Montaraces y que los orcos han bajado desde los tramos orientales de las Quebradas del Norte."},
[4390]={"Glóin está acampado fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que encuentres a Glóin y le pidas ayuda para hallar a Glorwen.","'¿Así que Colmillo Negro te reveló el destino de Glorwen antes de que su propia manada lo hiciera pedazos? Considero que ese final es apropiado para un monstruo así... pero no para la pobre Glorwen.\
\
'Solo queda un rayo de esperanza: el odio de los trasgos hacia mi gente es tal que no matarán a Glorwen si pueden evitarlo. Prefieren mantenerla en trabajos interminables y tormento constante hasta quebrar su voluntad, hasta que pierda la razón o muera por su propia mano.\
\
'Por fortuna, Glorwen no es una doncella frágil que pueda romperse fácilmente ante criaturas como esas, así que quizás tengamos algo de tiempo para lograr su rescate... pero no permitiré que sufra un solo minuto más bajo las “tiernas” manos de los trasgos.\
\
'He oído que Glóin, un enano pero aun así un amigo, ha montado un campamento fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Encuéntralo y él compartirá contigo lo que sabe de las profundidades y mazmorras ocultas bajo ese lugar.'","Tras derrotar al líder de la manada de huargos, Colmillo Negro, y descubrir el posible paradero de la cazadora élfica desaparecida, Glorwen, ahora afrontas la sombría tarea de adentrarte en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos para rescatarla.","'¡Déjame en paz! ¡Tócame otra vez y te romperé el brazo como hice con el último de ustedes, bestias inmundas, que se atrevió a intentarlo!\
\
'¡Oh! Discúlpame... En esta oscuridad eterna uno no espera ver un rostro amigo en la puerta... ¿Quién eres y cómo has llegado a este lugar infernal? ¿Eres un prisionero que ha encontrado una forma de escapar? ¿O un ${RACE} verdaderamente insensato que ha bajado aquí por su propia voluntad?\
\
'No importa, no importa. Lo único que importa ahora es liberar a los demás y encontrar la manera de huir de esta prisión mortal, antes de que encontremos nuestro final tan lejos de la luz de las estrellas.'","'¿Creen que un Elfo está atrapado en las mazmorras allá abajo? La Ciudad de los Trasgos ha despertado de nuevo, y temo que haya más de un prisionero perdido en esas profundidades. No recuerdo dónde están las mazmorras por dentro; fue hace mucho tiempo. Te corresponderá a ti explorar y descubrir dónde los mantienen.'","Abajo, Abajo a la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Glorwen está prisionera en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que encuentres y rescates a la exploradora Glorwen.","'¡Rápido, ${PLAYER}! ¡Debes encontrar a Glorwen en la Ciudad de los Trasgos antes de que sea demasiado tarde!'"},
[4391]={"'Está hecho entonces, y ya es tarde para cambiarlo. Ay de mí...\
\
'Temo haber cometido un error mayor que nunca. Uno de los Hombres vino aquí y lo enfrenté. Temo que eso haya sido un error.'","Pagos iniciales","Habla con Adso Henoloma","Dirígete a la Vieja Granja Dulcésped, al noreste del campamento de Adso, y ayuda a Adso a ahuyentar a los bandidos de su campamento.\
\
Adso no encuentra otra forma de expulsar a los bandidos que no implique violencia. Te envió a luchar y derrotar bandidos cerca de la Vieja Granja Dulcésped.","Bandidos derrotados en la Vieja Granja Dulcésped (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Adso Henoloma te ha pedido ayuda en una acción seria contra los bandidos que lo extorsionan y amenazan a él y a sus trabajadores.","'No me enorgullece pedir esto, pero debo pensar en mis trabajadores.'","'No sé qué hacer. Los bandidos me dijeron que les pagara tres cuotas iguales y que perdonarían a mis trabajadores y a mí. Cumplí mi parte del trato. Ahora quieren más. No me queda nada después de enviar trabajadores a Los Gamos por provisiones y las escasas recompensas que puedo ofrecer a la gente que ayuda aquí y allá.\
\
'No puedo permitir que mis trabajadores sufran por mis errores. Temo que tal vez deba detener la construcción de la posada, pero el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar está trabajando contra los bandidos aquí... así que debo preguntar. ¿Estarías ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ayudarme a enviar un mensaje a estos bandidos?\
\
'He oído que ya has hecho algo contra los bandidos antes... disculpa si me equivoco. Pero estos son Hombres malvados y deben ser detenidos. Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ayudar, ¿podrías regresar a la Vieja Granja Dulcésped y enviar un mensaje a esos bandidos? La Vieja Granja Dulcésped está a poca distancia al noreste de aquí.'","Derrota bandidos en la Vieja Granja Dulcésped (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Adso Henoloma espera tu regreso en su campamento, al suroeste de la Vieja Granja Dulcésped, junto al Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Debes regresar con Adso Henoloma con noticias de tu éxito."},
[4392]={"'¡No puedo soportar a esos repugnantes y enfermizos dragoncillos en esta antigua ciudad!'","'He visto algunos dragoncillos de aspecto muy siniestro durante mis viajes por las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, pero no tenía ni idea de dónde podría estar su colmena hasta que llegué aquí. Creo que han establecido su hogar en esta antigua ciudad.\
\
'Si los matas en su propia guarida, creo que acabaremos con toda la población de estas amenazas en todo el territorio del Cuerno de Plata. ¿Nos ayudarás, ${PLAYER}?'","Informa a Öndótt de que la población de dragoncillos ha disminuido","Los siniestros dragoncillos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata han acabado con varios enanos que transportaban suministros entre los campamentos enanos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata y las Obras Hidráulicas.","Dragoncillos de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata","Öndótt se encuentra en lo alto de la escalera de la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver con Öndótt.","Dragoncillo derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","En la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata, situada al sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, se pueden encontrar dragoncillos enfermos.\
\
Deberías acabar con muchos de los dragoncillos enfermos.","Mata a los dragoncillos en la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Te estoy profundamente agradecido! Creo que esto supondrá un gran cambio para los enanos de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata. Te doy las gracias, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'¿Te ha dicho alguien alguna vez lo increíblemente útil que pareces ser?'"},
[4393]={"Guto can be found at his small camp-site in the southern fields of Trum Dreng.\
\
You should return to Guto with the White Hand symbols you collected.","Dragon-clansmen in the White Hand encampment show signs of belonging to Isengard instead of acting upon their own motives.\
\
You should collect evidence of the White Hand from the Dragon-clan warriors of the encampment.","Return to Guto at his encampment","Collected symbols of the White Hand (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Dragon-clan must be taught a lesson if they are to attack their fellow Men at the bidding of Isengard.","'The Dragon-clan killed my father, and I was more than ready to believe that they have attacked Trum Dreng for no better reason than their own menace.\
\
'It would seem that they are being driven by a force larger than themselves, however. What does the White Hand have to do with it? Does not that emblem belong to Isengard?\
\
'If you would, go collect emblems of the White Hand from the Dragon-clansmen at the encampment. They should be ashamed for attacking their own people at Isengard's bidding!'","Dragons with White Hands","Collect symbols of the White Hand (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'How do your efforts against the Dragon-clan go thus far, ${PLAYER}? Is this not much better than standing around, thinking and waiting, as my grandfather does?'","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! This is just what I was looking for.\
\
'It is the queerest thing, is it not? The Dragon-clan has always acted on its own.\
\
'No matter; now that we have proof that Isengard is involved, we shall attack them too!'"},
[4398]={"Fabrica una caja de pociones para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de pociones para Umbar Baharbêl.","Pociones para todos (Diario)","El gremio de eruditos de Umbar Baharbêl suministra pociones para los curanderos. Te pidieron que ayudes a satisfacer la demanda.","'Excelente. Nos apresuraremos a llevarlas a los curanderos de toda la ciudad para que no se agoten sus suministros.'","Caja de pociones fabricada para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","'El conocimiento es una búsqueda interminable. En el gremio de eruditos, ofrecemos a la población que demanda nuestras mercancías lo que podemos, mientras mantenemos el mayor valor de los descubrimientos solo para el gremio. Como miembro, debes entender que algunos de los secretos y conocimientos que posees podrían ser fácilmente torcidos para un propósito nefasto. No volveremos a recorrer ese camino. Por ahora, abasteceremos a los curanderos y a otros con mercancías que puedan vender. Te pedimos que nos ayudes en este esfuerzo.'"},
[4399]={"Fabrica una caja de pociones para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de pociones para Umbar Baharbêl.","Pociones para todos (Diario)","El gremio de eruditos de Umbar Baharbêl suministra pociones para los curanderos. Te pidieron que ayudes a satisfacer la demanda.","'Excelente. Nos apresuraremos a llevarlas a los curanderos de toda la ciudad para que no se agoten sus suministros.'","Caja de pociones fabricada para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Proporciona la caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","Entrega una caja de pociones al líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.","'El conocimiento es una búsqueda interminable. En el gremio de eruditos, ofrecemos a la población que demanda nuestras mercancías lo que podemos, mientras mantenemos el mayor valor de los descubrimientos solo para el gremio. Como miembro, debes entender que algunos de los secretos y conocimientos que posees podrían ser fácilmente torcidos para un propósito nefasto. No volveremos a recorrer ese camino. Por ahora, abasteceremos a los curanderos y a otros con mercancías que puedan vender. Te pedimos que nos ayudes en este esfuerzo.'"},
[4400]={"Completa las solicitudes del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanos de Umbar Baharbêl.","Pedidos diarios del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar completados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completaste muchas solicitudes de eruditos de Umbar.","Completa los pedidos diarios del Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Has completado muchas entregas de eruditos de Umbar!","Completado","Pociones para Umbar (Semanal)","Los eruditos proveen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás haciendo tu parte para ayudar.","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Eruditos de Umbar."},
[4402]={"'I know you are eager to venture higher up the mountain-side with Hórin, but I have one last thing to ask you. Molkha has reported that she found a den of wolves near the drake feeding grounds. In such a location she will need to watch both the skies above and the ground underfoot, and that has me worried!\
\
'Can you clear that wolf-den and ensure, for now, that she has only one danger to worry about? I would really appreciate it.'","Talk to Náth at Fellgát","Náth has asked you to find the wolf den called Draurákh west of Fellgát and defeat the wolves within.\
\
You should defeat wolves in Draurákh, including the pack leader, Snárfrek.","You have cleared the wolf pack from Draurákh.\
\
You should talk to Náth in Fellgát.","'Did you clear out those wolves, ${PLAYER}? Great work! I was a little worried we might need to wait until our reinforcements arrived to deal with those beasts, but I knew someone of your skill would have no trouble!\
\
'Well, perhaps I did not know it. But I suspected!'","Defeated wolves in Draurákh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Snárfrek","Náth has asked you to clear a den of wolves west of Fellgát.","Draurákh, the Wolf Den","Defeated Snárfrek","Defeat wolves in Draurákh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4403]={"Dervorin paces as he considers the information you've brought him.\
\
'Dravron has sent out a few shipments of lumber, but the tax collector has no records of any sales?\
\
'Hah! We have him, ${PLAYER}. Come, let us confront him with this information.'","Talk to Dervorin","Dervorin would like you to see if anyone in Ethring has any information regarding Dravron.\
\
Talk to the citizens of Ethring.","Talk to the tax collector","Dervorin hopes the people of Ethring may offer insight into Dravron's operation.","'Dravron must have dealings with the people here in Ethring. Perhaps they know something that we can use against him.'\
\
Some of the lumber camp's labourers are in town. Perhaps they have information they can share about their boss.\
\
The tax collector might have insight into Dravron's finances that could be of help.\
\
You didn't see any horses at the lumber camp. Perhaps Dravron hires them from the local stable-master. Speak to him and see if he has anything to share about Dravron.","'The tax records for the lumber camp? There are no tax records. They haven't done any business yet. They should get to it though; Gondor won't rebuild itself out of nothing.'","Dravron's Secrets","'I've had some dealings with the man, but not many. He's hired horses to carry lumber out of the vale. How many times? Hmm, maybe once every other week, if that.'","Talk to the lumber camp labourer","The man's face turns grim when you mention Dravron.\
\
'That man is an absolute good for nothing! All me and the fellas want to do is good, honest work, but the boss has us sitting on our rear ends most days.'","You have asked around about Dravron and should report back to Dervorin with your findings.\
\
Talk to Dervorin in Ethring."},
[4404]={"Aerin has asked you to hide a false map somewhere in Hata Kebir, east of Aerthir.\
\
Find a place to hide the map.","Drawing Maps","You have found a good place to hide the false map","Talk to Aerin","You have successfully hidden the map, and should inform Aerin.\
\
Talk to Aerin in Aerthir.","Reluctantly, Aerin tears her gaze from her book and smiles at you.\
\
'Did you do it? Did you hide the map? Oh how delightful! I'm not entirely sure what the purpose of the original map is, but I can tell you that the map that I made points to nothing but sewer entrances! I hope they have fun rooting around in the muck.\
\
'Now, if you'll excuse me, I'd like to see how this duel ends.'\
\
She returns to her reading, quickly forgetting you're there.","Aerin wishes to mislead some bandits in nearby Hata Kebir.","Find a good place to hide the false map","As you approach, Aerin holds up a finger, bidding you pause to let her finish a passage in the book she's reading. She scans the next few lines and laughs quietly to herself before bending a corner of the page and closing the book shut.\
\
She spends a moment studying your face. You're not readily familiar to her. Maybe you've changed your appearance since your last meeting.\
\
'${PLAYER}!' she recognizes you at long last. 'Have you been well? I certainly have. Though there has been some trouble brewing.'\
\
It doesn't take much to get her to say more.\
\
'Hata Kebir. It's been abandoned these past few weeks, but a few days ago some louts came scrounging around, no doubt hired by the Heirs of Castamir. Firiondur approached them and asked what they were doing here. They said they were here for a map of some kind, and that they weren't leaving until they found it. They even offered him coin if he were willin' to help them!'\
\
She produces a map of Pelargir from her pocket. It's marked with various symbols whose meanings you can only begin to guess at.\
\
'I assume this is the map they were lookin' for. What? Don't give me that look. I went searching through the place after it were abandoned. Anyway, the man says he won't leave until he finds the map, so I say let's give him what he wants.'\
\
She produces another map, remarkably similar to the original, but the symbols are drawn in completely different locations.\
\
'What do you think? I made it myself. If you're inclined to help us, go plant this fake map somewhere in Hata Kebir. If you happen to thrash some of those ruffians while you're at it, I certainly won't be complainin'.'"},
[4405]={"Has preparado el campamento falso","Atrayendo al enemigo","Habla con Limlaer","'Hiciste bien en acabar con el jefe de los exploradores, ${PLAYER}.'","Establece el campamento falso y derrota a Râkhuga.","'Parece que tu rastro funcionó, ${PLAYER}. Otro de mis exploradores vio a un grupo de rastreo cerca del rastro falso. ¡Ahora debemos terminar la trampa!\
\
'Viaja al suroeste de aquí, entre Porth Cadlus y Goeolhad. Busca al sur del barranco que se extiende hacia el oeste hasta la cima de la colina de arriba unas rocas altas que dominan un pequeño claro que se encuentra justo al oeste de la torre en el borde de Nan Sirannon.\
\
'Allí, debes establecer un campamento falso y esperar a los exploradores. Sin embargo ten cuidado... no hay que permitir que los exploradores regresen con sus viles amos.\
\
'Si el Enemigo es engañado haciéndole creer que la Compañía ha pasado por el Paso de Rohan o ha rodeado las Montañas Blancas, su verdadero rastro puede permanecer oculto para siempre. Regresa conmigo cuando hayas completado la tarea.'","Derrotó a Râkhuga el Rastreador.","Limlaer está al sureste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Deberías regresar a Limlaer con noticias sobre tu éxito.","Limlaer ha solicitado tu ayuda para tender pistas falsas y atraer al Enemigo hacia el sur.","'¿El jefe de los exploradores yace muerto? Has hecho un gran trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Informaré de tus logros al Señor Elrond.'","'Debes montar el campamento al suroeste de aquí, entre Porth Cadlus y Goeolhad, en una cuenca rodeada de rocas, pero debes darte prisa antes de que los exploradores encuentren el verdadero rastro.'","El emplazamiento del campamento falso se encuentra al suroeste de Limlaer, entre Porth Cadlus y Goeolhad, en una cuenca rodeada de rocas.\
\
Limlaer te ha encomendado la tarea de tender una trampa a los exploradores del Enemigo.","'¿Has acabado con el jefe de los exploradores?'"},
[4406]={"'Este guiso debería atraer al líder de esos huargo inmundos. Ponlo en la mesa de piedra como te pedí.'","'Echa a esos huargos de Nain Enidh. Mi comida no debería desperdiciarse así, pero si puedes usarla para atraer al líder huargo y acabar con él, no me impo'","El Viejo Artemisa está en el campamento al este de Minas Eriol.\
\
Después de sacar a la manada de Zarpasombra a campo abierto, derrotaste al líder huargo. El Viejo Artemisa querrá saber de tu victoria.","Atrayendo a la manada","'¡Lo logramos! Ya verás, esos huargos se lo pensarán dos veces antes de perseguir a alguien ahora que has matado a su líder.\
\
Seremos héroes en la Posada Abandonada. ¡Ya verás!\
\
Te debo una, amigo. ¡Toma uno de estos por todo lo que has hecho!'","Invocaste y derrotaste a Zarpasombra","Habla con el Viejo Artemisa","'Cuando termines este último encargo, los huargos ya no serán una amenaza para los viajeros del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Hay un poste de señales en el camino que atraviesa Nain Enidh, y un sendero cerca de este poste se dirige hacia el sur. Por supuesto, eso es hacia el norte desde aquí. Si sigues el sendero mientras desciende hacia una depresión suave al suroeste, llegarás a una estructura de piedra, como una mesa antigua o una sección plana de ruina. Lleva el potaje que he preparado a esa mesa y vierte un poco sobre la piedra.\
\
Estoy seguro de que el líder vendrá corriendo a la comida, pensando que es la cocina de algún ${RACE} tonto. Cuando hayas matado a la criatura, vuelve aquí.'","'¡Has hecho un buen trabajo, ${PLAYER}!'","Mientras cazabas los huargos de Nain Enidh, Artemisa preparó una comida especial para su líder. Todo lo que queda para facilitar el paso por el Gran Camino del Este es sacar a este líder de su escondite y llevarlo a la batalla.","Invoca y derrota a Zarpasombra","La mesa de piedra donde debes verter el potaje de Artemisa está al final de un sendero hacia el sur, cerca de un poste de señales en el camino que atraviesa Nain Enidh.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa te pidió que llevaras el potaje especial que preparó a una piedra antigua cerca de la guarida de los huargos. El hedor debería atraer a su líder.","'¡Los huargos y los trasgos son cosas horribles! ¡Te harán perder la cena!'"},
[4408]={"Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
Angbor has grown concerned by the behaviour of Faltharan, the son of the Lord of Pelargir, and wishes for you to speak to him.","'Will you aid me in this, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'I know your journey shall soon take you far from Lebennin, but I can think of no other that might spare the time for such a task.'","<rgb=#FF00FF>Calm</rgb> Faltharan and ask of his troubles","Faltharan, lord regent of Pelargir, seeks to uncover the fate of his father before all hope is lost.","Talk to Faltharan","Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
You have found Faltharan and should now try to calm him before he rushes out into combat.","Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
You have listened to Faltharan's troubles, and should now assure him of your intent to help him.","Faltharan appears lost in thought as you approach, and his gaze is fixed on the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
'I know you have come to dissuade me, friend, but I cannot be turned from my task.\
\
'So much has happened in so swift a time... it has been but a few days since Pelargir was reclaimed, but still many more troubles weigh on me...'","'${PLAYER}, have you noticed the lord regent up above? His eyes have not left my men and me for some time now.\
\
'I believe he means to join our charge, but the boy is... not suited for battle. He bears ill-fitting armour and is not skilled with a blade, despite what he may think after his recent heroics in the city. I see a darkness in his demeanour, and I believe he intends to rush into the war without care for himself or his family.\
\
'Convince him of his folly, my friend. See that he remains here with his people, for there is much rebuilding to be done here - for the city and its folk.'","Talk to Faltharan, Son of Sirgon","Drawn to War"},
[4409]={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Poke</rgb> the Ranger and attempt to wake him from the trance","'You did well to ensure the safety of your allies and kin, ${PLAYER}. It is something I wish I could have done...\
\
'They would be wise to avoid the marshlands should they pass through the Wastes again... for the lights can take a hold on any man.\
\
'Let us hope they return to their encampment with news of what they have found here.'","The remaining Rangers in Anborn's company fled northward from the battle plain after the Wainriders ambushed them, but may now have become enthralled by the glimmering lights that dance about the Dead Marshes.","Faramir can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn in Dagorlad.\
\
You have freed the remaining Rangers from their trances and sent them back to Haerondir. You should now speak to Faramir near Dol Acharn.","The remaining Rangers can be found somewhere in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes in northern Dagorlad.\
\
Faramir has informed you that the rest of the Rangers fled northward into the dangerous shallows of the Dead Marshes. You should seek them out at once.","Talk to Faramir at the foot of Dol Acharn","'The Wainriders must be made to pay for defiling these lands once more, ${PLAYER}, but your allies are in grave danger and their lives cannot wait on my designs for vengeance.\
\
'The six men you found were caught unawares by the Wainriders, but four more yet lived last I saw them.\
\
'They fled the battle plain northward into the marshes... but they shall find no refuge there. As the north-men and I learned all too well, the waters are muddy and slow any retreat to a crawl... and now even worse things dwell within its shallows. There are lights... the Dead without form that lurk within the marshes, and they hold the power to sway any to their will.\
\
'These Rangers may have escaped the Wainriders, but they will not escape the Dead in the marshes... not when fear has such a hold on them.\
\
'Go now! Save your allies, and do what I could not!'","You have found a Ranger staring blankly into the waters of the Dead Marshes...","Drawn to the Marshes","The Ranger wakes from the trance!","Find and free the remaining Rangers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[4410]={"Gyrgir cree que el hongo preferiría vivir en el agua que en los orcos. Quiere estudiar más a fondo la infección.","Recoge esporas de hongo de los orcos globsnaga (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Atraído por el agua","'Creo que las esporas abrirán cualquier cerradura y necesito varias para probar mi teoría.'","Gyrgir te espera en Hulwul-nefekh, al oeste de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras.\
\
Has matado a varios orcos globsnaga y has recogido suficientes esporas de hongo para que los enanos puedan investigarlas. Regresa a ver a Gyrgir en Hulwul-nefekh y entrégale las esporas.","Regresa a Gyrgir con las esporas","'He estado hablando con Ansurr y estudiando la tela que trajiste de la Bodega Putrefacta, y he llegado a una conclusión: creo que el hongo preferiría estar en el agua que viviendo en los orcos.\
\
'La única razón por la que está en los orcos es porque no puede volver al agua. Si pudieras traerme varias esporas de los orcos infectados, podría estudiarlas y aprender más, quizás incluso probar mi teoría.\
\
'Puedes encontrar estos orcos infestados cerca de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras al este de aquí.'","Los orcos globsnaga se pueden encontrar en las orillas cerca de la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras, al sur de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Gyrgir quiere que recojas esporas de hongo de varios orcos globsnaga. Cree que con ellas podrá aprender cosas importantes para crear un antídoto.","'Estas son perfectas, ${PLAYER}. Gracias por traerlas. Estoy seguro de que serán muy útiles.'","Esporas de hongo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4411]={"As Quickbeam's Huorn marches about above the Entwash's banks, you notice it begin to swat its branches at the nearby wood-flies, narrowly missing your head in the process. In the absence of the Ents and most other Huorns, it is clear that these disease-laden flies have grown unchecked and wild.\
\
You should aid the Huorn in culling their numbers.","Atraído por el agua","Defeated wood-flies in Fangorn Forest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat wood-flies in Fangorn Forest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wood-flies can be found throughout Fangorn Forest to the west of Derndingle.\
\
The Huorn seeks your aid in thinning the number of wood-flies in Fangorn Forest. You should defeat them.","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","You have slain many wood-flies and reduced the threat they posed to the Entwash and nearby trees.","Quickbeam's Huorn seems pleased that you have made an effort to rid the forest of disease-laden wood-flies. You slew many of their number, and judging by numerous crushed wings stuck to the Huorn's branches, so did it.","DNT -- Players will not see","In the absence of the Ents, wood-flies have spread out of control and threaten to overwhelm the forest."},
[4412]={"Maelvír has asked you to bring back shells from the dread-turtles inhabiting a nearby island.\
\
You can hunt dread-turtles on the island of Loeg Thangalf, in Pinnath Gelin.","'Welcome back, welcome back! Ah, do you have them? Oof, you certainly smell like you do.'","With multiple dread-turtle shells in hand, you should return to Maelvír.\
\
Maelvír is at Mereham, in central Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Maelvír","Dread Shells from Loeg Thangalf","Collected turtle shells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hello, hello! Ooh, a ${CLASS}. Most excellent! You're just who I need!\
\
'Ah, let me explain. I am Maelvír - armourer for the Knights of the Green Hills. I heard that dread-turtles have moved onto the nearby island of Loeg Thangalf. Isn't it exciting? That is, you see, I am very interested in learning more about their armoured shells. Bring some back, and I shall reward you. What do you say?'","The island of Loeg Thangalf has become home to ferocious dread-turtles, whose shells may well serve to provide protection and armour for the Knights of the Green Hills.","Collect turtle shells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4413]={"Se pueden encontrar tres piedras centinelas menores en algún lugar de la ciudad de Dún Covád, al norte de Aughaire, en las colinas occidentales de Fasach-falroid.\
\
Sorkha quiere que encuentres las ubicaciones de estas tres piedras centinelas menores dentro de Dún Covád.","'Las piedras centinelas de Angmar son una amenaza mortal para los débiles de voluntad.'","Sorkha, de los Trév Gállorg, está preocupado por las piedras centinelas menores que se han erigido en la ciudad de Dún Covád.","'En algún lugar de la ciudad de Dún Covád se encuentran tres piedras-centinelas menores. Necesito que encuentres sus ubicaciones y me informes de ello.\
\
'La ciudad se encuentra lejos al norte de Aughaire, en las colinas del oeste de Fasach-falroid.'","'El Búth Luikh es un lugar no para alardear de hazañas sino para planificarlas. Guirmán habla a menudo de asaltar las murallas de Dún Covád, pero le he instado a no ser demasiado entusiasta en esto. ¡Un plan que no se forma cuidadosamente está condenado antes de comenzar!\
\
'Los Angmarim han erigido piedras centinelas menores por toda Dún Covád, y si no aprendemos las ubicaciones de estas estatuas, cualquier plan de Guirmán para retomar la ciudad está amenazado.\
\
'La ciudad de Dún Covád está lejos al norte de Aughaire, en las colinas del oeste de Fasach-falroid. Busca en la ciudad las piedras centinelas menores y vuelve a mí cuando las hayas encontrado. Creo que hay tres en la ciudad propiamente dicha, y estas son las que debes localizar!'","'Cuando ataquemos la ciudad de Dún Covád, evitaremos las piedras centinelas.'","Sorkha está en el Búth Luikh de Aughaire.\
\
Has localizado tres piedras centinelas menores dentro de la ciudad de Dún Covád y ahora debes regresar a Sorkha con el conocimiento de sus ubicaciones.","'¿Me traes las ubicaciones de las piedras-centinelas dentro de Dún Covád? Esto nos será de gran ayuda, ${PLAYER}, cuando sea el momento de asaltar la ciudad. Sabremos qué esperar y podremos planificar nuestro ataque de tal manera que evitemos las terribles piedras.'","Localiza las piedras centinelas menores dentro de Dún Covád (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Terror en la ciudad caída","Piedras centinelas menores localizadas dentro de Dún Covád (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[4414]={"Talk to Béortnoth outside of Thornhope","You found Thane Béortnoth, the last known survivor of the Orcs' assault on Thornhope, wandering half mad with injury and grief.","'Nay, I am sure it said it was called Blackthorn. It thought I was an Orc, but it listened to my tale and vowed to help me....'\
\
Béortnoth shook his head.\
\
'Nay, that cannot be right. My injury... it must be worse than I thought. So addled am I that I have forgotten my people.\
\
'Will you enter the village and search for other survivors? I am Thane now, for I am sure I saw my father die -- indeed, by the hand of an uruk, I am certain -- but there is nothing left of Thornhope.'","Thornhope lies just down the road from Béortnoth's camp.\
\
Thane Béortnoth has asked you to search Thornhope for other survivors.","You found nothing here","Search for survivors in Thornhope (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Thane Béortnoth is encamped outside of Thornhope.\
\
You should return to Béortnoth with news of your findings.","Searched for survivors in Thornhope (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Dreams of Fire and Giants","'I am not alone then? That is well. We will drive forth the Orcs and rebuild Thornhope.'"},
[4416]={"It would seem to be a hobbit-hole, but there is little comfort to be found here","The warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.\
\
You have searched the ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen, but you found no sign of Sharkey or his men. You should continue your search to the south and find the warrens of Tûn Melen.","The warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found the warrens of Tûn Melen. You should investigate them, but proceed carefully, as Sharkey and his men are likely gathered inside.","Investigate Tûn Melen","Find the warrens of Tûn Melen","Talk to the imprisoned Woodman in the warrens of Tûn Melen","A faint voice cries out from a small alcove in the warrens of Tûn Melen","Investigate the warrens of Tûn Melen","The imprisoned Woodman can be found in a small alcove to the right of the entrance to the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
After entering the warrens of Tûn Melen, you heard a faint cry from a Woodman in a cage. You should speak to the imprisoned Woodman and learn what has happened in the warrens of Tûn Melen.","A hastily-repaired dredging machine has been used to burrow into the hillside","Amidst the sunken dredging machines at Tûn Melen, you notice a number of crumbling foundations","Find and explore the ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen","The ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen can be found somewhere among the ruined dredging machines in the northern reaches of Tûn Melen.\
\
Sharkey's orders told of a ruined excavation site in the northern reaches of Tûn Melen. You should find it and explore it.","Dredging up the Past","The orders make note of Woodmen helping Sharkey search a place called Tûn Melen","After searching the belongings of Sharkey's lieutenant, you discover orders sealed by a small waxen 'S'. If these are orders from Sharkey, you should examine them at once.\
\
You should unseal the orders and learn what Sharkey's plans are for the Gladden Fields.","With knowledge gained from the Woodmen, Sharkey has expanded his search to curious, old tunnels beneath the Gladden Fields.","Sharkey's orders can be found in your inventory.\
\
You have discovered orders from Sharkey after defeating Sharkey's lieutenant at Sharkey's Slough.","Read 'Sharkey's Orders'","'Who... who are you? Did Sharkey send you?'\
\
You explain that you were sent by Radagast on behalf of the chieftain of Hultvís. He sighs with relief.\
\
'I don't care who sent you as long as it's not Sharkey. Please... you've got to help me!'","Tûn Melen can be found in the south-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found orders from Sharkey detailing excavations at a place called Tûn Melen. According to the orders, it seems to be located to the south-west of Sharkey's Slough.","Rotting furniture and cracked plates litter the room, but you find no sign of Sharkey's Men"},
[4418]={"Wait for the next move","Dressage is the art of rider and horse becoming one and going through a series of choreographed manoeuvres.","The dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.","Wait for the next round of dressage to begin","Talk to Gladsnel","Gladsnel is at Cliving.\
\
Gladsnel will be surprised to hear that you passed the dressage practice.","The dressage has begun","Perform the matching move in time","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","'Dressage has been around almost as long as we have ridden horses. Any warrior can mount a horse and charge headlong into battle, but only someone truly joined with his steed can carefully balance a series of moves as if they were dancing.\
\
'One of our greatest riders is in a field here in Cliving practising his basic manoeuvres. He is preparing for any order or combination the judges may throw at him.\
\
'The basic moves include calling for a charge, cheering, drinking, flexing, and laughing. When he begins his course, watch for the move he does and perform it with him. Be quick about it too... lagging behind is not tolerated.'","Prepare for the next move","'Not bad, but these were only the basic moves. Any Rohirrim child could have performed them.'","Dressage"},
[4419]={"'I once again thank you for your service, ${PLAYER}. These beasts have long been the bane of any excursion into the Ashenslades.'","Defeated Wargs in the Ashenslades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","Drive Them Off","Collect Warg-teeth  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Seek out and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades and collect their teeth as a warning to their brethren.'","'Across the Ashenslades, there are small packs of Wargs that have been harrassing our patrols through the area. These beasts must be taught to fear the Malledhrim.\
\
'Therefore, I ask that you hunt the Wargs of the Ashenslades and collect their teeth as a warning to their brethren.\
\
'Wargs can be found throughout the Ashenslades, but they have also established a den to the south of here, near the ruins of Naur-hoit.'","Wargs can be found throughout the Ashenslades, but many are gathered to the south of Mithechad, near Naur-hoit.\
  \
Perindúr has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","Collected Warg-teeth  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Wargs in the Ashenslades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Across the Ashenslades, there are small packs of Wargs that harass Malledhrim patrols through the area.","Perindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit.\
\
You should return to Perindúr and tell him of your success in the hunt."},
[4421]={"Derrota a la Gran Matriarca de la Nieve","La Gran Matriarca de la Nieve puede encontrarse en la tundra occidental.\
\
Derrotarla asustará a la manada de yetis y hará que se vuelvan contra los Gauredain.","'Resulta agotador mantener a los peikko alejados de nuestro puesto. Son persistentes, pero no porque quieran dañarnos.\
\
'Sin duda, los Gauredain están provocando a estas bestias. Si logramos intimidar a su manada, los peikko estarán tan confundidos cuando lleguen los Gauredain que se volverán contra ellos en lugar de contra nosotros.\
\
'Derrota a la anciana de la manada, y sus gritos perturbarán sin duda a todo el grupo.'","Las Bestias de la Nieve han sido expulsadas del puesto avanzado de los Lossoth en la Tundra Occidental, pero regresarán a menos que su matriarca sea derrotada.","¡Expúlsalos!","Has derrotado a la Gran Matriarca de la Nieve","'Parece que, por el momento, los peikko nos dejarán ocuparnos de nuestros asuntos. Tal vez esta noche sean los Gauredain quienes no duerman con tanta tranquilidad.\
\
'No obstante, aún queda mucho trabajo por hacer.'"},
[4422]={"Derrota al coloso Colmillo Rojo","'La bestia ha desaparecido. Nuestros comerciantes podrán pasar por aquí libremente, sin temor a ser seguidos por los sirvientes de Angmar.\
\
'Te estamos agradecidos por haber caminado junto a nosotros, como el hirvi camina entre los kettu.\
\
'Hemos preparado un regalo para ti. Que muchos caminos guíen siempre tus pasos.'","Coloso Colmillo Rojo derrotado","El coloso Colmillo Rojo puede encontrarse entre las colinas rocosas y oscuras situadas muy al suroeste de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Valtteri te ha pedido que rastrees y derrotes al coloso Colmillo Rojo, usando un símbolo lossoth en llamas para asustar a la bestia.","Tu éxito contra los huargos de Forochel te ha granjeado el respeto de los cazadores lossoth. Valtteri solicita tu ayuda una vez más.","Habla con Valtteri","Expulsando a las bestias","Valtteri se encuentra en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Deberías regresar con Valtteri y comunicarle tu victoria sobre el coloso Colmillo Rojo.","'¡Usa nuestro símbolo en llamas para volver loca a la bestia! Deberías encontrar al coloso en las colinas del suroeste.'","'El más feroz de los Surmâja, al que algunos llaman el coloso, nos espera entre las rocas al suroeste. La bestia ha sido fortalecida por los Rauta-väki y se ha vuelto demasiado poderosa para que nuestros cazadores la derroten por sí solos.\
\
'Quizá puedas ayudarnos a ahuyentarla o matarla. Untaremos el sebo de Surmâja que nos trajiste en un símbolo lossoth y lo prenderemos fuego. Coloca este símbolo en el suelo cuando el coloso ataque. Con suerte, la bestia se asustará y podrás atacarla en su confusión.\
\
'El coloso es un enemigo terrible, así que procede con cautela al acercarte a él.'"},
[4423]={"Ahogamiento en los muelles","'Te doy las gracias desde el fondo de mi corazón, ${PLAYER}. Me alivia saber que algunos de los prisioneros, al menos, están en libertad.\
\
'¡Llegará el día en que Angmar pague por todos sus crímenes!'","Prisioneros torturados rescatados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La crueldad de los Angmarim no tiene límites, . Ahogan a los prisioneros que capturan en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas. Encuentran placer en el sufrimiento de sus víctimas, ¡y deben ser detenidos! ¡Debemos poner fin a esta barbarie!\
\
'Te lo suplico, si eres ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de los Dúnedain y de los habitantes de esta tierra, ¡date prisa y pon fin a estas prácticas!\
\
'Esta crueldad merece ser devuelta multiplicada por diez, , pero debemos contentarnos con liberar a los prisioneros. ¡Ojalá pudiéramos idear castigos aún peores para estos siervos de la Corona de Hierro!'","Orchalwë se alegrará de oír que los prisioneros han sido salvados.","Los prisioneros están siendo ahogados por los torturadores Angmarim en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas, en el nivel más inferior de la ciudad, cerca del agua.","Orchalwë te ha hablado de una cruel práctica de los Angmarim que han ocupado las ruinas de Annúminas: ahogar a sus prisioneros en los muelles del puerto de Annúminas.","Rescata a los prisioneros torturados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Orchalwë"},
[4424]={"Talk to Doron","'These ruins hold many memories for me, ${PLAYER}. As you have been shown, the bribe my men and I accepted in return for standing down in the face of the Easterlings was once held in these ruins.\
\
'I see treasures of significant age strewn about the ruins here. Much of it seems familiar to me...I think it is the very same!\
\
'Please, cast the treasures into the Limlight just south of Ost Celebrant. Let us be rid of them forever. Please do this for me, as my arms no longer grant me strength in this world.'","Doron has commanded you to cast the treasures which once cursed his men into the Limlight River, directly to the south of Ost Celebrant. These treasures are strewn about the southern part of Ost Celebrant.","Threw cursed treasures into the Limlight (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Doron is at your side in Ost Celebrant. If he has wandered from your sight, he can be summoned with your horn.","Throw cursed treasures into the Limlight (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The treasures are strewn about the southern side of Ost Celebrant on the shore near the Limlight River.","Ahogando el pasado","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I know that this alone is not enough to release us from our curse, but destroying the bribe that brought us to ruin is a relief.'"},
[4425]={"Derrota a Kaushar","Azotadores de la Ciudad de los Trasgos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota azotadores de la Ciudad de los Trasgos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Son noticias excelentes, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Nos estás resultando ${PLAYERNAME:un aliado[m]|una aliada[f]} de valor incalculable.\
\
'Te estamos en deuda, y te doy las gracias personalmente. No deseo enfrentarme a una horda de trolls conducidos por crueles maestros trasgos.'","Guardianes del Tambor","'Algún día, creo que te llamaremos ${PLAYER}, ${PLAYER:Destructor[m]|Destructora[f]} de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.'","'No sabemos dónde pueden estar los trolls y los azotadores trasgos dentro de la fortaleza. Solo sabemos que las notas que recuperaste los mencionan.'","Kaushar derrotado","La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Vighar te ha pedido que encuentres el camino dentro de la fortaleza hasta la zona donde los trolls tamborileros están vigilados por los azotadores. Mata a varios de estos trasgos y a su líder, Kaushar.","Vighar Trotasendas está en el campamento de Glóin, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Kaushar y los azotadores usaron a sus trolls contra ti, pero lograste derrotarlos. Ahora debes regresar con Vighar y entregarle tu informe.","Tu descubrimiento en la Ciudad de los Trasgos nos tiene a todos en alerta, ${PLAYER}. Algo terrible se está gestando, y debemos mantenernos vigilantes contra esta oscuridad creciente o enfrentaremos a un enemigo terrible cuando esté organizado.\
\
'Glóin no desea que eso ocurra, y me ha pedido que encuentre a quienes estén dispuestos a enfrentarse a los enemigos más fuertes dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
'La traducción del fajo mencionaba azotadores trasgos controlando a los trolls tamborileros en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Necesitamos que vayas allí, busques a esos azotadores, los mates a ellos y a su líder, y luego regreses con nosotros.'","Habla con Vighar en el campamento de Glóin, fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Las notas que descubriste hablaban de trolls mantenidos en las partes más profundas de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, golpeando tambores para agitar a los trasgos y prepararlos para la batalla. Glóin ha encargado a Vighar organizar partidas para entrar en las zonas de los tambores y matar a los trolls y al líder de los azotadores, con el fin de reducir la amenaza que representan para las gentes al oeste y al este de las Montañas Nubladas."},
[4426]={"Oghûk quiere vengarse de Kaushar, el trasgo que lo encerró por causar problemas con los tambores de los trolls en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","'Kaushar tiene la culpa de esto. Yo solía reparar los tambores en lugar de los trolls, y Kaushar se quejó ante Aklash, quien me encerró. Ahora Kaushar repara los tambores en mi lugar.\
\
'Kaushar debe ser castigado por esto. Está en las profundidades, donde están los trolls. Ve allí y mata a sus trolls tamborileros.\
\
'Mientras haces tu trabajo, averiguaré quién tiene la llave de mi celda.'","'Mata a los trolls de Kaushar. Eso lo enfurecerá y me dará tiempo para pensar dónde podría estar la llave.'","Vuelve con Oghûk a su celda en la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","'¡Ja! ¡Ese gusano llorón! Kaushar debe de estar echando humo por la pérdida de sus trolls. Has hecho bien, ${RACE}.'","Los trolls tamborileros se encuentran en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Oghûk quiere vengarse de Kaushar, un trasgo que repara los tambores de los trolls en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Lo culpa por haberlo hecho encarcelar y quiere que sufra. Es una tarea desagradable, pero Oghûk no te ayudará si no lo ayudas tú primero.","Oghûk está en su celda en la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Los trolls tamborileros estaban en una zona profunda de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Vigilados por capataces trasgos, encontraste a los trolls y los derrotaste tal como Oghûk pidió.","Tambores en lo profundo"},
[4427]={"'Perdona mi grosería, ${PLAYER}. No se me permite dejar mi puesto, ¡pero esos incesantes tambores me están volviendo loco! No he podido dormir decentemente desde que llegamos aquí.\
\
'El grupo de trasgos responsable de ese alboroto está acampado justo al norte de aquí, en la Sala de la Escalera Alta. ¿Podrías hacerme un favor y silenciarlos?\
\
'¡Lo que daría por tener solo una noche en paz!'","Tambores destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Fostólf en la Cámara de la Encrucijada","'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Estoy deseando poder echarme una siesta. Puede parecer una tontería, pero mientras mejor descansados estemos cuando la batalla comience, más posibilidades tendremos de vencer.'","Tambores de guerra","Fostólf está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de la Sala de la Escalera Alta.\
\
Todos los tambores trsagos han sido silenciados.Fostólf debería poder descansar por fin.","Destruye los tambores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los trasgos que hacen sonar los tambores están acampados en la Sala de la Escalera Alta, al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Fostólf te ha pedido que destruyas los tambores trasgos para que él y sus compañeros puedan conseguir dormir.","Los enanos de la Cámara de la Encrucijada han podido dormir poco desde que llegaron. Los trasgos de los alrededores han estado haciendo sonar sus tambores sin decanso, provocando ecos retumbantes por todo el Camino de Durin.","'Por favor, destruye esos dichosos tambores. Retumban y retumban sin fin... me resulta imposible conciliar el sueño.'"},
[4428]={"Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field to inspire their vile allies to attack Minas Tirith with a renewed ferocity. They must be defeated with haste to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat the Morgul-troll drummers\
* Do not allow more than two waves of frenzied Morgul-orcs to attack the wall","Tambores de guerra","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.","Morgul-troll drummers defeated (${VALUE}/4)"},
[4429]={"Morgul-troll drummers defeated (${VALUE}/6)","Tambores de guerra","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.","Morgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field to inspire their vile allies to attack Minas Tirith with a renewed ferocity. They must be defeated with haste to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>empty</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Defeat the Morgul-troll drummers\
* Do not allow more than two waves of frenzied Morgul-orcs to attack the wall"},
[4430]={"Secando la hierba para pipa","'Bien, ahora viene la mejor parte. ¡Es hora de probarlas!'","Florencia Gamyi está en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Florencia Gamyi querrá saber que la hierba para pipa se ha colocado en los secaderos.","Habla con Florencia Gamyi","'Ahora que las hojas están clasificadas, el siguiente paso es secarlas. Cuanto más tiempo se seque la hierba para pipa, más fuerte será su sabor. También oscurece el color del humo.\
\
'Una vez que esté seca, mezclaremos diferentes cantidades de hierba para pipa seca y fresca para crear sabores únicos. Así es como se saca lo mejor de la planta.\
\
'Los secaderos están a la vuelta de la esquina, al noreste, y ya hay algo de hierba para pipa en ellos. Añade a los secaderos la que has clasificado.'","Coloca la hierba para pipa en los secaderos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La hierba para pipa es algo que los hobbits se toman muy en serio. Un mercado nunca recibiría visitas a menos que tuviera un suministro y variedad adecuados.","Hierba para pipa colocada en los secaderos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No la secaremos toda del todo, pero tiene que estar ahí fuera durante al menos uno o dos días.'","Los secaderos están al noreste de Florencia Gamyi en la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
La hierba para pipa clasificada debe colocarse en los secaderos."},
[4433]={"Defeated Orcs and goblins at Drúkala (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Long forbidden to pass beyond Zâram-mekhem, the Orcs' bargain with the Iron Crown has allowed them to settle within the hallowed caverns of Gloomingtarn.","Orcs and goblins can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After gaining entry to Gloomingtarn through the aid of the Iron Crown, the Orcs of Gundabad have made camp at Drúkala. You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","After passing beyond Zâram-mekhem, the tarn-gate, you have discovered an encampment of Orcs and goblins in Gloomingtarn. Sacred not only to the Longbeards, but to all dwarves, the hallowed cavern of Gloomingtarn has long been forbidden to the Orcs—and it must remain so!\
\
You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","You have done much to hinder the Orcs in their attempts to settle within Gloomingtarn. With their numbers scattered back into Deepscrave and other hidden depths of Mount Gundabad, it is likely the Orcs will not soon return to Gloomingtarn.","You have defeated many Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.","Defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala","Defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Drúkala: Trespassers in Gloomingtarn"},
[4434]={"Examined crates of fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Anírwen has asked you to inspect crates of fish on the docks of the bay.\
\
The docks are in the Dol Amroth bay.","Anírwen is concerned about the quality of the fish that is being sent up to the king's hall.","'Oh, hello, my dear. I wonder if you might help me with a small task. I am worried that some of the fish being sent up to the king's hall is not as fresh as the royal table deserves. The crates of fish need to be examined, but if the fishermen see me coming, they're quick to swap out the crates they intended with fresh fish, only to later send up fish of poor quality.\
\
'Tour the docks and inspect the crates and report back to me. Together we can identify who has been passing along subpar catches.'","You should let Anírwen know that you examined many crates of fish.\
\
Anírwen is at her shop in Dol Amroth.","Examine crates of fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Welcome back, dear! Tell me, how were the crates? Did you find fish unworthy of the prince's table?'\
\
You inform her of your findings. \
\
'Is that so? I knew it. I shall reprimand those swindlers immediately!'","Dubious Fish","Return to Anírwen"},
[4436]={"Defeat beasts in Southern Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated a beast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Duilin, and avid hunter, has wagered a bet that you cannot bag as many game as he can!","Speak to Duilin","'Derufin and I are avid hunters. We honed our skills in the Blackroot Vale during our youth, you see. How about a small wager, all in good sport? I bet you can't bag a dozen beasts before you need to be on your way!'","Duilin is located in Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should talk to Duilin.","'Well done. Well done, indeed! You've proven yourself a skilled hunter. I dare say you've still got room for improvement, though.'","Beasts can be found throughout Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat beasts in Southern Ithilien.","Duilin's Task"},
[4439]={"'Están en mucho peor estado de lo que esperaba. El tiempo y los trasgos no les han tratado bien. Con suerte, aún podremos sacarles algún provecho.'","Lleva las espadas ornamentales a los Montaraces en Tinnudir.","Consigue espadas ornamentales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Montaraces están en Tinnudir, al suroeste de Tham Andalath.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces querrá examinar las espadas ceremoniales que has encontrado.","Esta arma está desafilada, pero no gastada. Parece antigua, pero ceremonial. Quizás deberías recoger algunas más y llevárselas a los Montaraces en Tinnudir.","Tham Andalath es la propiedad más alejada de Tinnudir. Lo que en su día fue una de las casas más opulentas de todo Evendim, ahora está profanada por los trasgos.","Espadas ornamentales conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las hojas sin filo también cortan","Tham Andalath se encuentra al noreste de Tinnudir y al este de Tham Ornen.\
\
Has encontrado un arma ceremonial en Tham Andalath y crees que deberías reunir más para llevárselas a los Montaraces de Tinnudir."},
[4440]={"As the men valiantly defend Brockbridge, they occasionally discard ineffective weapons and grab a new one to keep fighting. These dull blades now litter the ground throughout the town.","Discarded dull blades can be found throughout Brockbridge.\
\
Mula has asked you to sharpen the dulled blades that the defenders of Brockbridge have discarded.","'You might be able to lend us some aid.\
\
'We are running low on sharp swords! We have not a spare man to sharpen them, when we need more men who can swing them. If you have a moment, please take this whetstone and sharpen any dull blades you can find around the town.\
\
'When you have done this, return to Herefara for further instructions.'","Dulled by Wear and Tear","'I see that you have been busy helping around town. Your assistance is appreciated.  \
\
'It is now time that we work towards breaking through this siege.'","Sharpen discarded blades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Herefara is on the northern side of Brockbridge.\
\
Mula had instructed you to return to Herefara when you were finished.","Sharpened discarded blades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Herefara"},
[4441]={"'Deberíamos llevarte de regreso a Urmâkh. Ven, debemos difundir la buena noticia de tu victoria aquí.'","Investiga la parte trasera del campamento","Estantes de armas de orcos destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Orcos han establecido un campamento cerca del Tramo de Nâmbadir. Tu tarea es sabotear sus armas y derrotar a cualquiera que se interponga en tu camino.","Destruye los estantes de armas de orcos y derrota a los Orcos en Tharháth, cerca del Tramo de Nâmbadir.","Embotando las armas de guerra","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi","Algo grande ruge de ira al ser perturbado","Orcos derrotados en Tharháth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Investiga el ruido que proviene de la parte trasera del campamento.","Destruye los estantes de armas de orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Orcos en Tharháth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota al Devastador Utûgi."},
[4442]={"Hunt oxen in Anfalas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'That ought to be plenty of meat and bones for now. I'm sure my injuries will heal well before my next outing.'","Fresh injuries hinder Sadrech from hunting oxen for the people of Melgobas.","Talk to Sadrech at her camp","Sadrech has asked you to hunt oxen in Anfalas for parts.\
\
The Dun Ox herd north of her camp is also a good source of oxen.","Obtained ox parts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have obtained enough ox parts.\
\
You should return to Sadrech at her camp.","'I had originally come here to hunt for ox parts, but I doubt my aim will be true with these injuries. Those cursed Corsairs....\
\
'If you are able, would you hunt in my stead? Any ox will do, but there also ought to be a herd just north of us. I've enough coin to pay you for your efforts, and the people of Melgobas would be grateful.\
\
'Good hunting.'","Dun Ox Hunt"},
[4461]={"'Nuestros enemigos del sur se están volviendo más atrevidos. Tenemos que hacer frente a tantos adversarios en esta tierra, pero creo que, gracias a tus esfuerzos, estas tareas resultarán menos dolorosas de lo que lo han sido en el pasado. La llegada de esta noticia no me pesa, sino que me infunde una mayor esperanza.\
\
'Ahora sabemos que la Mano Blanca tiene planes para la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, así que podemos asignar una tarea para centrarnos en ellos. Gracias por mostrarme este mensaje, ${PLAYER}. Has actuado correctamente.'","El campeón de las Tierras Brunas","Las órdenes decían así:\
\
'Recorred las tierras de Eregion. No dejéis piedra sin remover. Acudid con vuestro campeón, Llygad, la Espada de los Dunlendinos, a la Escuela de Tham Mírdain y prestad ayuda a mis uruk-hai; allí debéis obtener todo el conocimiento que podáis y traérmelo'.\
\
Y así termina la misiva, breve pero inequívocamente clara. Si aún queda algún conocimiento que extraer de la sabiduría de Tham Mirdain, se debe informar a los Elfos de Echad Mirobel.'","Consigue órdenes de las Tierras Brunas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'A los dunlendinos que asolan Eregion se les ha ordenado saquear todo aquello que consideren de valor para quienquiera que esté detrás de las actividades de la Mano Blanca. Aunque las fuerzas se encuentran dispersas entre las ruinas de Eregion, hay un buen número de ellas que han sido enviadas a un lugar más concreto'","Echad Mirobel se encuentra en los confines suroccidentales de Eregion.\
\
Has encontrado unas extrañas órdenes relacionadas con el saqueo de la Escuela de Tham Mirdain, así como a un campeón de los dunlendinos que liderará este asalto contra la cámara del saber de los Elfos. Deberías llevar este mensaje a Echad Mirobel, donde es de esperar que alguien sepa qué significan.","Órdenes de las Tierras Brunas conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Gelirwen en Echad Mirobel"},
[4462]={"Dunlending patrols roam the road running south-west along the banks of the Isen.","'There are patrols running up and down the road along the Isen to the south-west of here.\
\
'As long as they can keep an eye on that road, it will be difficult for us to make a move in that direction without them knowing about it.\
\
'We are outnumbered badly enough as it is...we need the element of surprise where we can get it. If you could eliminate some of the outrider patrols on the road, I would greatly appreciate it.'","Dunlending Patrols","'Drive the Dunlending out of these lands!'","Grimbold is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
You should inform Grimbold that the Dunlending patrols have been eliminated.","'The patrols have been dealt with? Good. That will buy us some space to manoeuvre in if we are forced to defend Dol Baran in the coming days.'","Defeated Dunlending patrols (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen","Defeat Dunlending patrols (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dunlending outriders are patrolling the road along the Isen, south-west of the Rohirrim encampment.\
\
Grimbold has asked you to eliminate some of the Dunlending patrols in order to give the Rohirrim room to manoeuvre unseen."},
[4463]={"While fighting in the Dunbog, you discovered a man sitting under a tree. smiling and surrounded by Avanc-corpses.","Gwin can be found under the tree outside Lhan Rhos.\
\
Edhow asked you to tell Gwin that he will not provide him another sword.","'Well met, ${RACE}. I was just resting here for a moment after fighting these avanc! The trick to fighting avanc is to turn your ordinary fighting skills into extraordinary fighting skills!\
\
'You could do it as well, if you would put your mind to it. It really is not all that hard! Now, while I take a short nap, I need a favour. Go and tell Edhow that I am well, but I need a new sword. My last one broke in the gullet of that large avanc over there. \
\
'Do as I ask, and I will be in your debt.'","Talk to Edhow in Lhan Rhos","Dunlending Versus Dunbog","'Go tell Gwin that I have no help for him.'","Edhow is in Lhan Rhos, at the centre of the Dunbog.\
\
Gwin the Avanc-hunter has asked you to return to Lhan Rhos and fetch him a new sword from Edhow.","'You should speak with Edhow in Lhan Rhos.'","'Gwin sent you? Tell him that he has taken quite enough swords from me already. I am usually quite pleasant, but Gwin...he is always out in the bog trying to kill the biggest monster he can find to prove that he is the best hunter. Let us see how he survives without the best swords, perhaps then I will be impressed. \
\
'Tell him that if he really wants to be the best hunter, he will survive with his own two hands for once. You deliver that message for me, and hopefully I will have one less problem on my hands.'","Talk to Gwin in the Dunbog","'A challenge! I have not been challenged in quite some time. I will do it. Let me go prepare, and when you need me, look for this banner beside me, and I will be at your feet to help you!\
\
'Thank you for breathing life into an otherwise dull day.'"},
[4464]={"Dáin has asked you to go to the East Gate of Moria and feel the presence of the Balrog within.","'So? Were you held in the grip of fear while in the presence of that terrible creature?'\
\
You tell Dáin that you did feel great dread as you neared the East Gate. Visibly relieved, he lets out a great sigh.\
\
'I am glad to hear it, Hermáth. I had begun to fear my father's death had stolen away my courage! But if even you quailed before that monster, I was right to forbid entry into Khazad-dûm; you are one of our bravest warriors! To speak truthfully, I am fortunate the Balrog did not slay me where I stood! It held a whip of crackling flames, and I tell you it was likely long enough to reach me. The spirit of Nafni the Unslain must have protected me!'\
\
He sees your look of confusion at the mention of Nafni's name and epithet.\
\
'Hermáth, do you not know of the great Nafni? He is the only dwarf since the First Age to survive not one, but TWO encounters with a Balrog! I cannot allow this gap in your knowledge of history to continue. Have a seat, and let me tell you the tale.'","Dáin has begun to tell the story of Nafni the Unslain.\
\
You should talk to Dáin to hear his story.","Dáin continues the story of Nafni, now near its ending.\
\
'And so Khazad-dûm was abandoned. Thráin I became king, barely older than I am now, and eventually he led our people to Erebor. Nafni earned his title \\qThe Unslain\\q for surviving his second encounter with the Balrog, and he would become a wise advisor and trusted friend to King Thráin. He was a great and noble dwarf of Durin's Folk.'\
\
Dáin is pleased with his own recounting of the tale, but as his thoughts return to your present situation his face hardens and his eyes burn with anger.\
\
'Though Azog is dead and his Orc-army routed, a greater foe prevents us from reclaiming our lost kingdom. Though all the dwarf clans answer our call to battle, it will not be enough. No power among the mortal races will ever be enough....\
\
'Hermáth, I wish to be alone with my thoughts for now. Thank you for checking in on me.'","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","You have felt the same dread that Dáin did. Moria is not safe to enter!","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.","You should return to Dáin and inform him that you did indeed feel the presence of the Balrog inside the gates of Moria.","Dáin has a tale to tell about the Balrog he witnessed inside the gates of Moria; Durin's Bane.","Dáin has just about finished his story.\
\
You should talk to Dáin to hear the ending.","Durin's Bane and the Unslain","<rgb=#FF0000>Sit</rgb> and listen to Dáin's story","Talk to Dáin","'Forgive me: I am much better at cleaving Orc-skulls than I am at spinning tales. I will do my best.'\
\
Dáin clears his throat and begins his story.\
\
'In the year 1980 of the Third Age, Durin's Bane was unearthed in the Foundations of Stone. Nafni was there on that day, protecting Durin VI while the king treated his Elf-guests to a tour of Khazad-dûm's splendid mines. Durin fell to the Balrog's fury, but he ordered Nafni to survive and protect his son, Náin. And so he did, for Nafni was fleet of foot and was able to escape the terrible creature! He saw that fiend in all of its fiery terror... and lived. Upon hearing Nafni's recounting, Náin was enraged, and vowed revenge for his father at all costs.\
\
'The brave soldiers of Khazad-dûm tried to push the Balrog and the Nameless horde in its train back to the depths, but slowly, more and more of the kingdom was to fall. A year later, Durin's son, now King Náin I, gathered his forces and launched one final, desperate attack against the Balrog, slayer of his father and target of his vengeance....'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' to witness the events of Dáin's story unfold!</rgb>","Sit before Dáin and listen to the story of Nafni the Unslain.","Complete 'Discovery: The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","Dáin begins to tell the tale of The Fall of Khazad-dûm","Still shaken by the sight of the creature beyond the gates, Dáin squints at you as you approach.\
\
'Have you come to check on me, Hermáth? Hmph!'\
\
He grumbles but spares you an uncertain smile.\
\
'I always thought myself fearless. I have gone toe-to-toe with Orcs and trolls many times my size with nothing but the fire in my heart. But THAT foe... Durin's Bane! Standing in sight of just one such evil has shaken me to my core. Imagine an army of those fiends!\
\
'You do not think me a coward, do you? I know you for a fierce warrior, Hermáth. I would have you go to the East Gate and feel the monster's presence for yourself! Then, at least, I will know I am not alone in my fear.'"},
[4465]={"En la entrada secreta de Erebor, a la hora exacta del Día de Durin, se ha colocado una losa de piedra aparentemente común donde hace mucho tiempo se abrió una puerta. Un zorzal se posa sobre una piedra, como si estuviera esperando.","Examina la piedra","'Aquí, en el Día de Durin, Thorin II Escudo de Roble, Rey de los Barbiluengos, hijo de Thráin, nieto de Thrór, desbloqueó esta puerta,' comienzan las runas.","Has leído las runas inscritas en la piedra junto a la vieja puerta lateral de Erebor.","El Día de Durin en Erebor","El sol está a punto de brillar sobre una piedra forjada por enanos, que se encuentra frente a la antigua puerta secreta en el lado del Monte Erebor.\
\
Deberías acercarte y ver qué sucede con la piedra cuando el sol moribundo ilumina su cara.","'Cuando la esperanza era más baja, un rayo rojo del sol cayó sobre la lisa roca...'\
\
Te encuentras frente a la entrada secreta de Erebor, a la misma hora del Día de Durin que Bilbo Bolsón y la compañía de Thorin, hace mucho tiempo. La puerta secreta ha sido removida hace mucho tiempo, pero últimamente se ha colocado una losa de piedra aparentemente común frente a ella.\
\
Acércate y mira lo que sucede cuando el sol moribundo ilumina su cara."},
[4467]={"'You have done well, friend. Your efforts will be duly noted!'","Durthang: Army of the Pit","Defeat Uruks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Uruks.","Uruks derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Candúr","Talk to Candúr.","Defeat Uruks","Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Durthang: The Dark Spire to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"},
[4468]={"Defeat Orc Guards throughout Durthang in Udûn.","Defeated Mordor Warriors in Durthang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Mordor Archers in Durthang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Durthang: Lowering The Guards","Defeated many Orc Guards.","The guards standing watch and patrolling the fastness of Durthang are its first line of defence. Things would surely bode better for the forces of Gondor if that line were lowered.","Defeat Mordor Warriors in Durthang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Things will surely go better for the forces of Gondor now that the number of guards in Durthang has been lowered.","Defeated Mordor Archers in Durthang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","The guards standing watch and patrolling the fastness of Durthang are its first line of defence."},
[4469]={"Bring the orders to Candúr.","Collect orders.","Durthang: Order of the Pit","Collected orders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Just as I expected. Ugrukhôr was planning an attack against us! I am glad that you were able to hinder his plans. Still we must be watchful, as he may plan to retaliate.'","Collect orders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge las órdenes","Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Durthang: The Dark Spire to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Bring the orders to Candúr"},
[4472]={"Defeated Uruk Enforcers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Uruks and Sorcerers within the fastness of Durthang are like sharp talons and fell venom of Ugrukhôr's might. They instill fear and obedience, the one by force, the other by subtler means.","Defeated many enforcers and sorcerers.","The Uruks and Sorcerers within the fastness of Durthang are like sharp talons and fell venom of Ugrukhôr's might.","Defeat Uruk Enforcers and Black Númenórean Sorcerers in Durthang, in Udûn.","Defeated Sorcerers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Durthang: Talons and Venom","Defeat Sorcerers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ugrukhôr now has fewer sharp talons and venomous fangs to exert his might, thanks to you.","Completado","Defeat Uruk Enforcers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4473]={"Many foes await those who dare enter the fortress of Durthang, home to the Captain of the Pit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You ran out of time...","Durthang: The Dark Spire","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Azgazôr","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","'The time to strike the tower has come. Are you prepared to depart?'","'I am concerned with the tower of Durthang. Since we last spoke, more foes have gathered there. Perhaps the Captain of the Pit is preparing his forces for an assault against us?\
\
'I am not one to wait and see the outcome. We must strike Durthang now.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest. This quest can be completed with one or two adventurers.</rgb>","Defeated Azgazôr","Defeat Azgazôr.","'With the forces of Durthang lessened by your efforts, the threat of the Captain of the Pit has diminished once more. I thank you for your assistance.'"},
[4475]={"Busca a Glóin en su campamento en las estribaciones occidentales de las Montañas Nubladas, al norte de Rivendel, muy al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Dwalin quiere que lleves una advertencia a su amigo Glóin en las Montañas Nubladas. Cree que el aumento de la actividad de los trasgos podría no limitarse a los trasgos de Ered Luin.","La Preocupación de Dwalin","'Salve, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, quisiera tener un momento de tu tiempo, si lo permites. Tengo una solicitud que puede parecer fuera de lo común. Hace mucho viajé por las Montañas Nubladas con la Compañía de Thorin. Nos vimos en problemas en la entrada de una cueva en esas Montañas y terminamos en un lugar terrible lleno de trasgos.\
\
'Temo que el reciente aumento de trasgos aquí en las Montañas Azules, específicamente en Sarnur, pueda significar una mayor concentración de trasgos en toda la Tierra Media. He oído informes de que un amigo de aquella misma compañía está ahora en la zona, y esperaba que pudieras buscarlo y ver si ha observado algo respecto a los trasgos.\
\
'Su nombre es Glóin, y puede encontrarse en su campamento en las estribaciones occidentales de las Montañas Nubladas, muy al este de aquí, mas allá de las Tierras Solitarias y las Quebradas de los Trolls. Ve a buscarlo y adviértele sobre los cambios en el comportamiento de los trasgos aquí.'","Habla con Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas","'Sé veloz. Podría haber gran peligro en las Montañas.'","'Mi viejo amigo Dwalin envía palabras de preocupación. Ja.\
\
'Para ser sincero, sus preocupaciones están bien fundamentadas. Los trasgos aquí están tan agitados como los de las Montañas Azules... quizá mas. Hay noticias de que los Elfos bajo el cuidado del Maestro Elrond incluso han enviado exploradores para ver qué ocurre en los salones de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
'Tengo intención de investigar por mí mismo, pero los enanos aquí necesitan mi ayuda, pues los Duramano y sus aliados son nuestra principal preocupación. Aun así... podría merecer una investigación.'","Dwalin está preocupado por rumores que ha oído sobre agitaciones en las Montañas Nubladas."},
[4476]={"Recoge la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio","'${CLASS}, te ruego me disculpes, pero no tengo a nadie más a quien acudir en estos tiempos oscuros. Por favor, escúchame. Dwaling nunca ha sido un pueblo rico, pero siempre nos las hemos arreglado solos. Muchos de los mejores sopladores de vidrio de la Comarca vivían en estos agujeros. Mi padre antes que yo fue soplador de vidrio —el mejor de las Cuadernas del Norte y del Este— y yo aprendí el oficio de él.\
\
'Últimamente, las cosas han empeorado para nuestro pequeño pueblo. Con todas las criaturas salvajes rondando, la gente tiene verdadero miedo de las Tierras Fronterizas del norte. La mayoría se ha ido y ha vendido su propiedad desde que el comercio se detuvo. Un hobbit de la Cuaderna del Oeste envió cartas y contratos comprando agujeros y tierras hasta que se hizo con casi todo el pueblo... y ahí fue cuando comenzaron los problemas.\
\
'Solía llevar mis herramientas de soplado a un querido amigo que vivía en Dwaling, pero se mudó hace menos de una semana. Antes de irse juró que terminaría de arreglarlas. Si puedes, entra en Dwaling y mira si las dejó en el umbral de su agujero. Su hogar estaba en el lado norte del pueblo; las herramientas deberían estar en una bolsa o talega. Te estaría profundamente agradecido.'","Lleva la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio a Hob Cimacolina","'¿Has conseguido ya la bolsa? Dwaling está justo al norte de aquí.'","'Tienes las herramientas... muy bien. Ahora podré volver a trabajar.'","La bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio se encuentra en el umbral de un agujero hobbit en el lado norte de Dwaling.\
\
Hob Cimacolina te ha pedido que recojas una bolsa con herramientas de soplado de vidrio para él.","Hob Cimacolina está en su casa en el Prado del Toro Bramador en Dwaling, al sur de los Pantanos Arenosos.\
\
Debes regresar con Hob Cimacolina con la bolsa de herramientas de soplado de vidrio.","Las penurias de Dwaling","'La bolsa debería estar en el umbral de una casa en el lado norte de Dwaling.'","Has recogido la bolsa con las herramientas de soplado de vidrio","Las herramientas para soplar vidrio son únicas y requieren mucho mantenimiento. Un hobbit que vivía en Dwaling solía repararlas."},
[4477]={"Enano, interrumpido","Habla con Logi en la entrada de Iorvinas","'Encuentra al líder de los Duramano en Iorvinas y derrótalo cuanto antes. ¡No podemos permitir que bastardos como él mancillen el nombre de los Siete Padres!'","Angar Tripahierro derrotado","El líder de los Duramano debe estar en Iorvinas.\
\
Logi te ha pedido que derrotes al líder de los Duramano, que está intentando crear una alianza con los orcos.","Unos enanos que partieron a una expedición hacia el este se detuvieron para investigar unas ruinas, ya que sospechan que los Duramano y los Orcos han hecho un pacto.","'No podemos permitir que los Duramano sigan actuando... Apuesto a que tienen un líder, y que es él quien los empuja a aliarse con los orcos. ¡Hay que derrotar a ese bandido que avergüenza a los demás enanos!\
\
'Esta es la misión que te encomiendo. Busca a su líder, que debe estar escondido en alguna guarida. Elimínalo y vuelve a verme.\
\
'Comienza tu búsqueda en Iorvinas... Las ruinas serían un escondite ideal para un bandido de esta calaña.'","Derrota a Angar Tripahierro","Logi se encuentra a la entrada de las ruinas de Iorvinas.\
\
No te ha costado mucho derrotar al jefe de los Duramano. Ahora ya no deberían suponer ningún problema.","'Siento que la calma vuelve a mí. Es hora de poner en su sitio a esos malditos Duramano. Cuando pienso en lo que le hicieron a la Mansión de Thorin...\
\
'Los enanos te deben mucho, ${PLAYER}. Toma esto y recuerda que hoy has ganado un amigo y has hecho una buena acción.'"},
[4479]={"Has liberado a los enanos que iban a convertirse en la comida de los orcos en Uzbad-bakân.","¡La cena de los enanos!","Has descubierto que varios enanos habían sido capturados por los orcos y entregados a las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân... ¡para convertirse en la cena!","Libera a los enanos de su funesto destino (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Tras entrar en las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân, te encuentras con algunos prisioneros enanos. Han sido capturados por los orcos y arrstrados hasta aquí... ¡para convertirse en su cena!\
\
Deberías liberar a los prisioneros enanos de Uzbad-bakân antes de que sean devorados por los orcos.","Enano liberado (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Libera a los enanos prisioneros en las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Completado","Los enanos prisioneros se encuentran en la zona de la cocina de Uzbad-bakân, en el sur de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías liberar a los prisioneros enanos antes de que los orcos los cocinen para la cena."},
[4482]={"'Este hielo está perfectamente raspado, ${PLAYER}, y las bayas parecen estar maduras. Este Yule será maravilloso. ¡Lo presiento!'","'Buenas nuevas para ti, ${PLAYER}. La temporada de Yule es mi momento favorito del año, aunque el aire gélido pueda calar los huesos hasta la médula.\
\
'Los enanos disfrutamos de un postre tradicional en esta época del año. Puede que no te haga entrar en calor, pero aun así es un manjar muy apreciado entre mi gente. Por desgracia, he comido tanto que ya he agotado mis provisiones de ingredientes para preparar más. Necesito más hielo raspado y bayas de un arbusto en particular. Si pudieras reunirlos para mí, quedaría en deuda contigo, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Puedes encontrar ambas cosas alrededor del lago helado que se encuentra justo al oeste de las puertas de la Mansión de Thorin. Los arbustos de bayas deberían estar en una pequeña isla en el centro del lago. El hielo puedes astillarlo de una cascada helada en la esquina noroeste del lago.'","Hielo astillado de la cascada helada","Reúne bayas de los arbustos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Una bebida bien fría es el complemento perfecto para el frío del invierno!'","Bayas recolectadas de los arbustos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Imi prepara un famoso postre invernal que lleva hielo finamente raspado y el jugo de una baya especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva el hielo y las bayas a Imi","La cascada helada y los arbustos de bayas se encuentran alrededor de un lago helado al oeste de las puertas de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Imi te ha pedido que vayas hasta la cascada y recolectes algunas bayas de un arbusto específico alrededor del lago helado.","Imi se encuentra dentro de la Mansión de Thorin, cerca de la entrada principal.\
\
Imi estará complacido de ver que has recolectado varias bayas y algo de hielo astillado para los ingredientes de su postre.","Hielo Enano","Astilla hielo de la cascada helada"},
[4483]={"'Has regresado con las joyas enanas. ¡Espléndido!'","Los Enanos de las Montañas Azules son conocidos sobre todo por su artesanía en joyas y hierro.","'A tu servicio, ${CLASS}. Nosotros, los enanos, hemos trabajado largo tiempo bajo estas Montañas y hemos forjado muchas maravillas y bellezas, como sin duda puedes ver. Pero la pericia de los Enanos de la Mansión de Thorin no yace tanto en la piedra y la roca como en el tallado de gemas y la forja del hierro más resistente. Aunque, si somos sinceros, nuestro mayor orgullo descansa en la joyería que elaboramos, por encima de cualquier obra hecha con materiales más toscos.\
\
'Si me traes joyas enanas finamente trabajadas, podrías demostrar que eres alguien digno a los ojos de los Enanos de la Mansión de Thorin.'","Joyas Enanas — Introducción","Joyas enanas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La Guarnición de la Piedra Azul se encuentra justo dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ísrath te ha pedido que le traigas joyas enanas elaboradas.","'¿Has vuelto sin las joyas enanas? No tengo tiempo para artesanos ociosos. ¡Regresa cuando estén terminadas!'","Recolecta joyas enanas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las joyas enanas a Ísrath"},
[4484]={"Recoge un collar enano","'¿Regresas con las manos vacías? No te culpo; un collar de tal magnificencia no se encuentra con rapidez.'","Collar enano recogido","Collar Enano — Introducción","La Guarnición de la Piedra Azul se encuentra justo dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ísrath te ha pedido que le lleves un collar enano elaborado.","'¡Asombroso! ¡Simplemente asombroso! Has ganado un gran honor, ${PLAYER}.'","Los Enanos de las Montañas Azules son famosos sobre todo por su artesanía en joyas y en hierro.","'A tu servicio y al de tu familia, ${PLAYER}. Las joyas más finas de todo Eriador han sido forjadas por manos enanas en la Mansión de Thorin. Pero estas Montañas no entregan sus gemas de buena gana. Están llenas de hierro y carbón, y rara vez se encuentran piedras preciosas o metales de gran valor.\
\
'Existen algunos filones de una piedra enana muy preciada que recorren Eriador. No es común hallar siquiera una pequeña gema de calidad digna de ser trabajada, pero cuando una se descubre, es un espectáculo digno de verse. Cuando se engarza en un collar y se posa sobre el pecho, no hay ángulo que no le haga justicia. La gema brilla como Kheled-zâram bajo la luz de las estrellas y deposita un hechizo de belleza y admiración en todos los que la contemplan.\
\
'Si me trajeras uno de estos collares elaborados con piedra enana, gozarías de gran honor entre los Enanos de la Mansión de Thorin.'","Lleva el collar enano a Ísrath"},
[4485]={"'¿Aún no me has traído los anillos enanos? Un artesano de talento no solo sabe tener paciencia, ¡sino también completar el encargo que se le ha confiado!'","La Guarnición de la Piedra Azul se encuentra justo dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ísrath te ha pedido que le traigas anillos enanos elaborados.","Anillos enanos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los anillos enanos a Ísrath","'A tu servicio, . ${PLAYERNAME:Un aventurero[m]|Una aventurera[f]} de tu calibre sin duda apreciará la dicha que describo en la creación de anillos enanos. ¡Son verdaderas maravillas! Sí, cuando colocas un anillo enano de gran factura en tu dedo y ves cómo sus suaves curvas destellan a la luz de las antorchas, eso conmueve incluso al corazón más frío.\
\
'Te pediría que pruebes tu valía y me traigas cinco anillos enanos. Tal muestra probaría tu alianza con los Enanos de la Mansión de Thorin.","Anillos Enanos — Introducción","Recolecta anillos enanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hizo falta una mano experta para forjar estos anillos enanos. ¡Te felicito por tu éxito, ${PLAYER}!'","Los Enanos de las Montañas Azules son famosos principalmente por su artesanía en joyas y en hierro."},
[4486]={"Náth has asked you to hunt some of the local rams for meat.\
\
You should hunt the rams and collect goat meat.","Dwarves March On Their Stomachs","'I'm glad you're here with us, ${PLAYER}. Those hobgoblins won't know what hit them. I wish we could stop meeting in the coldest places on Middle-earth, though. Mordor is an abysmal place, and it can be cold there too... but not this cold!\
\
'While we're stuck up here, we need to ensure we have enough food stores to feed not just our own camp, but also the reinforcements that will soon be on their way. We hauled up the bare essentials, but morale will be low if we must subsist on only the dry rations in our bags. I saw some rams wandering near the cliffs, and I am sure they would be good eating! Would you mind hunting a few and bringing back some meat?'","Collected goat meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Náth has asked you to hunt some of the local game to shore up your camp's food reserves.","'Ah, you're back. How was the hunt?'\
\
You hand Náth the fruit of your labour. He carefully inspects it, sniffing it and examining the marbling of the meat.\
\
'Seems a bit tough and lean, but I'll wager I could make it into a decent stew! Thank you, ${PLAYER}! We'll eat well tonight!'","Talk to Náth","You have hunted the local rams and collected some of their meat.\
\
You should talk to Náth at Fellgát.","Collect goat meat from rams (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4487]={"Te has ganado el respeto de Ora, la jefa de los Lossoth, que ahora guiará más a fondo tu exploración de Forochel.","Habla con Thórth","'Bienvenido a Zigilgund. Soy Thórth.\
\
'Si ha sido Ora quien te envía, deduzco que has recorrido parte de las tierras de los Lossoth. Ella no confía con facilidad en los forasteros; cuando nuestra expedición pasó por allí por primera vez, hubo que insistir bastante para que siquiera nos permitiera plantar las tiendas en Pynti-peldot durante una ventisca.'","'He estado equivocado contigo, Sivullinen. Tus actos serán recordados aquí, y te brindaré mi ayuda. Si continúas hacia el oeste por la ruta principal llegarás a un campamento de los Kivi‑väki, al que llaman Zigilgund. Cerca de allí se encuentra el legendario cementerio de los norsu, un lugar que bien merece la visita.\
\
'Te convendrá hablar con Thórth, el líder de estos Kivi‑väki; parece tener un carácter firme.\
\
'Te deseo buena suerte, ${PLAYER}, y que tus viajes sean seguros.'","'Sigue la ruta principal hacia el oeste si deseas encontrar Zigilgund.'","'¿Zigilgund? Se encuentra al oeste. La forma más sencilla de llegar es seguir la ruta principal.'","Enanos y mamuts","Zigilgund se encuentra lejos, siguiendo la ruta hacia el oeste desde Pynti-peldot.\
\
Ora te ha sugerido que hables allí con un enano llamado Thórth."},
[4493]={"Cimitarra oxidada recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega las cimitarras oxidadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir cimitarras oxidadas.","Tarea de los Enanos de Erebor: Cimitarras oxidadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger Cimitarras oxidadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Cimitarras oxidadas de los Strongholds of the North.","Recoge cimitarras oxidadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Cimitarras oxidadas de los Strongholds of the North. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[4494]={"Lleva las armas de los orcos a Logi, en Iorvinas.","'Entonces, ¿has encontrado alguna pista? Espero estar equivocado, pero tengo un mal presentimiento...'","Armas de orcos recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Unos enanos que partieron en expedición hacia el este se detuvieron para investigar unas ruinas, ya que sospechan que los Duramano y los Orcos han hecho un pacto.","Enanos con armas de orcos","'Nos separamos de la expedición que se dirigía hacia el este para intentar averiguar qué hacen los Duramano en las Tierras Solitarias. Hemos visto orcos y enanos, ¡cuando francamente no hay nada aquí que pueda atraer a un enano!\
\
'Tememos que los orcos y los Duramano hayan formado una alianza, que estén trabajando juntos, que se suministren mercancías, herramientas y armas... ¡No podemos permitir que eso suceda!\
\
'Por favor, ve a las ruinas y mira si encuentras armas de hechas por orcos entre los Duramano en la zona oeste. Si encuentras alguna, tráemela, eso nos permitirá saber más.'","Los orcos y los Duramano se encuentran en los alrededores de Iorvinas, y Logi está en allí.\
\
Cuando descubrió que los orcos y los Duramano vivían muy cerca unos de otros, Logi comenzó a temer una alianza. Te ha pedido que busques pruebas de ello.","'¡Es increíble! ¡Los enanos y los orcos son enemigos por naturaleza! Esto nunca debería haber ocurrido. ¡Nunca! \
\
'Qué desgracia para nuestros primos... Una cosa está clara, debemos eliminar a su líder sin falta.'","Recupera armas de orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4495]={"Defeated treacherous spirits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dwelling in the Hills","Speak to the occupants of the dwelling","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.","Complete: Rot for the Fire","The child's lost toy must be somewhere nearby.\
\
You should search for the child's toy.","Find the child's toy","You have overcome the deception of the spirits housed within the forgotten watching-stone. Their purpose remains unknown to you, but you feel certain you must not underestimate the malice of this place.","Complete: Questionable Meal","Talk to the strange child","The toy crumbles to dust in your hand. Within lies a medallion of Sauron","A strange family lives in a ramshackle dwelling upon the slopes of the Morgul Vale.","Defeated the watching stone's grip on your mind.","The child looks around slowly before clearing his throat, as if he has uttered not a word in years.\
\
'My doll. I must have my doll returned. It is all I have. Where could it be? Find it, please.'","Return to the ramshackle dwelling","To your surprise, you spy a small cabin precariously resting in the hills of the Morgul Vale. It looks as if the cabin is occupied by a family, but is that not strange? Men have not lived in the Morgul Vale for many years. Perhaps it is worth investigating this ramshackle cabin and those who dwell there.","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the broken-down house.","Your vision now clear, you see it was no dwelling at all!","The child says nothing.","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.","Completado","The ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath.\
\
You should return to the broken-down dwelling to further your investigations.","Defeat the treacherous spirits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4496]={"'The water is already clearing up along the river. No doubt we shall have to return, but for today, the work is done.'","Dwergfant: A Rock and a Hard Place","Aldbéort is awaiting you at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that the Dwergfant is fully functional again.","'I have reports that the Limlight is beginning to have a distinctive odour. We have seen this before. The mechanisms within the Dwergfant have become damaged or impeded. They must be cleared before the river is truly fouled.\
\
'Head to the Dwergfant, discover what is broken with the mechanisms, and get them up and running again.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The impaired mechanisms can be found within the Dwergfant.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and repair the mechanisms within.","Repair mechanisms in the Dwergfant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Repaired mechanisms in the Dwergfant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Shall we set off to the Dwergfant?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Talk to Aldbéort","If the mechanisms within the Dwergfant do not work, the Limlight will be ruined."},
[4497]={"'The waters of the Dwergfant flow into the Limlight, then down through Stangard and into the Great River. Scouts have reported seeing creatures living within the ancient dwarf-structure: avanc and toads.\
\
'They must not be allowed to stay within it. Even if the Dwergfant is working perfectly, those creatures will foul the waters and destroy Stangard.'","'The waters are secure for now. I am sure more will come and settle back into the Dwergfant, but that is tomorrow's problem.'","Avanc and toads can be found at Dwergfant.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and defeat the avanc and toads found within.","Dwergfant: Foul Waters","Avanc and toads are polluting the Dwergfant.","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the avanc and toad population in the Dwergfant has been thinned.","Defeat avanc and toads in the Dwergfant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Defeated avanc and toads in the Dwergfant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Are you prepared to see a wonder of the dwarves, the Dwergfant?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Talk to Aldbéort"},
}
